window.TOEIC=[{"code":"11-1","title":"品質管理與產品開發：標準控制與客戶回饋 (Quality & Product Development)","ch":"Chapter 11　生產與營運","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch11-1 ～ Ch11-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch11-1 生產場景-品質管理與產品開發.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：樣品缺陷與產品召回協調","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：識別品質問題與檢驗不合格狀況","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"製造部工程師與Lisa經理溝通樣品批次未通過品質檢查的緊急狀況。多益聽力常在此處考「對話發生的背景狀況與首要問題」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Lisa, the product **failed the quality control check** due to **defects** in the **sample batch**.","zh":"Lisa，因為**樣品批次**中的**缺陷**，該產品**未能通過品質控制檢查**。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"That's concerning. What did the **inspection report** say about **compliance** with our standards?","zh":"這真令人擔憂。**檢驗報告**對於**符合**我們的標準是怎麼說的？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Failed the quality control check","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"未通過品質控制檢查","syn":"didn't pass inspection = non-compliant with standards","tip":"解題技巧　聽力中聽到 failed quality control check，選項常代換為 revealed quality issues（揭示品質問題）或 failed inspection（檢驗不合格）。","trap":""},{"w":"Defects","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"缺陷、瑕疵","syn":"flaws = imperfections = faults","tip":"解題技巧　de- (向下/否定) + fect (做) = 沒做好，即「缺陷」。","trap":""},{"w":"Sample batch","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"樣品批次","syn":"trial run = prototype batch","tip":"","trap":"多益聽力常考「樣品」與「出貨大貨」的區別。樣品有缺陷（defects in sample batch）不代表所有出貨產品都已損壞，但會引發預防性召回。"},{"w":"Inspection report","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"檢驗報告","syn":"examination document = audit findings","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Compliance","pos":"n.","zh":"符合、合規、遵守","syn":"conformity = adherence","tip":"注意事項　常與介系詞 with 連用（in compliance with / compliance with standards）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對技術規格與驗證流程","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"核對規格書（specification sheet）與原型機（prototype）的驗證程序。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"The **specification** doesn't match our criteria. Internal testing revealed issues with the **prototype's validation process**.","zh":"**規格**與我們的標準不符。內部測試發現**原型機**的**驗證流程**有問題。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Specification","pos":"n.","zh":"規格、規範","syn":"criteria = standards = technical details","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prototype","pos":"n.","zh":"原型、樣機","syn":"test model = first draft = experimental design","tip":"解題技巧　在產品開發（product development）中，prototype 指量產前的測試機，常用於驗證設計可行性。","trap":""},{"w":"Validation process","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"驗證流程","syn":"approval procedure = verification stage","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：採取補救措施、召回產品與檢查反饋","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出預防性召回（recall）不符標準的產品，並了解目前客戶的最新反饋（feedback）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"We need to **recall products** that don't meet safety standards. Have you checked **customer feedback**?","zh":"我們需要**召回不符合安全標準的產品**。你檢查過**客戶回饋**了嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, **customer reviews** have been **largely positive** regarding the design, but they mention **quality concerns**.","zh":"是的，**客戶評價**對於設計**大多是正面的**，但他們確實提到了**品質憂慮**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Recall products","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"召回產品","syn":"return items = withdraw products = request replacement","tip":"","trap":"召回是由於安全或品質問題，主動要求客戶退回商品，通常會提供免費更換（replacement）或退款。"},{"w":"Customer feedback","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"客戶反饋","syn":"review comments = client opinions","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Largely positive","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"大多正面、多數好評","syn":"generally favorable = mostly approving","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Quality concerns","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"品質疑慮/擔憂","syn":"defect issues = manufacturing flaws","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：安排複審會議以全面檢討","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認明日的審查會議（review meeting）時程，作為對話的具體結果。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Let's schedule another **review meeting** tomorrow.","zh":"讓我們明天再安排一次**評審會議**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Review meeting","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"評審會議、複審會議","syn":"evaluation session = audit panel","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Tomorrow","pos":"adv./n.","zh":"明天","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"注意對話中的時間標記。會議時間定在明天（tomorrow），而報告提交或全面檢討可能在不同日期（例如週五或下週一），切勿混淆。"}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：生產經理宣布品質檢驗與召回通知","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：通報品質控制檢驗失敗與缺陷細節","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"品管團隊主管召開緊急更新，通報產品因不合規（non-compliance）未能通過品管檢查。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Attention quality control team. This is an urgent update about our latest inspection results. The product **failed the quality control check** due to **non-compliance** with industry standards.","zh":"品管團隊請注意。這是關於我們最新檢驗結果的緊急更新。該產品由於**不符合**行業標準而**未能通過品質控制檢查**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Non-compliance","pos":"n.","zh":"不符合、未遵守","syn":"not following rules = failure to adhere to standards","tip":"解題技巧　non- (否定) + com- (共同) + ply (折/重疊) = 沒有重合在一起，即「不合規」。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：釐清合規失敗與缺陷數據","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"具體說明內部測試發現的原型機材料問題，並明確指出缺陷影響了 20% 的樣品。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Internal testing revealed problems with the **prototype materials**. The **specification sheet** shows these **defects affect 20% of our samples**.","zh":"內部測試發現了**原型機材料**的問題。**規格表**顯示這些**缺陷影響了我們 20% 的樣品**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Defects affect 20% of our samples","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"缺陷影響20%的樣品","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"多益 Part 4 極愛考「數據配對陷阱」。請牢記：「20% 影響的是樣品 (samples)」，切勿與 Part 7 閱讀中的「15% 影響手機單位 (units)」或「500 個召回單位 (units)」混淆！"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：指示啟動預防性召回與回收貨品","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"下令立即召回不符合安全標準的產品，以應對品質危機。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"We need to **recall products** that don't meet safety standards immediately.","zh":"我們需要立即**召回不符合安全標準的產品**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Immediately","pos":"adv.","zh":"立即、馬上面","syn":"without delay = right away = instantly","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：匯報客戶好評，並安排週五前提交報告與下週一全面檢討","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認客戶對公司快速回應好評，並指示品管團隊為明天的會議準備驗證標準。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"However, **customer reviews** have been **largely positive** regarding our quick response to feedback. Please prepare **validation criteria** for tomorrow's meeting.","zh":"然而，**客戶評價**對於我們快速回應反饋**大多是正面的**。請為明天的會議準備**驗證標準**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Validation criteria","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"驗證標準、審查準則","syn":"approval standards = testing requirements","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Tomorrow's meeting","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"明天的會議","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　明天的會議任務是討論「驗證標準 (validation criteria)」。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：品質控制部門致全體主管之產品召回與覆審報告","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣告部分出貨批次未通過安全標準","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"品質經理 David 寄發備忘錄，通知生產團隊關於智慧型手機因電池性能問題未通過品檢。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"To: Production Team | From: David Martinez, Quality Manager | Subject: Product Development Update and Quality Issues","zh":"致：生產團隊 | 自：品質經理 David Martinez | 主旨：產品開發更新與品質問題"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"I need to inform you about critical quality control findings from yesterday's inspection. Our latest batch of smartphones **failed the quality control check** due to battery performance issues.","zh":"我需要通知各位關於昨天檢驗中的關鍵品質控制發現。我們最新批次的智慧型手機由於電池性能問題而**未能通過品質控制檢查**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Critical quality control findings","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"關鍵品質控制發現","syn":"important audit discoveries = crucial inspection results","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Battery performance issues","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電池性能問題","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此處為多益 Part 7 閱讀的細節定位題，指明本次品檢失敗的具體原因。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對 15% 單位缺陷數據與 500 件出貨影響範圍","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"詳細說明合規失敗（compliance failure）的影響範圍，包括 15% 的手機未達標、需召回已出貨的 500 部手機，以及問題起因於供應商。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The inspection team found that **15% of units** did not meet our established standards for power consumption. This **compliance failure** requires **immediate attention**. Internal testing revealed significant problems with the **prototype's charging mechanism**. The **specification documents** indicate these issues stem from a **supplier's component** that doesn't match our criteria.","zh":"檢驗團隊發現，**15% 的單位**未達到我們既定的耗電量標準。這項**合規失敗**需要**立即關注**。內部測試發現了**原型機**充電機制的重大問題。**規格文件**指出，這些問題源於不符合我們標準的**供應商零件**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"15% of units","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"15%的單位/智慧型手機","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"數據記憶點：智慧型手機的「單位 (units)」缺陷率為 15%，而 Part 4 中的「樣品 (samples)」缺陷率為 20%，兩者對象與數字完全不同！"},{"w":"Compliance failure","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合規失敗","syn":"failure to meet specifications = non-conformance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Charging mechanism","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"充電機制","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為技術細節。","trap":""},{"w":"Supplier's component","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"供應商的零件","syn":"vendor's part = supplier's item","tip":"解題技巧　說明問題根本原因（root cause）在於外部供應商零件不符標準，而非內部設計。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：指示立即啟動召回流程，並要求週五前提交測試文件","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布將上週出貨的 500 部手機進行預防性召回與免費更換，並要求同仁在週五下班前提交測試報告。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"We have already initiated the **validation process** for alternative suppliers. Given these findings, we need to **recall products** that don't meet safety standards. **Approximately 500 units shipped last week** must be returned for replacement. Our customer service team is prepared to handle the recall process. Please **submit your sample testing reports by end of day Friday**.","zh":"我們已經啟動了替代供應商的**驗證流程**。鑑於這些發現，我們需要**召回不符合安全標準的產品**。**上週出貨的約 500 部手機**必須退回以進行更換。我們的客戶服務團隊已準備好處理召回流程。請在**週五下班前提交您的樣品測試報告**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Approximately 500 units","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"約500個單位/手機","syn":"around 500 devices = roughly 500 items","tip":"關鍵考點　此為召回的具體數量。","trap":""},{"w":"Shipped last week","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"上週出貨的","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間差考點。召回的手機是上週已出貨的 (shipped last week)，而不是本週或未來要出貨的。"},{"w":"Submit... by end of day Friday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"在週五下班前提交","syn":"provide before Friday 5 PM = turn in reports no later than Friday evening","tip":"解題技巧　此為提交測試報告的截止期限 (deadline)。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：訂定下週一全面檢討，並承諾保障客戶權益","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認手機的相機品質得到好評，並安排下週一進行品質程序的全面檢討。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"On a positive note, **customer reviews** have been **largely positive** regarding the phone's **camera quality** and **user interface**. This feedback confirms our design decisions were correct. We will conduct a **comprehensive review** of all quality procedures **next Monday**.","zh":"從好的方面來看，**客戶評價**對於手機的**相機品質**和**使用者介面** **大多是正面的**。此反饋證實我們的設計決策是正確的。我們將於**下週一**對所有品質程序進行**全面審查**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Camera quality and user interface","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"相機品質與使用者介面","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　多益閱讀常考「正面評價的具體細節」。客戶感到滿意的是相機（camera）與介面（UI），有疑慮的則是電池（battery）。","trap":""},{"w":"Comprehensive review","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"全面審查、完整檢討","syn":"complete examination = thorough evaluation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Next Monday","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"下週一","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間對比。週五下班前（Friday） 是提交報告的截止日，而下週一（next Monday） 才是進行全面審查會議的時間，千萬不要混淆兩者！"}]}]},{"code":"11-2","title":"設備與材料管理：維護採購與系統升級 (Equipment & Materials)","ch":"Chapter 11　生產與營運","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch11-1 ～ Ch11-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch11-2 生產場景-設備與材料管理.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：機器運轉緩慢與備用零件延誤","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：機器運轉速度落後與零件缺貨狀況","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"作業主管與Tom討論生產機器速度不如預期、備用零件缺貨導致生產延遲的狀況。多益聽力極常在此處考「機器設備的當前問題」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Tom, the machine **isn't running as fast as it should**. When was the **last maintenance check**?","zh":"Tom，這台機器**運轉速度不如預期**。上次**維護檢查**是什麼時候？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Last month. But we're waiting on materials from the supplier to fix the **malfunction**. The **spare components** haven't arrived.","zh":"上個月。但我們正在等待供應商的材料來修復**故障**。**備用零件**還沒有寄到。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Isn't running as fast as it should","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"運轉速度不如預期、運轉緩慢","syn":"operating slowly = not working at full speed = efficiency decrease","tip":"解題技巧　當聽到 isn't running fast as it should，題目常考「機器目前的問題是什麼」，選項會代換為 malfunctioning equipment 或 low output rate。","trap":""},{"w":"Last maintenance check","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"上次維護檢查","syn":"previous service inspection = regular upkeep check","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Malfunction","pos":"n./v.","zh":"故障、異常","syn":"breakdown = mechanical failure = technical problem","tip":"解題技巧　mal- (壞/錯誤) + function (功能) = 運作不正常，即「故障」。","trap":""},{"w":"Spare components","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"備用零件、備件","syn":"backup parts = replacement items","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：釐清故障造成的停機時間與採購優化需求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"評估故障維修延遲引起的嚴重停機時間（downtime），並指出需要優化採購與監控庫存。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"That's causing too much **downtime**. It's time to **replace the equipment** with an **automated system**.","zh":"這造成了太多的**停機時間**。是時候**更換設備**，改用**自動化系統**了。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I agree. Raw materials **procurement** needs to be **streamlined** too. Our **inventory is getting low**.","zh":"我同意。原料**採購**也需要被**簡化優化**。我們的**庫存快不足了**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Downtime","pos":"n.","zh":"停機時間、停止運作時間","syn":"stopped time = non-productive hours","tip":"解題技巧　工廠或IT場景中的停機時間是多益核心考點，常與產能下降（production delays）互為因果。","trap":""},{"w":"Replace the equipment","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"更換設備","syn":"change machines = install new equipment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Automated system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動化系統","syn":"automatic equipment = mechanized workflow","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Procurement","pos":"n.","zh":"採購、獲得","syn":"purchasing = buying process","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Streamlined","pos":"v./adj.","zh":"精簡、優化、效率化","syn":"simplified = made more efficient = optimized","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Inventory is getting low","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"庫存不足、現貨變少","syn":"running out of stock = low supply level","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：聯絡採購部門尋求更換與升級","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"主管指示立即聯絡採購部門（sourcing / purchasing）處理設備更換事宜。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Can you contact **sourcing** about getting a **replacement**? We need an **upgrade** soon.","zh":"你能聯絡**採購部門**取得**替代品**嗎？我們很快需要**升級**。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I'll **handle it right away**.","zh":"我會**立即處理**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Sourcing","pos":"n.","zh":"採購、尋找貨源","syn":"purchasing department = procurement division","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Replacement","pos":"n.","zh":"替代品、更換","syn":"substitute = new machine","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Upgrade","pos":"n./v.","zh":"升級、提升","syn":"update = modernization","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Handle it right away","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"立即處理","syn":"take care of it immediately = deal with it without delay","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：作業團隊緊急廣播","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：機器故障導致本週停機八小時","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"作業主管向團隊宣布設備問題，明確指出本週因機器故障已累積八小時的停機時間。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Good afternoon, operations team. I need to address our equipment situation. The machine **isn't running as fast as it should**, causing **production delays**. We're waiting on materials from the supplier to complete necessary maintenance. The **malfunction** has resulted in **eight hours of downtime this week**.","zh":"下午好，作業團隊。我需要說明我們的設備狀況。該機器**運轉速度不如預期**，導致了**生產延誤**。我們正在等待供應商的材料以完成必要的維護。這次**故障**已導致**本週八小時的停機時間**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Eight hours of downtime this week","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"本週八小時停機時間","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"數字配對考點。請注意，聽力廣播中明確指出故障造成的停機時數為八小時（8 hours），切勿與 Part 7 閱讀中的「延遲兩週 (2 weeks delay)」或「效率提升 40%」混淆。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：檢查庫存中的備件並為下月升級做準備","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"指示團隊檢查備用零件，並準備於下個月進行系統升級。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"It's time to **replace the equipment** with an **automated system** to prevent future issues. Raw materials **procurement** needs to be **streamlined** as well. Please check **spare components** in inventory and prepare for the **upgrade next month**.","zh":"是時候將設備**更換為自動化系統**以預防未來的問題了。原料**採購**也需要被**精簡優化**。請檢查庫存中的**備用零件**，並為**下個月的升級**做準備。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Upgrade next month","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"下個月升級","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"注意時間截點。廣播中說升級安排在下個月（next month），而在 Part 7 閱讀中升級項目的具體啟動日期則定為 10 月 1 日，解題時要看清是哪份文件的要求。"}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：營運總監致部門主管之設備升級備忘錄","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：主要生產機器故障且維修延遲兩週","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"營運總監 Michael Brown 寄發備忘錄，宣布由於等待供應商零件，維修工作已延遲兩週，造成顯著停機。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"To: All Department Heads | From: Michael Brown, Operations Director | Subject: Equipment Replacement and Materials Management","zh":"致：所有部門主管 | 自：營運總監 Michael Brown | 主旨：設備更換與材料管理"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Our primary production machine **isn't running as fast as it should**, affecting overall output. The maintenance team has identified several components requiring immediate replacement. Unfortunately, we're waiting on materials from the supplier, which has **delayed repairs by two weeks**. This **malfunction** has caused significant **downtime**, impacting our delivery schedules.","zh":"我們的主要生產機器**運轉速度不如預期**，影響了整體產出。維護團隊已確定有幾個零件需要立即更換。不幸的是，我們正在等待供應商的材料，這使得**維修延遲了兩週**。這次**故障**已造成了嚴重的**停機時間**，影響了我們的交貨時程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Delayed repairs by two weeks","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"維修延遲了兩週","syn":"two-week postponement = fortnight repair delay","tip":"關鍵考點　此為 Part 7 閱讀的核心數據題，考查因等待材料（waiting on materials）所造成的維修延誤天數。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：引進自動化系統以提升 40% 效率","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明更換為自動化系統的決策，並列出預期能減少未來維護需求、提升 40% 的運轉效率。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"After careful consideration, it's time to **replace the equipment** with an **automated system**. The new **automated equipment** will reduce future maintenance needs and **improve efficiency by 40%**. The **upgrade** will include state-of-the-art components and **spare parts** inventory management.","zh":"經過深思熟慮，是時候將設備**更換為自動化系統**了。新的**自動化設備**將減少未來的維護需求，並將**效率提升 40%**。這次**升級**將包含最先進的零件與**備用零件**庫存管理。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Improve efficiency by 40%","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提升40%的效率","syn":"performance improvement of 40% = 40% productivity boost","tip":"","trap":"注意數據配對。「40%」是效率提升百分比，絕對不能記錯成產能增加 40% 或成本下降 40%！"},{"w":"State-of-the-art","pos":"adj.","zh":"最先進的","syn":"most advanced = modernized = highly sophisticated","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：簡化原料採購策略，變更為多個供應商","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣佈重大的原料採購（procurement）優化策略，由單一供應商（single provider）改為與多個供應商（multiple suppliers）合作以保障供應。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Additionally, raw materials **procurement** needs to be **streamlined** to prevent future delays. We're changing our sourcing strategy to work with **multiple suppliers** rather than relying on a **single provider**. This will ensure consistent materials availability and reduce equipment downtime.","zh":"此外，原料**採購**需要被**精簡優化**以預防未來的延誤。我們正在改變我們的採購策略，轉而與**多個供應商**合作，而非依賴**單一供應商**。這將確保材料的持續可用性並減少設備停機時間。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Multiple suppliers rather than single provider","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"多個供應商而非單一提供者","syn":"diversified vendor base = working with several companies","tip":"解題技巧　採購優化策略的重點在於「供應商多元化」，用以降低單一零件商遲到引發的停機風險。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：項目於 10 月 1 日啟動並提供完整訓練","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認設備更換專案將於 10 月 1 日正式啟動，並承諾為同仁提供系統完整培訓（full training）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The **replacement project** will begin **October 1st**. Please ensure your teams are prepared for a temporary adjustment period. **Full training** on the new **automated system** will be provided.","zh":"**更換專案**將於 **10 月 1 日**開始。請確保您的團隊為暫時的調整期做好準備。我們將提供新**自動化系統**的**完整訓練**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"October 1st","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"10月1日","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為專案啟動日 (start date)，在 Part 7 閱讀多重選擇題中為重要定位線索。","trap":""},{"w":"Full training","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"完整培訓","syn":"comprehensive instruction = complete training course","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"11-3","title":"生產規劃與執行：排程管理與目標達成 (Production Planning)","ch":"Chapter 11　生產與營運","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch11-1 ～ Ch11-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch11-3 生產場景-生產規劃與執行.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：生產進度落後與夜班安排","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：產線落後三天與產能滿載狀況","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"主管與Mark發現生產進度已落後三天、產線滿載運轉（full capacity）的緊急瓶頸。多益聽力 Part 3 常在此處考「產線面臨的時程挑戰」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Mark, the **production schedule** shows we are **behind by three days**. What's happening on the **factory floor**?","zh":"Mark，**生產排程**顯示我們已**落後了三天**。**工廠廠房**發生了什麼事？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"The **assembly line** had issues yesterday. We need to **increase the production rate** to meet the deadline, but we're **running at full capacity**.","zh":"**組裝線**昨天出了問題。我們需要**提高生產速率**以趕上截止日期，但我們正以**滿載產能運轉**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Behind by three days","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"落後三天","syn":"three days delayed = behind schedule by 3 days","tip":"","trap":"注意各文件的落後天數變化：Part 3 對話中是落後 3 天；Part 4 廣播中是落後 2 天；Part 7 備忘錄中則是落後 5 天。多益聽力最愛考這種跨文章的數字混淆！"},{"w":"Factory floor","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"工廠廠房、生產車間","syn":"production area = assembly floor","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Assembly line","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"組裝線、裝配線","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　生產場景的核心場所，常與機械故障（malfunction）或進度延誤（delays）相聯繫。","trap":""},{"w":"Increase the production rate","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提高生產速率","syn":"speed up manufacturing = accelerate output","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Running at full capacity","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"滿載產能運轉","syn":"operating at maximum output = no room for extra load","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：審查季度配額與增班決策","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"討論增加額外班次，並審查本季預估配額（projected quotas）為 5,000 件的目標任務。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"What about **adding another shift**? The **projected quotas** for this quarter are **5,000 units**.","zh":"那**增加另一個班次**如何？本季的**預估配額**是 **5,000 件**。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That could work. Let me check the **workflow** and current **output figures**.","zh":"那可能行得通。讓我檢查一下**工作流程**和目前的**產出數據**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Adding another shift","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"增加另一個班次、增班","syn":"scheduling an extra shift = extending operational hours","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Projected quotas","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預估配額、計劃產量","syn":"expected goals = planned targets","tip":"","trap":"注意季度配額在各篇章中的數量遞增：Part 3 對話為 5,000 units；Part 4 廣播為 8,000 units；Part 7 備忘錄為 12,000 units。"},{"w":"Workflow","pos":"n.","zh":"工作流程、工作流","syn":"operational process = production sequence","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Output figures","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"產出數據、生產數量","syn":"production numbers = yield data","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：安排額外班次與優化產量","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認當前產量僅達到目標的 75%，Mark 承諾立即安排額外班次以推進進度。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good. **Production figures** indicate we're at **75% of target**. We need to improve.","zh":"很好。**生產數據**顯示我們僅達到**目標的 75%**。我們需要改進。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I'll **arrange the extra shift immediately**.","zh":"我會**立即安排額外班次**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"75% of target","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"目標的75%","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"達成率數據對比：Part 3 對話為 75%；Part 4 廣播為 80%；Part 7 備忘錄為 68%。"},{"w":"Arrange... immediately","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"立即安排","syn":"organize without delay = set up now","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：工廠大會緊急廣播","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：裝配延誤導致落後兩天","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理向全體工廠員工廣播，指出因組裝延誤，生產進度已落後兩天。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Good morning, factory team. I need to update you on our production status. The **production schedule** shows we are **behind by two days** due to **assembly delays**.","zh":"早上好，工廠團隊。我需要向各位更新我們的生產狀態。**生產排程**顯示，由於**組裝延誤**，我們已經**落後了兩天**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Assembly delays","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"組裝延誤","syn":"congested line issues = assembly line slowdowns","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：趕上下週五 8,000 件季度配額","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣佈下週五的截止期限，並明確季度配額目標為 8,000 件。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"We need to **increase the production rate** to **meet the deadline next Friday**. The **projected quotas** for this quarter are **8,000 units**, and we must reach this target.","zh":"我們需要**提高生產速率**，以**趕上大下週五的截止日期**。本季的**預估配額為 8,000 件**，我們必須達到這個目標。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Meet the deadline next Friday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"趕上大下週五的截止日期","syn":"finish by next Friday = adhere to the upcoming Friday due date","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"8,000 units","pos":"n.","zh":"8,000個單位/件","syn":"","tip":"關鍵考點　廣播中設定的配額目標數字。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：明日起增加夜班以提升產能","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"為了解決當前產量僅達 80% 目標的困境，宣布自明日起增加夜班。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Production figures indicate we're at **80% of target**, which means our output needs improvement. Starting tomorrow, we'll **add a night shift** to **boost capacity**. Please check the updated **workflow** on the floor.","zh":"生產數據顯示我們目前處於**目標的 80%**，這意味著我們的產出需要改進。從明天開始，我們將**增加夜班**以**提升產能**。請查看車間更新的**工作流程**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Add a night shift","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"增加夜班","syn":"schedule a late shift = operate during night hours","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Boost capacity","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提升產能","syn":"expand output potential = increase manufacturing volume","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：生產經理致主管之 Q3 生產規劃備忘錄","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：主裝線嚴重落後五天","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理 Jennifer Chen 指出，最新的審查顯示主要組裝線已大幅落後五天。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"To: All Production Supervisors | From: Jennifer Chen, Production Manager | Subject: Q3 Production Planning Update","zh":"致：所有生產主管 | 自：生產經理 Jennifer Chen | 主旨：第三季生產規劃更新"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Our latest review shows that the **production schedule** shows we are **behind by five days** on our main **assembly line**. This delay affects our ability to fulfill orders on time.","zh":"我們最新的審查顯示，主要**組裝線**的**生產排程**已經**落後了五天**。這次延誤影響了我們按時履行訂單的能力。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Behind by five days","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"落後五天","syn":"","tip":"關鍵考點　此為備忘錄（Part 7）中揭露的最嚴重落後天數。","trap":""},{"w":"Fulfill orders on time","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"按時履行/完成訂單","syn":"deliver orders on schedule = meet customer shipment dates","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：月底截止期限與 12,000 件季度配額","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"指出為了在月底前趕上最大客戶的訂單期限，必須克服目前產量僅達 68% 的嚴重落後，朝向 12,000 件季度配額邁進。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"We need to **increase the production rate** to **meet the deadline** for our largest client's order **by month-end**. The **projected quotas** for this quarter are **12,000 units** across all product lines. Currently, **production figures** indicate we're at **68% of target**, which is below our usual performance.","zh":"我們需要**提高生產速率**，以在**月底前** **趕上**我們最大客戶訂單的**截止日期**。所有產品線本季的**預估配額為 12,000 件**。目前，**生產數據**顯示我們僅達到**目標的 68%**，低於我們的常規表現。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"By month-end","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在月底前","syn":"before the end of the month = by the final day of this month","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"12,000 units","pos":"n.","zh":"12,000個單位/件","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　全產品線的 Q3 配額總目標。","trap":""},{"w":"68% of target","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"目標的68%","syn":"","tip":"關鍵考點　此為備忘錄中提到的最低目標達成率。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：實施夜班 (18:00 - 02:00) 補救計畫","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理下令立即採取三大行動方案，包括增設 18:00 至 02:00 的額外班次，並優化工作流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"To address these challenges, we will implement the following changes immediately: **Add an additional shift from 6 PM to 2 AM**; Increase assembly line output by optimizing the current **workflow**; Monitor daily **figures** more closely to track progress.","zh":"增加下午 6 點至凌晨 2 點的額外班次**；透過優化目前**工作流程**來提高組裝線產出；更密切地監控每日**數據**以追蹤進度。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"6 PM to 2 AM","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"晚上6點至凌晨2點","syn":"night shift hours = late-night block","tip":"解題技巧　此為額外班次（additional shift）的確切時間範圍，在 Part 7 的細節排除題中為極核心考點。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：要求週五前提交預測報告以確保目標達成","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認每位主管必須在週五前提交更新後的產量預測報告，以確保季度目標的達成。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Each supervisor must submit updated rate **projections by Friday**. With these adjustments, we should **meet our deadline** and achieve our quarterly targets.","zh":"每位主管必須在**週五前**提交更新後的速率**預測**。有了這些調整，我們應該能夠**趕上截止日期**並實現我們的季度目標。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Projections by Friday","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"週五前的預測報告","syn":"forecast reports by Friday = expected rate estimates by Friday","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"11-4","title":"營運設施與安全：擴建規劃與合規管理 (Facilities & Safety)","ch":"Chapter 11　生產與營運","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch11-1 ～ Ch11-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch11-4 生產場景-營運設施與安全.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：廠房擴建與安全規範更新","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：廠房擴建與安全規程更新需求","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"Susan 與主管討論工廠擴建 30% 產能，以及隨之而來的安全規程（safety protocol）更新與合規要求。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Susan, the factory is **expanding to increase capacity by 30%**. Have you updated the **safety protocol**?","zh":"Susan，工廠正在**擴建以增加 30% 的產能**。你更新**安全規程**了嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, all workers must **follow safety protocol** and wear **protective eyewear**. The **new regulations** require **additional certification**.","zh":"是的，所有工人都必須**遵守安全規程**並配戴**防護眼鏡**。**新法規**要求**額外的認證**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Expanding to increase capacity by 30%","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"擴建以增加30%的產能","syn":"factory expansion plans = adding production volume = thirty percent growth","tip":"","trap":"注意各文件的產能擴建比例變化：Part 3 對話為 30%；Part 4 廣播為 25%；Part 7 安全通知為 40%。"},{"w":"Safety protocol","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"安全規程、安全規範","syn":"security rules = safety regulations","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Protective eyewear","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"防護眼鏡、護目鏡","syn":"safety glasses = eye protection gear","tip":"解題技巧　工廠施工或擴建場景中，protective eyewear 是最常見的強制性防護裝備（PPE）考點。","trap":""},{"w":"New regulations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新法規、新規則","syn":"updated safety laws = modified guidelines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Additional certification","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"額外認證、附加證照","syn":"updated certification = further authorization","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：合規檢查時程與稽核準備","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認下週一的官方合規檢查（compliance inspection），並說明必須先完成危險稽核（hazard audit）與許可申請。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Good. The **official inspection** for **compliance** is scheduled for **next Monday**. Are we ready?","zh":"很好。官方的**合規** **正式檢查**安排在**下週一**。我們準備好了嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Almost. We need to complete the **hazard audit** and get the **permit** approved.","zh":"差不多了。我們需要完成**危險稽核**並取得核准的**許可證**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Official inspection","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"官方檢查、正式稽查","syn":"governmental examination = authorized site review","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Compliance","pos":"n.","zh":"合規、符合規定","syn":"following rules = adhering to standards","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Next Monday","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"下週一","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"注意各文章的檢查日期對比：Part 3 對話為 next Monday；Part 4 廣播為 October 15th；Part 7 安全通知為 November 20th。"},{"w":"Hazard audit","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"危險稽核、安全漏洞評估","syn":"danger examination = risk assessment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Permit","pos":"n.","zh":"許可證、准許證","syn":"written authorization = official approval document","tip":"注意事項　動詞為 permit [v.] 允許，但在本場景中作為名詞 [n.] 表示實體證件。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：設定安全優先與明天進行團隊簡報","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"重申安全第一原則，Susan 承諾明天對全體同仁進行安全簡報（brief the team）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"**Workplace safety** and cleanliness are our **top priorities**. Any emergency procedures updated?","zh":"**工作場所安全**與清潔是我們的**首要任務**。有更新任何緊急程序嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Everything's ready. I'll **brief the team tomorrow**.","zh":"一切都準備好了。我**明天會向團隊簡報**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Workplace safety","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"工作場所安全、職場安全","syn":"job site security = occupational safety","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Top priorities","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"首要任務、最優先事項","syn":"primary concerns = most important issues","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Brief the team tomorrow","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"明天向團隊簡報/通知團隊","syn":"inform the staff tomorrow = give update to workers tomorrow","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：全體員工安全廣播","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布下一季擴建 25% 計畫","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"廣播宣布下一季工廠擴建 25% 的產能計畫，並強調安全裝備要求。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Attention all staff. This safety update concerns our expansion plans. The factory is **expanding to increase capacity by 25%** starting next quarter. All workers must **follow safety protocol** and wear **protective eyewear** in designated areas.","zh":"全體員工請注意。這項安全更新攸關我們的擴建計畫。工廠將從下一季開始**擴建以增加 25% 的產能**。所有工人必須在指定區域內**遵守安全規程**並配戴**防護眼鏡**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"25%","pos":"n.","zh":"百分之二十五","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　廣播中說明的下一季產能擴充數值。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：10 月 15 日合規檢查與操作員認證","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"通報合規檢查日期定於 10 月 15 日，並指出新法規要求設備操作員必須取得更新認證。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The **official inspection** for **compliance** is scheduled for **October 15th**. New regulations require **updated certification** for all equipment operators.","zh":"**合規**的**正式檢查**安排在 **10 月 15 日**。新法規要求所有設備操作員必須取得**更新的認證**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"October 15th","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"10月15日","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　廣播中設定的合規稽查截止日。","trap":""},{"w":"Updated certification","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"更新的認證/執照","syn":"renewed licenses = refreshed credentials","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：複審緊急程序與完成危險培訓","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"指示同仁審查緊急程序、完成危險培訓（hazard training）並申請必要的許可。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"**Workplace safety** and cleanliness are our **top priorities** during this transition. Please review the emergency procedures and complete your **hazard training**. Remember, **permits** are required for any workplace modifications.","zh":"在此過渡期間，**工作場所安全**與清潔是我們的**首要任務**。請複審緊急程序並完成您的**危險培訓**。請記住，進行任何工作場所修改都需要**許可證**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Hazard training","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"危險培訓、安全訓練","syn":"danger prevention instruction = safety compliance training","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：安全總監致全體員工之擴建安全通知","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布六個月內擴建 40% 產能","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"安全總監 Rachel Kim 發布通知，宣布工廠將在未來六個月內擴建 40% 的產能，並要求在施工區嚴格遵守安全規程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"To: All Employees | From: Rachel Kim, Safety Director | Subject: Facility Expansion and Safety Requirements","zh":"致：全體員工 | 自：安全總監 Rachel Kim | 主旨：設施擴建與安全要求"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The factory is **expanding to increase capacity by 40%** over the next **six months**. This expansion will require strict adherence to new safety protocols and regulations. All workers must **follow safety protocol** and wear **protective eyewear** at all times in construction zones.","zh":"工廠將在接下來的**六個月內** **擴建以增加 40% 的產能**。這次擴建將需要嚴格遵守新的安全規程和法規。所有工人在施工區域內必須隨時**遵守安全規程**並配戴**防護眼鏡**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"40%","pos":"n.","zh":"百分之四十","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　安全通知（Part 7）中明確指出的最終擴充產能比例。","trap":""},{"w":"Six months","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"六個月","syn":"half a year = 6-month duration","tip":"","trap":"時程細節題。產能增加將在「六個月內（over the next six months）」完成。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：11 月 20 日合規檢查與更新證照","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"通報官方合規檢查定於 11 月 20 日，各部門必須在此之前完成證照更新（certification renewals）與危險評估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The **official inspection** for **compliance** is scheduled for **November 20th**. Before this date, all departments must complete their **certification renewals** and hazard assessments.","zh":"**合規**的**正式檢查**安排在 **11 月 20 日**。在此日期之前，所有部門必須完成他們的**認證更新**和危險評估。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"November 20th","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"11月20日","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　Part 7 閱讀中的合規稽查截止日。","trap":""},{"w":"Certification renewals","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證更新、證照展延","syn":"license extensions = renewing credentials","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：11 月 10 日安全簡報，違者將暫停進出權限","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布將於 11 月 10 日下午 2 點舉辦強制性安全簡報會議，無故缺席者將被「暫停進入廠房的權限」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Please attend the **mandatory safety briefing** on **November 10th at 2 PM** in the main conference room. Failure to attend will result in **suspension of workplace access privileges**.","zh":"請參加於 **11 月 10 日下午 2 點**在主會議室舉辦的**強制性安全簡報**。未能參加者將導致**暫停其工作場所進入權限**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Mandatory safety briefing","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"強制性安全簡報/會議","syn":"compulsory safety meeting = required security briefing","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"November 10th at 2 PM","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"11月10日下午2點","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　強制性安全簡報的確切時間。","trap":""},{"w":"Suspension of workplace access privileges","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"暫停進入工作場所的特權/權限","syn":"denial of building entry = temporary loss of access rights","tip":"","trap":"此為嚴重後果考點，常在 Part 7 閱讀題中考「若員工不參加簡報，會面臨什麼懲罰」。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：提供安全辦公室分機 3344 以供洽詢","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"重申安全優先與零容忍政策，並公佈安全辦公室分機號碼（extension 3344）以供同仁諮詢。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"**Workplace safety** and cleanliness are our **top priorities** throughout this expansion. We have zero tolerance for safety violations. For questions about specific protocols or certification requirements, contact the safety office at **extension 3344**.","zh":"在整個擴建過程中，**工作場所安全**與清潔是我們的**首要任務**。我們對違反安全規定的行為實施零容忍。若有關於特定規程或認證要求的問題，請聯絡安全辦公室，分機號碼為 **3344**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Extension 3344","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"分機3344","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　詢問特定認證問題時的聯絡管道電話分機。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"11-5","title":"成本效益與產品上市：預算管理與行銷策略 (Cost & Launch)","ch":"Chapter 11　生產與營運","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch11-1 ～ Ch11-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch11-5 生產場景-成本效益與產品上市.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：生產成本增加與新進員工培訓","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：生產成本增加 15% 與利潤率受影響狀況","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理與 Robert 討論本季生產成本增加 15%，以及此增加對產品利潤率（profit margin）和市場現況的衝擊。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Robert, **production costs have increased by 15%** this quarter. How will this affect our **profit margin**?","zh":"Robert，這季我們的**生產成本增加了 15%**。這將如何影響我們的**利潤率**？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"It's concerning. We're launching a new product line next month, but the budget for advertising might need adjustment.","zh":"這真令人擔憂。我們下個月將推出新的產品線，但廣告預算可能需要調整。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Production costs have increased by 15%","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"生產成本增加了15%","syn":"expenses went up by 15% = manufacturing costs increased","tip":"","trap":"注意各文件的成本增幅變化：Part 3 對話為 15%；Part 4 廣播為 20%；Part 7 公告為 18%。"},{"w":"Profit margin","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"利潤率、淨利率","syn":"earnings ratio = net profit percentage","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：審查行銷策略與調整廣告預算","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"討論行銷活動聚焦於效率特色（efficiency features），並權衡是否需要縮減推廣投資。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"The **marketing campaign** will focus on **efficiency features**. Should we reduce the **promotion investment**?","zh":"**行銷活動**將聚焦於**效率特色**。我們應該減少**推廣投資**嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Let's **review the strategy** first. The training program for new employees takes two weeks. We need them ready for the release.","zh":"讓我們首先**審查策略**。新員工的培訓計畫需要兩週。我們需要他們為產品發布做好準備。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Marketing campaign","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"行銷活動、宣傳企劃","syn":"promotion effort = advertising drive","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Efficiency features","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"效率特色、效能優勢","syn":"energy-saving performance = high-productivity functions","tip":"解題技巧　此為對話中行銷活動的核心賣點。","trap":""},{"w":"Promotion investment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"推廣投資、促銷資金","syn":"advertising budget = publicity funds","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Review the strategy","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"審查策略、檢視計畫","syn":"examine the plan = evaluate the marketing strategy","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：安排新員工進行兩週培訓","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認新員工需要兩週（two weeks）的培訓期，以配合關鍵的新產品上市時程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"I agree. The market conditions are challenging, but this launch is crucial.","zh":"我同意。雖然市場狀況充滿挑戰，但這次上市至關重要。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I'll prepare a **revised budget** for tomorrow's meeting.","zh":"我會為明天的會議準備一份**修訂預算**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Training program... takes two weeks","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"培訓計畫需要兩週","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"培訓時長對比。請注意：Part 3 對話為 two weeks；Part 4 廣播為 three days；Part 7 公告為 ten days。多益常在此時長數據上設陷阱！"},{"w":"Revised budget","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"修訂預算、修正後預算案","syn":"adjusted financial plan = modified funding allocation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：產品發布管理報告","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：生產成本增加 20% 影響利潤","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"發言人向團隊通報由於本季生產成本激增 20%，面臨嚴重的利潤壓縮，但仍按計畫於下週推出新產品線。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Good morning, team. Let me update you on our product launch plans. **Production costs have increased by 20%** this quarter, affecting our **profit margins**. We're launching a new product line next week despite these challenges.","zh":"早上好，團隊。讓我向各位更新我們的產品上市計畫。本季**生產成本增加了 20%**，影響了我們的**利潤率**。儘管面臨這些挑戰，我們仍將在下週推出新的產品線。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Production costs have increased by 20%","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"生產成本增加了20%","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　廣播中說明的本季成本增幅數值。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：確定 200 萬美元廣告預算與三天員工培訓","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認新員工培訓需要三天，並宣佈維持 200 萬美元（$2 million）廣告預算不變。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The **marketing campaign** will focus on innovative design to justify our investment. The **training program** for new employees takes **three days**, starting tomorrow. Our **advertising budget** remains unchanged at **$2 million**.","zh":"**行銷活動**將聚焦於創新設計，以證明我們的投資是合理的。新員工的**培訓計畫**需要**三天**，從明天開始。我們的**廣告預算**維持不變，仍為 **200 萬美元**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Three days","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"三天","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　廣播中設定的快速培訓期長度。","trap":""},{"w":"Advertising budget remains unchanged at $2 million","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"廣告預算維持不變在200萬美元","syn":"publicity funding remains at 2 million = unchanged marketing spend","tip":"","trap":"預算數字混淆：廣播（Part 4）中「廣告預算 (advertising budget)」是 200 萬美元；而公告（Part 7）中「推廣預算 (promotion budget)」則是 150 萬美元，總投資為 500 萬美元。必須分清預算的具體類別！"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：聚焦於高效率與市場領導地位宣傳","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"行動方案著重於強調效率（efficiency）與市場領導（market leadership）的推廣宣傳。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The **promotion strategy** emphasizes **efficiency** and **market leadership**. Please prepare for the **official release on Monday**.","zh":"**推廣策略**強調**效率**與**市場領導地位**。請為**週一的正式發布**做好準備。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Official release on Monday","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"週一的正式發布","syn":"launch date on Monday = product rollout next Monday","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：行銷長致全體同仁之產品上市策略公告","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：原料波動導致成本上揚 18% 及 500 萬總投資","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"行銷長 Linda Chen 寄發內部公告，指出由於原料價格波動，本季生產成本上揚 18%，但利潤目標不變，董事會已核准 500 萬美元的上市總投資。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"To: All Marketing and Sales Staff | From: Linda Chen, Chief Marketing Officer | Subject: Product Launch Strategy and Cost Management","zh":"致：所有行銷與銷售同仁 | 自：行銷長 Linda Chen | 主旨：產品上市策略與成本管理"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"**Production costs have increased by 18%** this quarter due to raw material price fluctuations. Despite this challenge, our **profit margin** targets remain unchanged. The board has approved a **total investment of $5 million** for this launch.","zh":"由於原料價格波動，本季**生產成本增加了 18%**。儘管面臨這項挑戰，我們的**利潤率**目標仍維持不變。董事會已核准了本次上市的**總投資額 500 萬美元**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"18%","pos":"n.","zh":"百分之十八","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　Part 7 閱讀中所寫的特定成本增幅。","trap":""},{"w":"Total investment of $5 million","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"總投資額500萬美元","syn":"overall funding of 5 million = five-million-dollar total allocation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：劃分 150 萬推廣與 60% 廣告比例","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"明確將推廣預算（promotion budget）設定為 150 萬美元，並規定其中的 60% 用於廣告費用。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"We're launching a new product line next quarter, specifically in July. The **marketing campaign** will focus on **sustainability features**. Our **promotion budget** has been set at **$1.5 million**, with **advertising costs accounting for 60% of this amount**.","zh":"我們將於下一季（特別是在七月）推出新產品線。**行銷活動**將聚焦於**永續特色**。我們的**推廣預算**已設定為 **150 萬美元**，其中**廣告費用佔此金額的 60%**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Sustainability features","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"永續特色、環保綠色優勢","syn":"eco-friendly functions = green characteristics","tip":"","trap":"注意各文件行銷活動的焦點差異：Part 3 對話聚焦於 efficiency（效率）；Part 4 廣播聚焦於 innovative design（創新設計）；Part 7 閱讀則聚焦於 sustainability（永續環保）。"},{"w":"Promotion budget... $1.5 million","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"推廣預算150萬美元","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　推廣預算的具體數字。","trap":""},{"w":"Advertising costs accounting for 60%","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"廣告費用佔60%","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　廣告費用在推廣預算中所佔的比例。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：招募 50 名員工與十天培訓期","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布擴大招募 50 名新員工（additional staff）以支援上市，並為他們安排十天的完整訓練課程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The **training program** for new employees takes **ten days**, and we're hiring **50 additional staff** to support the launch. This investment in human resources is crucial for maintaining our efficiency standards.","zh":"新員工的**培訓計畫**需要**十天**，我們正在招聘 **50 名額外員工**以支援本次上市。這項人力資源投資對於維持我們的效率標準至關重要。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Ten days","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"十天","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　備忘錄中設定的長天數培訓計畫。","trap":""},{"w":"50 additional staff","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"50名額外員工","syn":"fifty new hires = 50 extra personnel = hiring 50 more workforce","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：7 月 15 日正式發布與 6 月 1 日預購","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"訂定 7 月 15 日為產品正式發布日，並宣布自 6 月 1 日起開放客戶預購（pre-orders）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The expected release date is **July 15th**, with **pre-orders** beginning **June 1st**. All departments must align their efforts to maximize the impact of this campaign. Please attend the strategy briefing on **April 20th at 10 AM**.","zh":"預計發布日期為 **7 月 15 日**，**預購**將於 **6 月 1 日**開始。所有部門必須協調一致，以最大化此活動的影響力。請參加於 **4 月 20 日上午 10 點**舉辦的策略簡報會。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Pre-orders beginning June 1st","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"6月1日開始預購","syn":"advance sales starting June 1 = booking orders in advance from June 1st","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"July 15th","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"7月15日","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為正式發布/推出日期 (official launch date)。","trap":""},{"w":"April 20th at 10 AM","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"4月20日上午10點","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　策略簡報會（strategy briefing）召開的時間。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"13-1","title":"系統應用與設備管理：IT升級溝通 (System Applications & Equipment Management)","ch":"Chapter 13　技術領域","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch13-1 ～ Ch13-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch13-1 技術領域場景-系統應用與設備管理.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：系統升級平台與設備更新","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解系統升級需求與時程","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"IT人員與同仁溝通新平台的升級時程（下週推出）與安全功能，為 Part 3 開頭的必考來電目的題。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, IT department. I heard our team plans to **launch** the **upgraded platform** with **enhanced security features** next week. Is the new hardware ready?","zh":"早上好，IT 部門。我聽說我們團隊計劃在下週推出具有**增強安全功能**的**升級平台**。新硬體準備好了嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Launch","pos":"v.","zh":"推出、發表、發行","syn":"release = roll out = unveil","tip":"","trap":"聽力中常考 launch 的計劃時間（next week），此字在對白中發音常與 lunch 混淆，請注意情境。"},{"w":"Upgraded platform","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"升級平台","syn":"modernized platform = new system setup","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Enhanced security features","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"增強的安全功能","syn":"improved security measures = strengthened protection protocols","tip":"詞首字根　en- (使動) + hance (高/提升) = 提高、增強。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：硬體更換、安裝與周邊連線障礙","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"指出硬體更換的安裝進度，並揭示「印表機和掃描器等周邊設備無法與雲端儲存同步」的任務阻礙。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Almost. We've completed the **software installation** on all computers, but there's an issue with the wireless network configuration. The printer and scanner aren't connecting properly to the **cloud storage** system.","zh":"差不多了。我們已經完成了所有電腦的**軟體安裝**，但無線網路配置出現了問題。印表機和掃描器無法正常連接到**雲端儲存**系統。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Software installation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"軟體安裝","syn":"software setup = program deployment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Cloud storage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"雲端儲存","syn":"online server storage = virtual backup storage","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Printer and scanner","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"印表機與掃描器（周邊設備）","syn":"peripheral devices = hardware accessories","tip":"","trap":"多益聽力選項常以 computers 或 laptops 混淆。請注意，無法連線的是印表機與掃描器等周邊設備（peripherals），電腦與筆電連線一切正常（connect fine）。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：更換生物識別讀取器與驅動程式更新","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出行動解決方案（各部門收到生物識別讀取器以改善門禁控制），並討論更新設備驅動程式的技術嘗試。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"That's concerning. Each department will receive new **biometric readers** for improved **access control**, and they need to sync with our database. Have you tried updating the device drivers?","zh":"這很令人擔憂。每個部門都將收到新的**生物識別讀取器**以改善**門禁控制**，而且它們需要與我們的資料庫同步。你嘗試過更新裝置驅動程式嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, but the equipment still shows errors. This **diagnostic tool** can analyze network performance across multiple locations, so I'm running tests now. The laptops connect fine, but **peripheral devices** have problems.","zh":"有的，但設備仍然顯示錯誤。這個**診斷工具**可以分析多個地點的網路效能，所以我現在正在進行測試。筆記型電腦連接正常，但**周邊裝置**有問題。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Biometric readers","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"生物識別讀取器","syn":"fingerprint/facial scanners = enhanced authentication devices","tip":"解題技巧　考點延伸　生物識別讀取器是用來取代過時的「密碼式門禁（outdated password-based access）」。","trap":""},{"w":"Access control","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"門禁控制、存取控制","syn":"entry permission = security authorization","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Diagnostic tool","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"診斷工具","syn":"network analysis software = troubleshooting tool","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Peripheral devices","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"周邊裝置","syn":"external hardware = auxiliary machines","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：備份系統準備與外部聯絡","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確定後續行動，女士將聯繫應用程式供應商（vendor），並要求男士準備備份系統以防升級失敗。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"I'll contact the application vendor. Meanwhile, can you prepare a **backup system** in case the update fails?","zh":"我會聯繫應用程式供應商。同時，你能準備一個**備份系統**以防更新失敗嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Vendor","pos":"n.","zh":"供應商、廠商","syn":"supplier = merchant = provider","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Backup system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"備份系統","syn":"redundancy system = safeguard mechanism","tip":"","trap":"請記住，聯絡廠商（contact vendor）是女士（woman）的行動，而準備備份系統（prepare backup）則是男士（man）要執行的任務。"}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：IT 部門午夜系統升級公告","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布升級時程與範圍","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"系統升級通知公告。宣布系統升級將於明日午夜（midnight tomorrow）進行。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Attention all staff. This is a reminder about tomorrow's system update. Our team plans to launch the upgraded platform with enhanced security features at **midnight**.","zh":"各位同仁請注意。這是關於明天系統更新的提醒。我們團隊計劃在**午夜**推出具有增強安全功能的**升級平台**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Midnight","pos":"n.","zh":"午夜（12:00 AM）","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"聽力中聽到 tomorrow's system update at midnight 代表明天的午夜，絕對不等於「今天晚上（tonight）」。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：檔案儲存指令與升級影響範圍","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"指示同仁在今天下班前（before leaving today）將所有工作檔案儲存至雲端，並明確說明硬體影響範圍。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Please save all work to cloud storage **before leaving today**. The installation will **affect** every computer, laptop, printer, and scanner in the building.","zh":"請在今天下班前將所有工作儲存至**雲端儲存**。安裝程序將影響大樓內的每台電腦、筆記型電腦、印表機和掃描器。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Before leaving today","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"今天下班前","syn":"by the end of the day = before departure","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Affect","pos":"v.","zh":"影響","syn":"impact = influence","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：設備分發與連線配置","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出本週五前（by Friday）分發新生物識別讀取器，並透過診斷工具分析多個地點的網路效能。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Each department will receive new biometric readers for improved access control **by Friday**. These devices will connect to our central database through the wireless network. This diagnostic tool can analyze network performance across multiple locations, which we'll use to **monitor the transition**.","zh":"每個部門將在週五前收到新的**生物識別讀取器**，以改善門禁控制。這些裝置將透過無線網路連接到我們的中央資料庫。這個**診斷工具**可以分析多個地點的網路效能，我們將用它來監控這個過渡期。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"By Friday","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"週五前","syn":"no later than Friday = on or before Friday","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Monitor the transition","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"監控過渡期/轉換過程","syn":"track the migration = observe the phase","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：完工時間與異常回報要求","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認更新將於早上 6 點（by 6 AM）完成，並重申同仁應於明天早上遇到設備錯誤時立即備份並聯繫 IT。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"The software and hardware upgrades should be **complete by 6 AM**. If any equipment shows errors tomorrow morning, contact IT immediately. Remember to backup your applications before the update begins.","zh":"軟硬體升級預計在早上 6 點前完成。如果明天早上有任何設備顯示錯誤，請立即聯絡 IT。請記住，在更新開始前**備份**您的應用程式。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Complete by 6 AM","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在早上 6 點前完成","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　by 帶有截至（no later than）的概念，常用於表達時程完工界線。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：IT 總監的設備升級時程表備忘錄","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布總部系統改造計畫","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"備忘錄的主旨，宣布將於 4 月 20 日進行重大系統改造（system overhaul），使基礎設施現代化。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"To: All Department Managers / From: Kevin Liu, IT Director / Date: April 5 / Subject: Equipment Upgrade Schedule","zh":"所有部門經理 / **寄件人**：IT 總監 Kevin Liu / **日期**：4 月 5 日 / **主旨**：設備升級時程表"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Dear Managers, —[1]—. Our team plans to launch the upgraded platform with enhanced security features on April 20. This major **system overhaul** will **modernize** our entire technological infrastructure.","zh":"親愛的經理們，—[1]—。我們團隊計劃在 **4 月 20 日**推出具有增強安全功能的升級平台。這次重大的**系統改造**將使我們的整個技術基礎設施現代化。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"System overhaul","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"系統全面改造、翻修","syn":"system modernization = complete system upgrade = infrastructure renovation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Modernize","pos":"v.","zh":"使現代化、更新","syn":"upgrade = update = innovate","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：階段性安裝安排","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"詳細說明安裝將「分階段（in phases）」進行，首先是更新現有電腦與筆電的軟體應用程式。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"The installation process will occur **in phases**. First, we'll update all software applications on existing computers and laptops. —[2]—. Next, hardware replacements including new printers and scanners will be distributed to each floor. These devices will connect through our improved wireless network to the central database.","zh":"安裝程序將**分階段**進行。首先，我們將更新現有電腦和筆記型電腦上的所有軟體應用程式。—[2]—。接下來，包括新印表機和掃描器在內的硬體更換設備將分發到各個樓層。這些裝置將透過我們改良的無線網路連接到中央資料庫。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"In phases","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"分階段地","syn":"step-by-step = incrementally","tip":"解題技巧　答題要點　多益非常喜歡考升級階段的先後順序：1. 軟體安裝 ➔ 2. 硬體更換 ➔ 3. 測試 ➔ 4. 正式推出。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：安全門禁控制整合","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"引入新的生物識別讀取器（biometric readers），並與雲端儲存系統整合以改善門禁控制（improved access control）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Each department will receive new biometric readers for improved access control. —[3]—. The readers will integrate with our cloud storage system, allowing **secure document access** from any location.","zh":"每個部門都將收到新的**生物識別讀取器**以改善門禁控制。—[3]—。這些讀取器將與我們的雲端儲存系統整合，允許從任何地點安全地存取文件。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Secure document access","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"安全的文件存取","syn":"protected file retrieval = authorized data access","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：週末測試與備份提醒","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認所有設備將在 4 月 18-19 日週末進行測試，並要求部門經理確保同仁在更新開始前備份關鍵資料。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"This diagnostic tool can analyze network performance across multiple locations, helping us identify potential issues before they affect productivity. —[4]—. All equipment will **undergo testing** during the **weekend of April 18-19**. Please ensure your teams backup critical data before the update begins.","zh":"這個診斷工具可以分析多個地點的網路效能，幫助我們在潛在問題影響生產力之前將其識別出來。—[4]—。所有設備將在 **4 月 18-19 日的週末**接受測試。請確保您的團隊在更新開始前**備份**關鍵資料。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Undergo testing","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"接受測試","syn":"be tested = subject to evaluation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Weekend of April 18-19","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"4月18-19日的週末","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"多益 Part 7 的句子插入題，若選項包含 biometric readers 或 enhanced authentication，應放置在 —[3]—（說明讀取器功能之後）最合理。"}]}]},{"code":"13-2","title":"技術支援與問題解決：IT協助溝通 (Technical Support & Troubleshooting)","ch":"Chapter 13　技術領域","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch13-1 ～ Ch13-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch13-2 技術領域場景-技術支援與問題解決.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：身份驗證錯誤與帳戶鎖定","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：持續顯示身份驗證錯誤","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"使用者來電回報技術故障。其帳戶持續顯示身份驗證錯誤（authentication errors），且無法取回（retrieve）檔案。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Hello, technical support. I see you submitted a **troubleshooting** request. What's the problem?","zh":"你好，技術支援。我看到你提交了一個故障排除請求。有什麼問題嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"My account keeps displaying **authentication errors** when I try to connect. I've entered my password correctly multiple times, but I keep getting the same error message.","zh":"當我嘗試連線時，我的帳戶一直顯示**身份驗證錯誤**。我已經正確輸入了多次密碼，但我一直收到相同的錯誤訊息。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Authentication errors","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"身份驗證錯誤","syn":"login failures = verification errors = credential issues","tip":"解題技巧　答題指引　在多益聽力中，聽到 authentication error 多半與帳戶鎖定、輸入錯誤密碼或憑證過期有關。","trap":""},{"w":"Troubleshooting","pos":"n.","zh":"故障排除","syn":"problem solving = issue diagnosis","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：帳戶鎖定與檔案無法取回","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"IT 人員核對識別碼（ID）後指出帳戶因多次嘗試失敗已被暫停（suspended），女士補充說明昨日起即無法取回（retrieve）檔案。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Let me check your identification number in our system. It shows your access was suspended due to multiple failed login attempts. I'll need to **reset your credentials**.","zh":"讓我查詢一下您在我們系統中的識別碼。系統顯示您的存取權限因多次登入失敗而被暫停。我需要**重設您的憑證**。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"That's strange. I haven't tried logging in since yesterday morning. The server won't allow me to **retrieve** my stored files from yesterday either.","zh":"那真奇怪。自從昨天早上以來，我一直沒有嘗試登入。伺服器也不允許我**取回**昨天儲存的檔案。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Reset credentials","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"重設登入憑證","syn":"reset login details = re-initialize account permissions","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Retrieve","pos":"v.","zh":"取回、檢索","syn":"recover = get back = access stored files","tip":"注意事項　retrieve 是多益聽力中表達「讀取/取回雲端或伺服器檔案」的超級高頻字。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：提供臨時密碼與安全連結","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出行動，提供安全連結以建立新憑證，並給予臨時密碼（temporary password）要求變更，同時詢問備份狀態。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"This could indicate a security issue. Our specialist will investigate the **malfunction**. Meanwhile, here's a secure link to create your new credentials for the system. Use this **temporary password** to log in, then create a new one. Have you done a recent backup?","zh":"這可能表示有安全問題。我們的專家將會調查這個**故障**。同時，這是一個安全連結，可用於在系統中建立您的新憑證。使用這個**臨時密碼**登入，然後建立一個新密碼。您最近有做備份嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, fortunately I **backup** weekly.","zh":"有的，幸好我每週都會進行**備份**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Malfunction","pos":"n.","zh":"故障、失靈","syn":"defect = breakdown = server error","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Temporary password","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"臨時密碼","syn":"provisional passcode = one-time access code","tip":"解題技巧　多益常考「臨時密碼的使用規定」：登入後必須立即重設（reset immediately after login）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：預防措施與檔案安全確認","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認病患/員工檔案安全，透過每週固定備份（backup weekly）的習慣規避了資料損失風險。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, fortunately I **backup** weekly.","zh":"有的，幸好我每週都會進行**備份**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Weekly backup","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每週備份","syn":"weekly data replication = regular file saving","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：技術支援人員的問題回報留言","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：說明伺服器故障影響範圍","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"技術支援人員表明身份，並確認昨日發生了影響多名使用者的伺服器故障（server malfunction）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Hi, this is Mark from technical support regarding your **troubleshooting ticket**. I've identified the problem with your account. The error message you're seeing indicates a **server malfunction** that affected multiple users yesterday.","zh":"嗨，我是技術支援部的馬克，關於您提交的故障排除工單。我已經找出了您帳戶的問題。您看見的錯誤訊息代表昨天發生了影響多名使用者的伺服器**故障**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Troubleshooting ticket","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"故障排除工單、技術支援請求單","syn":"support request = help desk ticket","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Server malfunction","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"伺服器故障","syn":"server breakdown = system crash","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對使用者遭遇之症狀","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"核對問題細節：無法連線、顯示身份驗證錯誤（authentication errors）以及無法取回昨日檔案。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"My account keeps displaying authentication errors when I try to connect - that's exactly what other users **reported**. The server won't allow me to retrieve my stored files from yesterday - this is part of the same issue.","zh":"『當我嘗試連線時，我的帳戶一直顯示身份驗證錯誤』——這正是其他使用者所回報的情況。『伺服器不允許我取回昨天儲存的檔案』——這也是同一個問題的一部分。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Reported","pos":"v.","zh":"回報（此處為過去分詞）","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　多益常考「多個使用者報告相同的錯誤」，這代表是系統端問題，而非使用者個人輸入錯誤。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：發送安全連結與臨時密碼","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供解決方案，專家團隊已實施修復，並發送安全連結與臨時密碼（temporary password）TempPass789，要求使用者立即重設。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Our **specialist team** has implemented a solution. Here's a secure link to create your new **credentials** for the system - check your email. Your temporary password is TempPass789. Please reset it immediately after you log in.","zh":"我們的專家團隊已經實施了解決方案。這是一個用於在系統中建立新**憑證**的安全連結——請檢查您的電子郵件。您的**臨時密碼**是 TempPass789。請在登入後立即將其重設。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Credentials","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"登入憑證（如帳號、密碼、金鑰）","syn":"login details = access information","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Specialist team","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"專家團隊","syn":"expert team = technical administrators","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：備份還原聯絡電話","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"最終結果確認，若使用者需要從備份中還原檔案，可聯絡分機 5544。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"If you need to restore files from backup, contact me at **extension 5544**.","zh":"如果您需要從備份中還原檔案，請撥打分機 5544 聯絡我。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Extension 5544","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"分機 5544","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　多益常見的聯絡資訊考題，常問撥打分機（extension）是要聯絡誰或做什麼事（在此為 restore files）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：IT 部門的系統維護與密碼重設通知信","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布新安全協定與背景","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布將於週日晚上實施新的安全協定（security protocols），背景為多名同仁報告身份驗證錯誤。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"To: All Staff / From: IT Department / Date: March 10 / Subject: System Maintenance and Password Reset","zh":"全體同仁 / **寄件人**：IT 部門 / **日期**：3 月 10 日 / **主旨**：系統維護與密碼重設"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Dear Team, We're implementing new **security protocols** following recent troubleshooting discoveries. —[1]—. Several users reported 'My account keeps displaying authentication errors when I try to connect,' which led to our **investigation**.","zh":"親愛的團隊成員，在最近的故障排除發現之後，我們正在實施新的**安全協定**。—[1]—。幾位使用者回報了『當我嘗試連線時，我的帳戶一直顯示身份驗證錯誤』，這引發了我們的調查。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Security protocols","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"安全協定、安全規範","syn":"safety regulations = protection procedures","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Investigation","pos":"n.","zh":"調查","syn":"inquiry = examination","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：強制密碼重設與存取權限過期日","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"下週一起強制重設密碼。強調舊憑證將於週日晚上（Sunday night）失效，並說明無法取回昨日檔案時的報修指示。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Starting Monday, all employees must reset their passwords. Your current access will **expire** Sunday night. —[2]—. The server won't allow me to retrieve my stored files from yesterday - if you experience this error message, contact technical support immediately.","zh":"從下週一開始，所有員工都必須重設他們的密碼。您目前的存取權限將在**週日晚上**過期。—[2]—。伺服器不允許我**取回**昨天儲存的檔案——如果您遇到此錯誤訊息，請立即聯絡技術支援。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Expire","pos":"v.","zh":"到期、失效","syn":"run out = become invalid","tip":"","trap":"舊密碼失效時間是 週日晚上 (Sunday night)，新政策實施是 下週一 (Monday)。選項常設「週一早上才失效」之干擾。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：提供安全憑證連結與臨時密碼","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"給予安全連結以重設凭證，並透過電郵寄送臨時密碼與識別碼。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Our specialist team has prepared a solution. —[3]—. Here's a secure link to create your new credentials for the system: www.company.com/reset. You'll receive a temporary password via email with your **identification number**.","zh":"我們的專家團隊已經準備好了修復方案。—[3]—。這是一個在系統中建立新憑證的安全連結：www.company.com/reset。您將透過電子郵件收到臨時密碼與您的識別碼。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Identification number","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"識別號碼（員工編號等）","syn":"ID number = personal identifier","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：備份期限與故障回報窗口","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認所有重要檔案必須在週五前（before Friday）備份，任何故障（malfunction）皆應向服務台（help desk）回報。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Please backup all important files **before Friday**. —[4]—. Any malfunction during the transition should be reported to our **help desk**. We'll fix problems as they arise. Remember, strong passwords are essential for system security.","zh":"請在**週五前**備份所有重要檔案。—[4]—。在過渡期間的任何**故障**都應向我們的服務台回報。我們會在問題出現時進行修復。請記住，強密碼對於系統安全至關重要。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Before Friday","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"週五前","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　備份的截止時間為週五前，此為 Part 7 考卷細節題常考的截止日考點。","trap":""},{"w":"Help desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"資訊服務台、技術支援台","syn":"technical support counter = IT help department","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"13-3","title":"技術學習與知識傳遞：培訓認證溝通 (Technical Learning & Knowledge Transfer)","ch":"Chapter 13　技術領域","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch13-1 ～ Ch13-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch13-3 技術領域場景-技術學習與知識傳遞.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：技術培訓工作坊與認證測試","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：確認收到手冊與複雜規格疑慮","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認新員工或學員已收到培訓手冊（manual），並針對複雜的技術規格（technical specifications）表達疑慮。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Welcome to today's technical training **workshop**. Did everyone receive the **manual** and **instructions** for the new software?","zh":"歡迎來到今天的技術培訓**工作坊**。每個人都收到新軟體的**手冊**和**說明書**了嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, but the **technical specifications** seem complicated. Will there be a **demonstration** of the **user-friendly features**?","zh":"收到了，但這些**技術規格**看起來很複雜。會有關於**使用者友善功能**的**操作示範**嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Manual","pos":"n.","zh":"手冊、指引","syn":"handbook = guidebook = instruction guide","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Technical specifications","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"技術規格","syn":"technical details = system requirements","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Demonstration","pos":"n.","zh":"操作示範、演示","syn":"presentation = tutorial showing = display","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：講師引導與入口網站資源位置","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"講師（instructor）將引導學員了解每個功能，並告知所有參考資料皆可在入口網站（portal）的資源區中查閱。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Absolutely. Our **instructor** will guide you through each function of the new interface. We'll have hands-on practice after the presentation. All reference materials are available in the resource section of our **portal**.","zh":"當然有。我們的**講師**將引導您了解新介面的每個功能。我們在簡報後會進行實作練習。所有的參考資料都可以在我們**入口網站**的資源區中取得。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Instructor","pos":"n.","zh":"講師、培訓教練","syn":"trainer = educator = coach","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Portal","pos":"n.","zh":"入口網站、內部平台網站","syn":"internal website = online database = platform","tip":"","trap":"教材指出資源存放的位置在 線上入口網站 (portal's resource section)，選項中若出現「需查閱實體手冊 (printed manual)」即為干擾。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：認證評估時間長度確認","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出行動，學員詢問考試長度，講師確認評估（assessment）時間為 30 分鐘，且通過者可立即獲得認證。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Great! I checked the **documentation** yesterday. How long is the **certification testing** at the end?","zh":"太棒了！我昨天查看了**文件**。最後的**認證測試**有多長？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"The **assessment** takes about **30 minutes**. Participants who pass the assessment will earn their **certification** immediately. We'll also collect feedback about the tutorial to improve future sessions.","zh":"**評估**大約需要 **30 分鐘**。通過評估的參與者將**立即獲得認證**。我們還會收集關於本教學課程的回饋，以改進未來的課程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Documentation","pos":"n.","zh":"說明文件、參考文獻","syn":"manuals = records = documents","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Assessment","pos":"n.","zh":"測驗、評估","syn":"evaluation = test = examination","tip":"","trap":"Part 3 對白中的測驗時間為 30 分鐘，與 Part 4 獨白中的 20 分鐘 不同，請仔細看清題目來源。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：合格狀態與進階功能期待","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認結果，學員表明其已在基礎版本合格（qualified in basic version），期待學習進階功能。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Perfect. I'm **qualified** in the basic version, so I'm looking forward to learning the advanced features.","zh":"完美。我在基礎版本已經**合格**了，所以我很期待學習進階功能。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Qualified","pos":"adj.","zh":"合格的、有資質的","syn":"certified = competent = authorized","tip":"","trap":"合格是指已掌握舊版/基本功能（qualified in basic version），期待學習的是「進階功能 (advanced features)」。"}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：技術培訓工作坊的課程介紹廣播","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：歡迎與每月工作坊主題宣布","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"每月技術工作坊（monthly workshop）歡迎致詞，宣布本次教學（tutorial）將聚焦於更新的資料庫系統。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Good morning, everyone. Welcome to our monthly technical workshop. Today's **tutorial** focuses on the updated **database system**. Please check your manual for technical specifications and follow along with the demonstration.","zh":"大家早上好。歡迎來到我們的每月技術**工作坊**。今天的**教學**將聚焦於更新的資料庫系統。請查看您的**手冊**以了解**技術規格**，並跟著一起看**演示**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Tutorial","pos":"n.","zh":"教學、教學課程","syn":"instructional session = guided training","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Database system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"資料庫系統","syn":"data storage system = records system","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：培訓簡報的三大部分結構","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明本次課程結構包含三個部分（three sections），包含基本功能、進階文件手續與測試規程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Our instructor will guide you through each function of the new interface, which we've designed to be more **user-friendly**. The presentation includes **three sections**: basic features, advanced documentation procedures, and testing protocols.","zh":"我們的**講師**將引導您了解新介面的每個功能，我們將其設計得更加**使用者友善**。簡報包含三個部分：基本功能、進階**文件**程序以及測試規程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"User-friendly","pos":"adj.","zh":"使用者友善的、好上手的","syn":"easy-to-use = intuitive","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Three sections","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"三個部分","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　聽力常問培訓涵蓋哪些內容，三個部分為：1. 基礎 ➔ 2. 進階 ➔ 3. 測試。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：入口網站資源取得與 20 分鐘測驗","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"告知參考資料已上傳至內部入口網站（portal），簡報後進行 20 分鐘的評估（20-minute assessment）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"All reference materials are available in the resource section of our portal for future review. After the training, you'll take a **20-minute assessment**.","zh":"所有參考資料都可以在我們**入口網站**的資源區中取得，供日後複習。培訓結束後，您將進行 **20 分鐘的評估**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"20-minute assessment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"20分鐘評估","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此處測驗時間為 20 分鐘，請與 Part 3 對話中的 30 分鐘作區隔。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：立即認證與下月重考機制","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認通過者將立即獲得認證，未合格者可於下個月重考（retake next month），並要求填寫回饋表。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Participants who pass the assessment will earn their certification immediately. Those who aren't yet qualified can **retake the test next month**. Please provide feedback through the evaluation form, as your instructions help us improve these workshops.","zh":"通過評估的參與者將**立即獲得認證**。那些尚未合格的人可以**在下個月重考**。請透過評估表提供回饋，因為您的指導能幫助我們改進這些工作坊。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Earn certification immediately","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"立即獲得認證","syn":"receive credentials instantly = get certified right away","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Retake the test next month","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"下個月重考","syn":"re-examine the following month","tip":"","trap":"未通過的學員不需要等一年或重新上課，其修正機會是「下個月重新測驗（retake next month）」。"}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：寫給新員工的強制性技術培訓時程通知","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：歡迎新同仁與公佈強制培訓","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"備忘錄對象為全體新員工（new employees），其新入職訓練包含必要的技術培訓。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"To: All New Employees / From: Training Department / Date: May 8 / Subject: **Mandatory** Technical Training Schedule","zh":"所有新員工 / **寄件人**：培訓部門 / **日期**：5 月 8 日 / **主旨**：強制性技術培訓時程表"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Dear Team, Welcome to TechCorp! Your **orientation** includes essential technical training sessions designed to ensure you're fully qualified for your roles. —[1]—.","zh":"親愛的團隊成員：歡迎來到 TechCorp！您的新進訓練包含了基本的技術培訓課程，旨在確保您完全符合您職位的資格。—[1]—。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Mandatory","pos":"adj.","zh":"強制性的、必須的","syn":"compulsory = required = obligatory","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Orientation","pos":"n.","zh":"新人訓練、職前引導","syn":"induction program = onboarding sessions","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：分發實體手冊與技術規格介紹","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明第一個工作坊的主題（專有軟體），並分發包含詳細技術規格的手冊。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"The first workshop covers our **proprietary** software systems. You'll receive a comprehensive manual with technical specifications and step-by-step instructions. —[2]—. Our instructor will guide you through each function of the new interface during the **hands-on** demonstration. These features are user-friendly, but proper training ensures maximum efficiency.","zh":"第一個工作坊涵蓋了我們的專有軟體系統。您將收到一本包含**技術規格**和逐步說明的全面**手冊**。—[2]—。在實作示範中，我們的**講師**將引導您了解新介面的每個功能。這些功能雖然很**好上手**，但適當的培訓能確保最高的效率。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Proprietary","pos":"adj.","zh":"專有的、專利的","syn":"patented = exclusive = in-house developed","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Hands-on","pos":"adj.","zh":"實作的、親自動手的","syn":"practical = experiential","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：入口網站複習影音教學","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"通知新同仁，所有參考資料、影片教學（video tutorials）與投影片都已存放在入口網站中，要求其提前複習。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"All reference materials are available in the resource section of our portal, including documentation, **video tutorials**, and presentation slides. —[3]—. Please review these **before attending** the workshop for better understanding.","zh":"所有的參考資料都可以在我們**入口網站**的資源區中取得，包括**文件**、影片教學和簡報投影片。—[3]—。請在參加工作坊之前先複習這些，以利更好地理解。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Video tutorials","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"影片教學","syn":"instructional videos = recorded walk-throughs","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Before attending","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"參加前","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　要求在參加工作坊前（before attending/before the session）於網上複習完畢。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：週五下午測驗與一對一教學支援","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"測驗將在週五下午（Friday afternoon）進行，通過者立即獲得認證，未通過者可獲得一對一教學（one-on-one tutorials）支援。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Testing occurs on Friday afternoon. Participants who pass the assessment will earn their certification immediately. —[4]—. Those requiring additional support can schedule **one-on-one tutorials** with our training staff. Your feedback helps us improve the program, so please complete the evaluation form after each session.","zh":"測試將在**週五下午**進行。通過評估的參與者將**立即獲得認證**。—[4]—。那些需要額外支援的人可以與我們的培訓人員安排**一對一的教學**。您的回饋有助於我們改善這項計劃，因此請在每場課程結束後填寫評估表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"One-on-one tutorials","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"一對一教學/輔導","syn":"individual tutoring = personalized training","tip":"","trap":"若插入題為 \"This certification is required for system access.\"，最合理的放置位置是 —[4]—，因為此句緊接在「獲得認證（earn certification immediately）」之後。"}]}]},{"code":"13-4","title":"技術創新與產業活動：研發突破溝通 (Technical Innovation & Industry Events)","ch":"Chapter 13　技術領域","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch13-1 ～ Ch13-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch13-4 技術領域場景-技術創新與產業活動.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：手機原型研發與技術會議發布","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：詢問手機原型與下月會議時程","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"詢問新手機原型（prototype）的開發進度，並鎖定下個月技術會議（technology conference）的時間。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"How's the **prototype** for the new mobile phone coming along? The **technology conference** is **next month**.","zh":"新手機的**原型**進展如何？**技術會議**就在**下個月**了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Prototype","pos":"n.","zh":"原型、樣機","syn":"initial model = test version = draft design","tip":"","trap":"請記住，prototype（原型）不等於最終產品（final product），它仍處於開發和修改階段。"},{"w":"Technology conference","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"技術會議、科技展覽","syn":"tech expo = digital industry summit","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：工程師穿戴式設計與相容性修改","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"工程師（engineers）正在完成穿戴式裝置（wearable devices）的突破性設計，且正進行設計修改以改善相容性（compatibility）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Our engineers are finalizing a **breakthrough design** for **wearable devices** that will also enhance phone functionality. We're still working on some **design revisions** to improve **compatibility** with existing platforms.","zh":"我們的工程師正在完成一項**穿戴式裝置**的**突破性設計**，這也將增強手機的功能。我們仍然在進行一些**設計修改**，以改善與現有平台的**相容性**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Breakthrough design","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"突破性設計","syn":"revolutionary design = highly innovative setup","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Wearable devices","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"穿戴式裝置","syn":"smart accessories = body-worn tech","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Design revisions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"設計修改","syn":"design modifications = aesthetic adjustments","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Compatibility","pos":"n.","zh":"相容性","syn":"integration ability = co-existence","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：品質保證測試與 40% 效能升級","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"最新版本成功通過嚴格品質保證（rigorous quality assurance）程序，且測試版測試（beta testing）結果顯示處理時間能縮短 40%。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Excellent. Has the latest version successfully completed rigorous **quality assurance** procedures?","zh":"太棒了。最新版本是否已成功完成了嚴格的**品質保證**程序？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, **beta testing** finished yesterday. The digital features showed impressive performance. These advancements could potentially reduce processing time by **40 percent**.","zh":"是的，**測試版測試**昨天完成了。這些數位功能展現了令人印象深刻的效能。這些進展可能將處理時間減少 **40%**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Quality assurance","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"品質保證（簡稱 QA）","syn":"quality control = standard inspection","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Beta testing","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"測試版測試、乙版測試","syn":"pilot testing = trial testing","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"40 percent reduction","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"40% 的減少/降幅","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"處理時間減少 40% （processing time reduced by 40%），多益考卷常設計「電池效率 (battery efficiency) 提升 40%」之錯配干擾。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：展覽攤位與升級推出計畫","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認正式推出（official launch）與實施計畫。原型（prototype）將於技術會議的展覽攤位（booth）上展示，以利數位轉型。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"That's remarkable innovation! When can we launch the full **implementation**?","zh":"這真是了不起的創新！我們什麼時候能開始全面**實施**呢？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Product development suggests an upgrade to the current platform first. We should be ready for the official launch at the conference. The prototype will be displayed at our **booth**.","zh":"產品開發部門建議先升級目前的平台。我們應該準備好在會議上正式發表。原型將會在我們的**攤位**展示。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Perfect. This will definitely generate interest in our company's **digital transformation** initiatives.","zh":"完美。這絕對會激發大眾對我們公司**數位轉型**計劃的興趣。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Implementation","pos":"n.","zh":"實施、推行、落實","syn":"deployment = rollout = full integration","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Booth","pos":"n.","zh":"（展覽會的）攤位、展位","syn":"exhibition space = display stand","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Digital transformation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"數位轉型","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：產品研發總監的會議簡報變更通知","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布簡報時程與舞台變更","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"發表時間與舞台變更。宣布明天的技術會議（tomorrow's technology conference）簡報已移至下午 2 點的主舞台。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Hello, this is Director Kim from Product Development. I'm calling about tomorrow's technology conference presentation. Our **prototype demonstration** has been moved to the **main stage at 2 PM**.","zh":"您好，我是產品開發部的總監 Kim。我打電話是關於明天技術會議的簡報。我們的**原型操作示範**已經移到了**下午 2 點的主舞台**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Prototype demonstration","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"原型操作示範、展示","syn":"test model showing = sample machine run","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Main stage at 2 PM","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"下午 2 點主舞台","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　會議時程變更是多益極高頻的細節考點（例如 shifted from a booth to the main stage）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：品質保證與穿戴式設計","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"總結指出，穿戴式裝置的突破性設計上週已通過嚴格品質保證（QA）程序，且在各平台相容性優異。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Our engineers are finalizing a breakthrough design for wearable devices, which we'll **showcase** alongside our mobile phone innovations. The latest version successfully completed rigorous quality assurance procedures last week. Beta testing results show excellent compatibility across all digital platforms.","zh":"我們的工程師正在完成穿戴式裝置的**突破性設計**，我們將與我們的手機創新技術一起展示。最新版本上週已成功完成了嚴格的**品質保證**程序。測試版測試結果顯示在所有數位平台上都具有出色的**相容性**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Showcase","pos":"v.","zh":"展出、展示","syn":"present = display = unveil","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：攜帶設計修改文件與提早到場","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"指示同仁攜帶設計修改（design revision）文件與實施時間表，並要求創新團隊提早到場（arrive early）設置原型展示。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"These advancements could potentially reduce processing time by 40 percent, a significant performance upgrade. Please bring the design revision documents and implementation timeline. The innovation team should **arrive early** to set up the **prototype display**.","zh":"這些進展可能將處理時間縮短 **40%**，是一次重大的效能升級。請攜帶**設計修改**文件和**實施**時間表。創新團隊應該**提早到達**以設置原型展示。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Arrive early","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提早到達","syn":"be there ahead of schedule = allow extra time","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prototype display","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"原型展示、展覽裝置","syn":"exhibition model setup","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：數月開發心血發表","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"重申本次發布代表了研發團隊數月的心血結晶，若對功能特點有任何疑問可與總監聯絡。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Remember, this launch represents months of development work. Contact me if you have questions about **functionality features** we're highlighting.","zh":"請記住，這次發表代表了數個月的開發工作。如果您對我們強調的**功能特點**有任何疑問，請與我聯絡。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Functionality features","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"功能特點、系統效能","syn":"operating capabilities = system features","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：數位創新季刊對研發突破之新聞報導","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：技術會議之產品發表","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"報導主旨。報導 TechVision Corp 於昨日技術會議上宣布研發進度（推出具增強手機整合之穿戴式原型）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Tech Industry News / Digital Innovation Quarterly / June 15 Edition","zh":"**科技產業新聞** / **數位創新季刊** / **6 月 15 日版**"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"TechVision Corp announced **major progress** in product development at yesterday's technology conference. —[1]—. The company revealed its latest prototype for **revolutionary** wearable devices with enhanced mobile phone integration.","zh":"TechVision Corp 在昨天的技術會議上宣布了產品開發的重大進展。—[1]—。該公司展示了其最新的**原型**，一款具備增強型手機整合功能的革命性**穿戴式裝置**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Major progress","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"重大進展、突破","syn":"significant advancement = major breakthrough","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Revolutionary","pos":"adj.","zh":"革命性的、極創新的","syn":"groundbreaking = breakthrough = innovative","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：CEO 宣布穿戴式設計與 500 名測試者","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"CEO Patricia Chen 指出工程師已完成穿戴式裝置之突破性設計，並說明此測試版測試（beta testing）召集了 500 名使用者以驗證相容性（compatibility）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"'Our engineers are finalizing a breakthrough design for wearable devices,' said CEO Patricia Chen during the launch presentation. The new platform promises significant improvements in functionality and **performance**. —[2]—. Beta testing involved **500 users** across different digital environments, ensuring broad compatibility.","zh":"執行長 Patricia Chen 在發表簡報中說：『我們的工程師正在完成一項穿戴式裝置的**突破性設計**。』新平台承諾將在**功能性**與效能上帶來重大改善。—[2]—。**測試版測試**在不同的數位環境中動員了 **500 名使用者**，以確保廣泛的**相容性**。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Performance","pos":"n.","zh":"效能、表現","syn":"efficiency = capability","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"500 users","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"500 名測試使用者","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"測試使用者數量為 500 人，多益考卷常以 1000 人、5000 人或 40% 的數字混淆。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：嚴格品質保證與 40% 效能改善","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"通過嚴格品質保證（rigorous QA）程序。技術突破能使處理時間縮短 40%，且根據回饋進行了設計修改。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"The latest version successfully completed **rigorous** quality assurance procedures, meeting all industry standards for innovation. —[3]—. These advancements could potentially reduce processing time by 40 percent, while maintaining battery efficiency. Design revisions based on user feedback have created a more **intuitive interface**.","zh":"最新版本成功完成了嚴格的**品質保證**程序，符合創新的所有產業標準。—[3]—。這些進展可能將處理時間減少 **40%**，同時維持電池效力。基於使用者回饋進行的**設計修改**，創造了更直覺的介面。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Rigorous","pos":"adj.","zh":"嚴格的、嚴密的","syn":"stringent = strict = thorough","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Intuitive interface","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"直覺的介面","syn":"user-friendly interface = simple layout","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：下季實施部署與數位轉型領導地位","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認實施（implementation）將於下季度開始，這項創新確立了公司在數位轉型（digital transformation）中的領導地位。"},{"k":"en","sp":"","t":"Implementation begins **next quarter**, with a full upgrade available to existing customers. —[4]—. The company's commitment to continuous improvement has positioned it as a leader in digital transformation. Industry analysts predict this launch will significantly impact the wearable technology market.","zh":"**實施**將在**下個季度**開始，現有客戶可獲得完整升級。—[4]—。該公司對持續改進的承諾，使其在**數位轉型**中居於領導地位。產業分析師預測，此次發表將重大影響穿戴式技術市場。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Next quarter","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"下個季度","syn":"following quarter = in the next three months","tip":"","trap":"若插入題為 \"Our R&D team spent 18 months perfecting the synchronization logic.\"（研發團隊花了 18 個月完善同步邏輯），最合理的放置位置為 —[2]— 或 —[3]—，因為此句緊接在產品研發描述之後。"}]}]},{"code":"14-1","title":"就醫預約與互動：醫療服務溝通 (Medical Appointments & Interactions)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-1 保健場景-就醫預約與互動.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患致電醫療中心要求重新安排預約，並詢問牙科初診流程與診所延誤狀況。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解就醫與改期需求","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明就醫或改期需求，多益聽力 Part 3 常在此處考「來電目的（purpose）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, Riverside **Medical Center**. How may I **assist** you?","zh":"早上好，河濱醫療中心。請問有什麼我可以協助您的嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Hi, I'm calling to **reschedule** my **physical therapy** session with Doctor Martinez. It's currently booked for 2 PM tomorrow, but something came up. Could I move it to later in the week?","zh":"嗨，我打電話是要重新安排與 Martinez 醫生的物理治療課程。目前預約在明天下午 2 點，但臨時有些事情。我可以把它改到本週晚些時候嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical center","pos":"n.","zh":"醫療中心、醫院","syn":"hospital = healthcare center = healthcare campus","tip":"解題技巧　聽力中聽到 Medical Center 代表此處為大型綜合醫療設施，規模大於一般的 clinic（診所）。","trap":""},{"w":"Assist","pos":"v.","zh":"協助、幫助","syn":"help = support = aid","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Reschedule","pos":"v.","zh":"重新安排時間、改期","syn":"change time = rearrange = move to another slot","tip":"","trap":"reschedule（改期）絕對不等於 cancel（取消）！多益聽力最愛考此動作混淆。"},{"w":"Physical therapy","pos":"n.","zh":"物理治療","syn":"physiotherapy = rehabilitation","tip":"解題技巧　Martinez 醫生在此處為物理治療專科醫生（specialist）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對病人資訊與詢問初診表格","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認病患基本資料與病歷號碼。多益常考新病人與舊病人的流程差異（如填寫表格要求）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Let me check the schedule. May I have your **patient ID** number?","zh":"讓我幫您查詢一下時間表。方便請教您的病歷號碼嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"It's 45782. Oh, and I'm also coming in today for my first appointment at your **dental clinic**. Do I need to fill out any forms?","zh":"號碼是 45782。喔，還有我今天也要去你們的牙科診所進行我的第一次看診。我需要填寫任何表格嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Patient ID","pos":"n.","zh":"病歷號碼、病患識別碼","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　在多益聽力中，行政人員核對身分時，提供 ID number、policy number（保單號碼）或 name 是標準任務流程。","trap":""},{"w":"Dental clinic","pos":"n.","zh":"牙科診所","syn":"dentist office = dental practice","tip":"","trap":"多重預約計算：男士在同一天安排了「物理治療」與「牙科看診」，在多益中同日多重預約（Same-day multiple）在系統中算作兩個分開的預約時段，不可混淆。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：物理治療改期與新病人填表要求","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"安排具體療程時程，並要求新病人提前完成必要的病史問卷（questionnaire）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, since you're a new dental patient, please complete the **medical history questionnaire** before you arrive. Now, for the physical therapy, I can **move** you to Thursday at 3 PM. Does that work?","zh":"是的，因為您是牙科的新病人，請在到達之前完成病史問卷。現在，關於物理治療，我可以將您移到週四下午 3 點。這樣可以嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Thursday's perfect. And what time should I come in today for the **dental appointment**?","zh":"週四太完美了。那我今天應該幾點來做牙科看診呢？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"New patient","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新病人、初診病患","syn":"first-time visitor = intake patient","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病史問卷","syn":"registration forms = intake forms = health record","tip":"解題技巧　講義指出新病人流程的黃金考點為：「病史問卷必須在就診前完成 (before you arrive / before your visit)」。","trap":""},{"w":"Move","pos":"v.","zh":"移動、更改時間","syn":"postpone to = shift = reschedule","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dental appointment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"牙科預約","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　牙科服務包含 tooth cleaning (洗牙) 與 whitening procedure (美白療程)。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：時間確認與診所延誤告知","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"告知診所目前的稍微延誤狀況（running behind），提醒可能晚開始，病患表示運作正常並配合。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Your dental appointment is at 11 AM, but we're **running behind** about 15 minutes this morning, so it may start a little late.","zh":"您的牙科看診時間是上午 11 點，但我們今天早上進度落後了大約 15 分鐘，所以可能會稍微晚一點開始。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's fine. I'll **head over** soon. Thank you.","zh":"沒關係。我很快就會過去。謝謝妳。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Running behind","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"進度落後、延誤","syn":"experiencing a slight delay = running late = 15 minutes later","tip":"","trap":"15 minutes late 只是輕微延誤 (slight delay)，並不等於診所關門 (clinic closed)！"},{"w":"Head over","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"前往、出發","syn":"go to = travel to = depart for","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本留言為診所接待員 Sarah 致電病患 Mr. Thompson，告知其預約醫師臨時有手術需要改期，並說明新病人填表與改期時程安排。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：表明身分與告知看診預約","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"表明診所身分與來電目的。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"Hello, Mr. Thompson. This is Sarah calling from **Greenfield Dental Clinic**. I'm calling about your **tooth cleaning** and **whitening appointment** scheduled for tomorrow with Doctor Lee.","zh":"你好，湯普森先生。我是格林菲爾德牙科診所的莎拉打來的。我打電話是關於您明天與李醫生預約的洗牙和美白療程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Greenfield Dental Clinic","pos":"n.","zh":"格林菲爾德牙科診所","syn":"dentist office = dental practice","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Tooth cleaning","pos":"n.","zh":"洗牙","syn":"dental hygiene = teeth cleaning","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Whitening appointment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"美白預約","syn":"cosmetic dental booking","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：告知緊急手術需要改期","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出改期任務與突發原因（緊急手術）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"Unfortunately, Doctor Lee has been called in for an **emergency surgery**, so we'll need to **reschedule**.","zh":"不幸的是，李醫生臨時被召去進行一場緊急手術，所以我們需要重新安排時間。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Emergency surgery","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"緊急手術","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　在多益聽力中，醫生無法看診最常見的原因是 Doctor has emergency surgery（醫生有緊急手術），此為標準考點。","trap":""},{"w":"Reschedule","pos":"v.","zh":"重新安排時間、改期","syn":"change the date = find another time","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：提供空檔時段與新病人填表要求","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供替代的預約時間（openings），並引導新病人（first visit）在看診前完成病史問卷。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"We have two **openings** next month — the 15th at 10 AM or the 22nd at 2 PM. Also, since this will be your **first visit** to our clinic, please remember to complete the new patient **medical history questionnaire** before your appointment.","zh":"我們下個月有兩個空檔——15號上午10點或22號下午2點。另外，由於這是您第一次光臨我們的診所，請記得在預約前完成新病人病史問卷。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Openings","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"空檔、可預約的時段","syn":"available slots = vacancies","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"First visit","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"第一次造訪、初診","syn":"first-time visitor = new patient","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病史問卷","syn":"health survey = intake form","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：線上填寫省時及回電確認","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導病患線上提前完成以節省現場時間，並要求撥打專線回覆。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"You can fill it out on our Web site **ahead of time**, which will save you some time on the day of your visit. Please call us back at 555-0123 to let us know which date **works best** for you. Thank you.","zh":"您可以提前在我們的網站上填寫，這樣在您就診當天可以節省一些時間。請撥打 555-0123 回電給我們，讓我們知道哪個日期最適合您。謝謝。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Ahead of time","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"提前、預先","syn":"in advance = beforehand","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Works best","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"最合適、最方便","syn":"is most convenient = suits you best","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本通知為 Westside Medical Center 發送給病患 Sarah Mitchell 的預約確認與就診重要 Reminders 郵件。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：確認多重就醫預約","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明來信目的為確認即將到來的預約，並提供病歷號核對。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Dear Ms. Mitchell, Thank you for choosing **Westside Medical Center** for your healthcare needs. —[1]—. This email is to **confirm** your **upcoming** appointments and provide some important reminders.","zh":"親愛的米切爾女士，感謝您選擇西區醫療中心來滿足您的醫療需求。—[1]—。這封電子郵件旨在確認您即將到來的預約並提供一些重要提醒。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Westside Medical Center","pos":"n.","zh":"西區醫療中心","syn":"healthcare campus = hospital complex","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Confirm","pos":"v.","zh":"確認、證實","syn":"verify = validate","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Upcoming","pos":"adj.","zh":"即將到來的","syn":"approaching = scheduled","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：列舉同日及跨科室多重預約","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"列出同一天（March 25th）包含物理治療（physical therapy）與回診（follow-up）之多重時程安排。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Your **check-up** with Doctor Kumar is scheduled for March 25 at 10 AM. Following that, you have a **physical therapy evaluation** at our **rehabilitation clinic** at 2 PM the **same day**. —[2]—.","zh":"您與 Kumar 醫生的檢查安排在 3 月 25 日上午 10 點。隨後，您將於同一天下午 2 點在我們的康復診所進行物理治療評估。—[2]—。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Check-up","pos":"n.","zh":"身體檢查、例行檢查","syn":"routine examination = general visit","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Physical therapy evaluation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"物理治療評估","syn":"physiotherapy assessment = rehab evaluation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Rehabilitation clinic","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"康復診所","syn":"rehab center = recovery facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Same day","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"同一天","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"同日多重預約：Mar 25 共有 10 AM 和 2 PM 兩次不同門診，這在系統中代表 two separate visits（兩次分開看診），會產生兩筆帳單與紀錄。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：專科回診與新病人線上填表","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明如果有後續治療需求，需撥打櫃台電話預約；同時提及 3 月 30 日的牙科預約為初診，必須在就診前填妥問卷。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"If your **therapist** determines that additional sessions are needed, you can call our **receptionist** at 555-0180 with your patient ID to schedule a **follow-up**. You are also scheduled for a **tooth cleaning** at our dental clinic on March 30. Since this will be your first visit to our **dental department**, please complete the **new patient medical history questionnaire** before your appointment. The form is **available** on our Web site at www.westsidemedical.com/newpatient. —[3]—.","zh":"如果您的治療師確定需要額外的療程，您可以致電 555-0180 聯繫我們的接待員，並提供您的病歷號來安排回診。您還安排在 3 月 30 日在我們的牙科診所進行洗牙。由於這是您第一次造訪我們的牙科部，請在預約前完成新病人病史問卷。該表格可在我們的網站上（www.westsidemedical.com/newpatient）下載。—[3]—。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Therapist","pos":"n.","zh":"治療師","syn":"specialist = rehab expert","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Receptionist","pos":"n.","zh":"接待員、前台人員","syn":"front desk staff = clerk","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Follow-up","pos":"n./adj.","zh":"後續回診、跟進","syn":"subsequent visit = additional session","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Tooth cleaning","pos":"n.","zh":"洗牙","syn":"dental hygiene = teeth cleaning","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dental department","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"牙科部門","syn":"dentistry unit = dental office","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"New patient medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新病人病史問卷","syn":"intake health questionnaire = registration forms","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Available","pos":"adj.","zh":"可獲得的、可用的","syn":"accessible = obtainable","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：提早到場辦理與48小時改期原則","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提醒病患提早到場（arrive 20 minutes before）完成現場文書，並訂立至少 48 小時改期的重要規定。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Please plan to **arrive 20 minutes before** each appointment to complete any remaining **paperwork** at the **front desk**. —[4]—. If you need to reschedule any of these appointments, we kindly ask that you provide at least **48 hours' notice**. We look forward to seeing you. Best regards, Westside Medical Center Appointments Team","zh":"請計劃在每次預約前 20 分鐘到達，以在前台完成任何剩餘的文書工作。—[4]—。如果您需要重新安排任何一項預約，我們懇請您至少提前 48 小時通知。我們期待與您見面。西區醫療中心預約團隊敬上"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Arrive 20 minutes before","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提前20分鐘到達","syn":"arrive early = two-thirds of an hour early","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Paperwork","pos":"n.","zh":"文書工作、表格手續","syn":"forms = documents","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Front desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"前台、掛號櫃台","syn":"registration desk = reception","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"48 hours' notice","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"48小時前通知","syn":"two days ahead = 48 hours early","tip":"解題技巧　取消或重新安排（cancel/reschedule）時，「提前48小時（two days ahead）」是醫療與牙科場景中的經典時程規定，務必牢記。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-2","title":"藥物與健康產品：藥房服務溝通 (Medication & Health Products)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-2 保健場景-藥物與健康產品.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現客戶 Jennifer Park 致電藥房，核對電子處方箋並詢問缺貨藥物特別訂購到貨時間與全天候專線諮詢服務。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解過敏藥物配藥需求","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明用藥需求，多益聽力 Part 3 常在此處考「來電目的（purpose）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Good afternoon, City **Pharmacy**. How can I help you?","zh":"下午好，城市藥房。請問有什麼我可以幫忙的嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Hi, I'm calling about a **prescription**. My doctor's office told me they sent it over electronically this morning. I need a **refill** on my **allergy medication**.","zh":"嗨，我打電話是關於一份處方箋。我醫生的辦公室告訴我，他們今天早上已經電子傳送過去了。我需要補充我的過敏藥物。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Pharmacy","pos":"n.","zh":"藥房、藥局","syn":"常與 medical office（診所）或 healthcare facility（醫療機構）等詞彙進行場景關聯。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription","pos":"n.","zh":"處方箋","syn":"在閱讀測驗中常代換為 Rx 或 doctor's order。","tip":"注意事項　指必須由醫生開立的配藥指示（needs doctor's order），藥房無權自行開立處方藥。","trap":""},{"w":"Refill","pos":"n.","zh":"(處方的) 重新調配、補充藥物","syn":"常與 replenishment 或 renewal 進行代換。","tip":"","trap":"多益聽力最愛考「需求混淆」，請牢記 refill 只是補充藥物，不等於新處方（refill ≠ new prescription）！只要還有補充次數，就不用重新看醫生。"},{"w":"Allergy medication","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"過敏藥物","syn":"allergy pills = antihistamine","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對資料與告知特定劑量缺貨","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認藥物成分規格，通常會出現「庫存不足、劑量或品牌不符」等任務阻礙，為 Part 3 必抓的細節。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Sure, let me look that up. What's your name?","zh":"好的，讓我查一下。請問您的名字是？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Jennifer Park.","zh":"珍妮佛·朴。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"OK, I do see your prescription here, Ms. Park. However, the **dosage** your doctor prescribed isn't something we currently have **in stock**.","zh":"好的，朴女士，我確實看到您的處方箋了。然而，您醫生開立的特定劑量目前我們店裡沒有現貨庫存。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Dosage","pos":"n.","zh":"劑量、服用量","syn":"常與 dose 或 amount 進行代換。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"In stock","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"有庫存、有現貨","syn":"在多益閱讀中常與 available（可得到的）或 on hand（手頭有的）互換。","tip":"解題技巧　反義詞　out of stock（缺貨，代換為 unavailable 或 need to order）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：安排特別訂購與非處方藥替代","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"安排取藥交付流程（如特別訂購與預估到貨日），或提供臨時的替代藥物，是聽力中高頻的「建議/行動題」落點。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"We'll need to order it, and it should **arrive by** Thursday.","zh":"我們需要另外訂購，而且它應該會在週四之前送達。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Thursday... that's two days from now. Is there anything I can take **in the meantime**? I've been having terrible symptoms.","zh":"週四...那是兩天後。這段等待期間有什麼我可以先服用的嗎？我一直有很嚴重的症狀。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"We do carry an **over-the-counter** antihistamine with similar effects.","zh":"我們確實有賣一種具類似效果的非處方抗組織胺藥。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Arrive by","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"在...前送達","syn":"常與 come by 或 get here by 互換。","tip":"","trap":"by Thursday 代表「不遲於週四 / 週四或之前」（no later than Thursday），絕對不等於週四當天（on Thursday）才到！此時間差是多益 Part 3 聽力的超級大重播地雷。"},{"w":"In the meantime","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在此期間、同時","syn":"常用於表示在等待預訂商品（order delivery）期間的過渡期，同義詞為 meanwhile。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Over-the-counter","pos":"adj.","zh":"非處方的、成藥的 (簡稱 OTC)","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"多益極常考「藥物誤判陷阱」。處方藥（prescription）必須有醫生處方；而非處方藥（OTC）則可由客戶直接購買（directly purchase / alternative options），兩者購買條件完全不同。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導諮詢全天候專業服務專線","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認後續處理狀態，提供全天候諮詢服務（helpline）或由認證專家（certified staff）解答副作用（side effects），作為對話的圓滿收尾。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"But if you'd like more detailed information about **side effects** or interactions with other medications, I'd recommend calling our 24-hour pharmacy **helpline**. You'll be connected directly with a certified **pharmacist** who can advise you.","zh":"但是如果您想了解有關副作用或與其他藥物相互作用的更多詳細資訊，我建議撥打我們的 24 小時藥房諮詢專線。您會直接聯絡到一位合格的藥劑師來為您提供建議。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"OK, I'll do that. Thanks for your help.","zh":"好的，我會去做的。謝謝您的幫忙。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Side effects","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"副作用","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指藥物伴隨的主要療效以外的身體反應。","trap":""},{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"諮詢服務專線","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指藥房提供客戶緊急諮詢（urgent questions）與解答用藥疑慮的電話管道。","trap":""},{"w":"Pharmacist","pos":"n.","zh":"藥劑師","syn":"在聽力中屬於 certified pharmacy staff（認證藥房人員）。","tip":"","trap":"多益常設身分干擾，要聽清對話者是藥劑師（pharmacist）還是醫生（doctor），藥劑師可以調整用藥建議但不能開立全新處方。"}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本廣播為 MediCare 藥房店內重要服務與庫存更新公告，內容涵蓋月配處方領取、缺貨特定品牌週四到貨、維他命有效期提醒、止痛藥特價及 24 小時熱線服務。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告對象與告知月配處方已可領取","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"向來店顧客（shoppers）宣告月處方（monthly prescription）藥物補充（refills）已補貨，現在可以前來領取（collect）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Attention **shoppers**, this is your neighborhood MediCare Pharmacy with important updates. The pharmacy just received your **monthly prescription** from the hospital system, so customers waiting for refills can now **collect** them.","zh":"各位顧客請注意，這是您鄰近的 MediCare 藥房為您帶來的最新通知。藥房剛剛收到了您在醫院系統的每月配藥處方箋，因此等待藥物補充的顧客現在可以前來領取了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Shoppers","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"顧客、買手","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　聽力中一開頭出現 Attention shoppers 或 attention clients 代表這是零售或店內廣播（in-store announcement）。","trap":""},{"w":"Monthly prescription","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月配藥處方箋","syn":"routine Rx refills = recurring medicines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Collect","pos":"v.","zh":"領取、收取","syn":"pick up = retrieve = get","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：報告多種過敏與季節藥物補貨狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認大批庫存已返店（back in stock），說明昨天貨運（shipment）帶來的最新狀況。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Our pharmacist reports that allergy pills and several medications are **back in stock** after yesterday's **shipment**.","zh":"我們的藥劑師報告，在昨天的貨運送達後，過敏藥和幾種常見藥物目前都已補齊庫存了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Back in stock","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"重新補足庫存","syn":"replenished = available on hand again","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Shipment","pos":"n.","zh":"運送之貨物、到貨","syn":"delivery = cargo supply","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：特殊劑量訂購、維他命檢查與止痛成藥特價","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"針對特殊劑量特定品牌安排週四到貨，提醒檢查維他命過期日，並宣傳折扣非處方藥（over-the-counter pain relief）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"However, we'll need to order that **specific brand**, which should **arrive by Thursday**, for certain prescriptions requiring special dosage forms. Please check **expiration dates** on all vitamins and **supplements** purchased before January. Our **medical supplies** section now offers over-the-counter pain relief at **discounted prices**.","zh":"然而，對於某些需要特殊劑型規格的處方，我們仍需要訂購那個特定品牌，預計會在週四前到貨。請檢查在一月份之前購買的所有維他命和營養補充品的有效期限。我們的醫療用品區現在正以優惠特價提供非處方的止痛藥物。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Specific brand","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"特定品牌","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　多益聽力中，若要拿特定品牌或特殊規格劑量，往往需要額外調貨，這是常見的任務要求（need to order）。","trap":""},{"w":"Arrive by Thursday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週四前送達","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"選項中常出現 on Thursday 作為時間錯配誘餌，請認準 by（在...之前）。"},{"w":"Expiration dates","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"有效期限","syn":"expiry dates = best-before dates","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Supplements","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"營養補充品","syn":"vitamins = dietary additives","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical supplies","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"醫療用品","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Discounted prices","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"優惠折扣價","syn":"on sale = reduced rates = promotional offers","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導諮詢全天候熱線與營業時間","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供 24 小時熱線（helpline）解答副作用與服藥疑問，並提醒晚上 8 點前至處方櫃台（prescription counter）可享快速服務。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Remember, our 24-hour **helpline** connects you directly with **certified pharmacy staff** for questions about side effects or proper medication use. Visit our **prescription counter** **before 8 PM** today for faster service.","zh":"請記住，我們的 24 小時服務諮詢熱線可讓您直接與認證的藥房人員聯繫，以解答有關副作用或正確用藥的問題。今天請在晚上 8 點前造訪我們的處方配藥櫃台，以享受更快速的服務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"諮詢服務熱線","syn":"support hotline = consultation line","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Certified pharmacy staff","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證藥劑工作人員","syn":"licensed pharmacists = qualified medical staff","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription counter","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"配藥櫃台","syn":"dispensing counter = Rx pickup area","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Before 8 PM","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"晚上8點前","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為廣播中的時間截至限制，8 PM 後可能服務放慢或部分櫃台關閉。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本顧客告示為 Hillside Pharmacy 於 4 月 1 日發布之處方藥物配藥、週一專家門診與 24 小時熱線服務改善說明。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告配藥服務改善目的","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布藥房配藥服務（prescription services）已與醫院系統對接，推行全新自動化訂購流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Dear **Valued** Customers, We're improving our **prescription services** to better serve your healthcare needs. —[1]—. The pharmacy just received your monthly prescription from the hospital system, implementing our new **automated ordering process**.","zh":"親愛的尊貴客戶，我們正在改善我們的處方箋配藥服務，以更好地滿足您的醫療需求。—[1]—。藥房剛剛收到您來自醫院系統的每月處方箋，這代表我們開始實行全新的自動化訂購流程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Valued","pos":"adj.","zh":"尊貴的、受重視的","syn":"loyal = esteemed","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"處方配藥服務","syn":"medicine dispensing = Rx fulfillment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Automated ordering process","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動化訂購流程","syn":"computerized order system = automated fulfillment","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：週一延長專家諮詢與大批補貨狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"自下週一（Monday）起提供劑量調整與副作用延長諮詢（extended consultations），並確認大批季節性藥物與過敏藥已到貨。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Starting Monday, our pharmacist will be available for **extended consultations** about medication, **dosage adjustments**, and potential side effects. —[2]—. All **allergy pills** and **seasonal medications** are now in stock following our latest shipment. For supplements and vitamins, please **verify** expiration dates at our medical supplies counter.","zh":"從週一開始，我們的藥劑師將可為您提供有關藥物、劑量調整和潛在副作用的延長諮詢服務。—[2]—。在我們最新一批貨物送達後，所有的過敏藥物和季節性藥物目前都有現貨。對於補充品和維他命，請到我們的醫療用品櫃台核對有效期限。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Extended consultations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"延長諮詢門診","syn":"longer advisory sessions = detailed specialist reviews","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dosage adjustments","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"劑量調整","syn":"modifying dose amounts = dose correction","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Allergy pills","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"過敏藥、抗組織胺","syn":"allergy medication = antihistamines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Seasonal medications","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"季節性藥物","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　多益閱讀中常考「季節性商品或藥物（如花粉季、感冒季）」的大批補貨（in stock following latest shipment）。","trap":""},{"w":"Verify","pos":"v.","zh":"證實、核對","syn":"confirm = check = examine","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：特殊訂購週四到貨與提前 48 小時線上申請","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"特殊規格藥物可在週四前送達，並宣布一般補充藥物現在已可提前 48 小時線上提交。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"We'll need to **order** that specific brand, which should **arrive by Thursday**, for any specialized prescriptions not regularly stocked. —[3]—. This includes both prescription and over-the-counter medications. Refill requests can now be **submitted online** **48 hours in advance**.","zh":"對於任何非常備的特殊處方，我們仍需要訂購那個特定品牌，預計會在週四之前送達。—[3]—。這包括處方藥和非處方藥。重複配藥申請現在可以提前 48 小時在線上提交。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Order","pos":"v.","zh":"訂購、下訂","syn":"request = place an order","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Arrive by Thursday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週四前送達","syn":"Thursday or before = no later than Thursday","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Submitted online","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"線上提交","syn":"filed electronically = completed via the website","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"48 hours in advance","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"提前48小時","syn":"two days ahead = 48 hours early","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：24 小時熱線諮詢與保險給付卡核對","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導利用 24 小時專線諮詢，並提出最核心的要求——「必須核對保險給付資格（insurance verification）」，領藥時務必攜帶保險卡。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Our 24-hour **helpline** connects you directly with **certified pharmacy staff** for **urgent questions**. —[4]—. This service ensures you always have access to **professional advice** about your medications, including proper dosage and **storage instructions**. Please note: **Insurance coverage verification** is required for all prescription medications. Bring your updated insurance card when **collecting refills**.","zh":"我們的 24 小時服務諮詢熱線可讓您直接與認證藥房人員聯繫以處理緊急問題。—[4]—。此服務可確保您隨時獲得有關藥物的專業建議，包括正確的劑量和儲存說明。請注意：所有處方藥都需要進行保險給付範圍驗證。領取補充藥物時，請攜帶您最新的保險卡。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"服務諮詢專線","syn":"support hotline = all-day advisory call","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Certified pharmacy staff","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證合格的藥房團隊","syn":"qualified professionals = licensed chemists","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Urgent questions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"緊急問題","syn":"pressing inquiries = emergencies","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Professional advice","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"專業建議","syn":"expert counsel = specialist guidance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Storage instructions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"儲存說明","syn":"preservation guidelines = maintenance rules","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Insurance coverage verification","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保險給付範圍驗證","syn":"benefit check = insurance verification","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Collecting refills","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"領取補充藥物","syn":"picking up replenishment = retrieving Rx renewal","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-3","title":"健康管理與營養：飲食諮詢溝通 (Health Management & Nutrition)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-3 保健場景-健康管理與營養.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現客戶在健康中心赴營養師預約，諮詢如何改善精力水平，並探討減少加工食品與客製化營養計畫。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：赴營養師預約以提升精力","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶說明來到健康中心（wellness center）之目的為看營養師，希望透過飲食改善精力（energy levels）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, I'm here for my appointment with the **nutritionist**. I've been exploring different **meal plans** to improve my **energy levels**.","zh":"早上好，我是來赴約與營養師的面談。我一直在探索不同的飲食計畫，以提高我的精力水平。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Nutritionist","pos":"n.","zh":"營養師、營養專家","syn":"dietitian = nutrition expert = certified wellness expert","tip":"","trap":"營養師絕對不等於醫生 (nutritionist ≠ doctor)！多益極愛考「來訪者與什麼身分的人說話（Most likely speaking to a nutritionist）」，切勿選 doctor 或 surgeon。"},{"w":"Meal plans","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"飲食計畫","syn":"eating plans = diet programs","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Energy levels","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"精力水平、活力程度","syn":"vitality = stamina = energy units","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：健康中心介紹與確認個人化目標","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"接待人員歡迎客戶，介紹營養專家專長為依據「飲食限制（dietary restrictions）」打造個人化計畫。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Welcome to our **wellness center**! Your nutritionist, Dr. Chen, will see you shortly. She specializes in creating **personalized nutrition plans** based on **dietary restrictions** and healthy lifestyle goals.","zh":"歡迎來到我們的健康中心！您的營養師陳醫生很快就會和您見面。她專注於根據飲食限制和健康生活方式目標來制定個人化營養計畫。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Wellness center","pos":"n.","zh":"健康中心、養生會館","syn":"fitness & nutrition facility = lifestyle clinic","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personalized nutrition plans","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"個人化營養計畫","syn":"customized eating programs = tailored diet plans","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dietary restrictions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"飲食限制","syn":"eating constraints = food limitations","tip":"解題技巧　飲食限制在多益中通常指過敏（allergy）、全素（vegan/vegetarian）或無麩質（gluten-free）等特殊用餐條件。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：專家建議減少加工食品與引進有機天然食材","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶說明專家核心建議為「減少加工食品」，並表達對天然食材與有機選擇（organic options）的興趣。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Great! The specialist **recommended reducing** **processed foods** in my daily meals. I'm also interested in learning about **organic options** with natural ingredients.","zh":"太棒了！專家建議在我的日常飲食中減少加工食品。我也很有興趣了解配有天然成分的有機選擇。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Recommended reducing","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"建議減少","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"reducing（減少）絕對不等於 eliminating / avoiding entirely（完全消除/完全避免）！多益極偏好此程度副詞/動詞的置換陷阱，請認準「減少 processed foods 攝取」即可。"},{"w":"Processed foods","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"加工食品","syn":"packaged foods = manufactured foods","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Organic options","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"有機選擇","syn":"chemical-free eating = natural food options","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：食物標籤閱讀與當天取得客製化計畫","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認諮詢項目包含食品標籤（food labels）與營養成分計算，並承諾「當天（today）」即可提供量身打造的健康計畫。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Dr. Chen can definitely help with that. She'll review **food labels** with you and calculate appropriate **calories**, **protein, fat, and sugar** intake for your diet.","zh":"陳醫生絕對能對此提供協助。她會與您一起審查食品標籤，並為您的飲食計算合適的卡路里、蛋白質、脂肪和糖分攝入量。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Perfect. Does the **wellness education session** include information about reading **nutrition facts**?","zh":"太完美了。健康教育課程中是否包含有關閱讀營養成分表的資訊？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, our wellness center offers **personalized consultations** with **certified nutrition experts** who cover all aspects of healthy eating. You'll receive a **customized plan today**.","zh":"是的，我們的健康中心提供與認證營養專家的個人化諮詢，內容涵蓋健康飲食的各個層面。您今天就會收到一份為您量身定制的客製化計畫。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Food labels / Nutrition facts","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"食品標籤、營養成分表","syn":"nutrition facts label = caloric content table","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Calories, protein, fat, sugar","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"卡路里、蛋白質、脂肪、糖分","syn":"energy units, muscle-building nutrients, lipids, sweeteners","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Wellness education session","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康教育課程","syn":"lifestyle coaching = diet seminar","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personalized consultations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"個人化諮詢","syn":"individual sessions = dietitian consultation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Certified nutrition experts","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證營養專家","syn":"qualified dietitians = registered experts","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Customized plan today","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"當天取得客製化計畫","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"today（今天/當天） ➔ 絕對不是 next week（下週）！多益聽力中常考「什麼時候可以拿到計畫（When will she receive the plan?）」，答案是 today（同一天）。"}]}]},{"code":"14-4","title":"醫療行政與設施：保險理賠與系統管理 (Medical Administration & Facilities)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-4 保健場景-醫療行政與設施.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患因醫療部分負擔金額有誤致電查詢，櫃台人員協助核對病歷並核准全額給付理賠，並提醒更新電子病歷檔案。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：發現帳單部分負擔金額有誤","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明帳單有錯誤（billing error），部分負擔金額（copayment amount）似乎有偏差。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good afternoon, I'm calling about my **billing statement**. There seems to be an error with my **copayment** amount.","zh":"下午好，我打電話是詢問我的費用帳單。我的部分負擔金額似乎有錯誤。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Billing statement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"帳單、費用對帳單","syn":"invoice = bill","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Copayment","pos":"n.","zh":"(保險) 部分負擔金額、掛號費","syn":"copay = partial payment","tip":"解題技巧　部分負擔指的是病患看診時「每次需要自己固定支付的小額費用（Fixed per-visit fee）」，並非總額。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對基本資料與查詢病歷狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"行政人員在數位系統中核對病患資料（patient data）與保單，確認保險已批准給付。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Let me check your **medical records** in our **digital system**. Can you provide your **patient data** and insurance information?","zh":"讓我在我們的數位系統中查看您的病歷。您能提供您的病患資料和保險資訊嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Sure. My **policy number** is 789456. Your insurance has **approved coverage** for the upcoming procedure, according to the letter I received.","zh":"當然可以。我的保單號碼是 789456。根據我收到的信件，您的保險已經核准了即將進行的醫療給付範圍。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical records","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"病歷、醫療紀錄","syn":"health records = medical background","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Digital system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"數位系統","syn":"digitized platform = electronic system","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Patient data","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病患資料","syn":"personal file = patient record","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Policy number","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保單號碼","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Approved coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"核准保險給付範圍","syn":"authorized benefits = approved insurance coverage","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：確認已達自付額標準並更新電子病歷平台","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認病患年度自付額已達標（deductible met），理賠（claim）將全額給付，引導客戶在線上更新同意書（consent form）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I see that here. The deductible was already met, so your **claim** should be fully covered. Please update your information in our **electronic health record platform** to ensure accurate billing.","zh":"我看到了。您的年度自付額已經達到了標準，所以您的理賠申請應該會獲得全額給付。請在我們的電子健康記錄平台更新您的資訊，以確保帳單計費準確。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"I submitted the **consent form** and updated my medical history last week. When will I receive the **corrected statement**?","zh":"我上週已經提交了同意書並更新了我的病史。我什麼時候會收到修改正確的對帳單呢？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Deductible","pos":"n.","zh":"(保險) 年度自付額門檻","syn":"out-of-pocket threshold","tip":"","trap":"copayment（每次看診付的部分負擔） ≠ deductible（年度需要累計達到的自付額門檻） ≠ total bill（全額帳單）！這三個概念是多益閱讀 Part 7 保險對照題中極核心的雷區。"},{"w":"Claim","pos":"n.","zh":"保險理賠申請","syn":"reimbursement request = insurance filing","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Electronic health record platform","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電子健康記錄平台","syn":"electronic platform = patient portal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Consent form","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"(醫療) 同意書","syn":"release form = authorization document","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corrected statement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"修改正確之費用對帳單","syn":"revised bill = adjusted invoice","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：承諾三個工作日內寄出與全新硬體設施效益","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認正確帳單將在「三個工作日（three business days）」內寄出，並宣傳新翻修設施（newly renovated facility）處理高效率。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Our **medical office** will send it **within three business days**. Our **newly renovated facility** incorporates the latest patient care technology, so all lab results and documents are processed faster now. The **hospital complex** billing department will also send a confirmation.","zh":"我們的醫療診所將會在三個工作日內寄出。我們新裝修的設施融入了最新的病患照護技術，因此現在所有的檢驗結果和文件處理都更為快速。醫院綜合大樓的帳務部門也會發送一份確認信。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical office","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"醫療診所","syn":"clinic = healthcare facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Within three business days","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在三個工作日內","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　工作日（business days）不含週末（weekends）。如果週五下午打電話，三天內代表最晚下週三寄出。","trap":""},{"w":"Newly renovated facility","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新裝修/翻新設施","syn":"modernized facility = upgraded clinic = refurbished campus","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Hospital complex","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"醫院綜合大樓","syn":"medical center = healthcare campus","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本廣播為醫療診所向就診病患播報本週末進行數位系統升級更新，取消紙本表單，全面改用電子健康平台及掛號櫃台求助指引。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告本週末系統更新","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"通知病患診所將在「本週末（this weekend）」進行患者數據管理系統升級（upgrading），要求下次就診前在電子健康平台更新資訊。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Attention patients visiting our medical office. We're **upgrading** our patient data management system **this weekend**. Please update your information in our **electronic health record platform** **before your next visit**.","zh":"各位造訪我們診所的患者請注意。我們將在本週末升級我們的患者數據管理系統。請在您下一次就診前，先在我們的電子健康記錄平台上更新您的個人資訊。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Upgrading","pos":"v.","zh":"升級、更新","syn":"updating = modernizing","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"This weekend","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"本週末","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"this weekend（本週末） ➔ 絕對不是 next month（下個月）！多益最愛考系統是在何時進行轉型升級。"},{"w":"Electronic health record platform","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電子健康記錄平台","syn":"patient database portal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Before your next visit","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在您下次就診前","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為時程上規定的動作，要求患者在來店前完成線上更新。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：數位化轉型之流程簡化效益","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明新數位系統（digital system）的目的為簡化病歷、對帳單與理賠處理流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"This **digital system** will **streamline** medical records, billing statements, and insurance claims processing.","zh":"此數位系統將會簡化您的病歷檔案、費用帳單以及保險理賠的處理程序。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Digital system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"數位化系統","syn":"digitized records = electronic software","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Streamline","pos":"v.","zh":"簡化、使效率化","syn":"simplify = optimize = make highly efficient","tip":"解題技巧　streamline 是一個在多益商務、物流及醫療行政管理中極高頻出現的黃金單字，指「透過取消繁雜步驟來提高效率（improve efficiency）」。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：即時通知、翻新硬體與取消紙本表單","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"新系統亮點為即時傳送通知，融入最新技術，且醫院大樓將徹底取消（eliminated）紙本病史表，全部改為線上驗證核對。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Your insurance has **approved coverage** for the upcoming procedure - such notifications will now arrive **instantly** through our **portal**. Our newly renovated facility **incorporates** the latest patient care technology, including **automated lab results delivery** and electronic consent forms. The hospital complex has **eliminated** paper medical history forms. All health insurance information, including copayments, deductibles, and coverage details, will be **accessible online**. Patients must **verify** their insurance data to ensure **accurate claim processing**.","zh":"您的保險已核准即將進行的醫療給付——此類通知現在將會即時發送到我們的入口網站中。我們全新裝修的設施融合了最新的病患照護技術，包括自動化檢驗結果傳送和電子同意書。本醫院綜合大樓已取消了紙本病史表格。所有的健康保險資訊，包括部分負擔、自付額以及給付範圍細節，都可在線上查詢。病患必須核對其保險資料，以確保理賠處理的準確性。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Approved coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"核准保險給付","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Instantly","pos":"adv.","zh":"即時地、立刻地","syn":"immediately = without delay","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Portal","pos":"n.","zh":"入口網站、門戶網站","syn":"online system = patient database","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Incorporates","pos":"v.","zh":"融入、整合","syn":"integrates = includes = combines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Automated lab results delivery","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動化檢驗結果傳送","syn":"computerized test result transit","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Eliminated","pos":"adj./v.","zh":"取消的、根除的","syn":"cancelled = removed = discontinued","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Accessible online","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"線上可查詢的/可存取的","syn":"digitally available = attainable on website","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Verify","pos":"v.","zh":"驗證、核對","syn":"check = confirm","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導至掛號櫃台求助與病患隱私承諾","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導需要協助的患者前往掛號櫃台（registration desk），並重申病患隱私與資料安全為第一首要任務（top priority）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Visit the **registration desk** for assistance with the new system. Remember, protecting your patient data remains our **top priority**.","zh":"若需要新系統的協助，請前往掛號櫃台。請記住，保護您的病患資料始終是我們的首要任務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Registration desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"掛號櫃台、報到櫃台","syn":"front desk = reception counter","tip":"","trap":"地點與職責對應：尋求新系統協助或提交同意書是在掛號櫃台 (registration desk) ➔ 絕對不是處理費用的 帳務部門 (billing department)！"},{"w":"Top priority","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"最首要任務、最高優先","syn":"most important concern = primary focus = chief objective","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-5","title":"健身與健康活動：會員服務與健康計畫 (Fitness & Health Activities)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-5 保健場景-健身與健康活動.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患前往健身中心，諮詢企業會員方案與每週150分鐘運動要求以符合保險給付，並詢問二樓瑜伽課程。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解健康計畫與會員選擇","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"病患至 Premier Fitness Center 詢問健康計畫（wellness program）與會員資格（membership）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Welcome to Premier **Fitness Center**! Are you interested in our **membership options**?","zh":"歡迎來到卓越健身中心！您對我們的會員選項有興趣嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, I'd like to know about your **wellness program** and fitness classes.","zh":"是的，我想了解你們的健康計畫和健身課程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Fitness center","pos":"n.","zh":"健身中心","syn":"gym = workout facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Membership options","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"會員選項、會員資格","syn":"enrollment packages = subscription options","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Wellness program","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康計畫、養生專案","syn":"health initiative = fitness program","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：每週150分鐘運動保險要求細節","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認此健康計畫之核心參與規定為「每週150分鐘活動量」，並提供重訓、瑜伽與復健（rehabilitation）等多樣服務。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"The program requires participants to complete 150 minutes of activity weekly, right?","zh":"該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，對嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's correct. Join today and enjoy **unlimited use** of all our equipment and classes. We offer **yoga, aerobics, and strength training**. Personal training and **rehabilitation services** are also available.","zh":"沒錯。今天加入即可無限使用我們所有的器材和課程。我們提供瑜伽、有氧運動和重量訓練。同時也提供私人訓練和康復理療服務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"150 minutes weekly","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每週150分鐘","syn":"two and a half hours a week = 2.5 hours weekly","tip":"","trap":"多益閱讀 Part 7 喜歡考轉換計算，150 minutes = two and a half hours，千萬不要被 120 minutes (2 hours) 或 180 minutes (3 hours) 誤導！"},{"w":"Unlimited use","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"無限使用","syn":"unrestricted entry = full access","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Yoga, aerobics, strength training","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"瑜伽、有氧、重訓","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Rehabilitation services","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"復健理療服務","syn":"recovery services = rehab physical therapy","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：詢問二樓瑜伽課與下週健康博覽會推廣","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認早晨課程安排於二樓（second floor）主教室，並宣傳下週有健康博覽會（health fair）提供免費健康評估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Great! When does the **morning yoga class** start?","zh":"太棒了！早上的瑜伽課幾點開始？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"My morning session starts at **7:30** in the **main studio** on the **second floor**. We're also hosting a **health fair** next week where you can get a **free wellness assessment** and try different workout routines.","zh":"我的晨間課程在 7 點 30 分開始，地點在二樓的主教室。我們下週還將舉辦一場健康博覽會，您可以在那裡獲得免費的健康評估，並嘗試不同的運動項目。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Morning yoga class / session","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"晨間瑜伽課","syn":"AM class = early workout","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"7:30","pos":"n.","zh":"早上7點30分","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　注意 AM/PM 的時間區隔，7:30 AM 為早晨看診/上課高峰。","trap":""},{"w":"Main studio","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"主教室","syn":"exercise room = classroom","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Second floor","pos":"n.","zh":"二樓","syn":"level 2 = upstairs","tip":"","trap":"活動在二樓 (second floor / level 2 / upstairs) ➔ 絕對不是 一樓 (first floor / level 1 / downstairs)！"},{"w":"Health fair","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康博覽會","syn":"health exhibition = wellness event","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Free wellness assessment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"免費健康評估","syn":"complimentary health check = free evaluation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：器材全免與現場填表申請加入","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認不需要自備運動器材（gym provides everything），病患決定當天填表加入。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Perfect. Do I need to bring my own **exercise equipment**?","zh":"太完美了。我需要自備運動器材嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"No, the **gym provides everything**. Just complete your **membership application** and you can start today.","zh":"不需要，健身房提供所有器材。只需填寫您的會員申請表，您今天就可以開始了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Exercise equipment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"運動器材、健身設備","syn":"workout gear = exercise machines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Gym provides everything","pos":"clause","zh":"健身房提供所有東西","syn":"all facilities included = complimentary amenities","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Membership application","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"會員申請表","syn":"enrollment form = registration sheet","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本公告為健身中心經理向會員播報月底加入之無限使用特別優惠，說明新健康計畫下週一啟動，以及每週150分鐘的復健給付門檻。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布月底前加入無限使用特別優惠","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布本月底截止的特別優惠：今天加入即可無限使用（unlimited use）所有器材與課程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"Good morning, members! This is your **fitness center manager** with exciting updates. Join today and enjoy **unlimited use** of all our equipment and classes - this special offer extends through **month-end**.","zh":"會員們早上好！這是您的健身中心經理為您帶來的興奮好消息。今天加入即可享受我們所有設備和課程的無限使用——此項特別優惠將一直持續到月底。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Fitness center manager","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健身中心經理","syn":"gym supervisor = club director","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Unlimited use","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"無限使用權","syn":"full access = unrestricted entry","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Month-end","pos":"n.","zh":"月底","syn":"end of the month = closing of current cycle","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：週一推出新健康計畫與每週150分鐘運動要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布新健康計畫將在「週一啟動（launches Monday）」，並強調復健給付之每週 150 分鐘運動時數門檻。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"Our new wellness program **launches Monday**, featuring expanded fitness classes including yoga, aerobics, and strength training. The program requires participants to complete 150 minutes of activity weekly to qualify for **rehabilitation services coverage**.","zh":"我們全新的健康計畫將於下週一啟動，提供包括瑜伽、有氧運動和重量訓練在內的多樣化健身課程。該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，以符合康復理療服務的保險給付資格。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Launches Monday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週一推出/啟動","syn":"commences next Monday = starts early next week","tip":"","trap":"Monday launch（週一啟動健康計畫） ➔ 絕對不是 Saturday fair（下週六博覽會）！兩大活動時間點各異，注意混淆。"},{"w":"Rehabilitation services coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"復健服務保險給付","syn":"rehab therapy insurance benefit","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：二樓主教室晨間課與下週六博覽會","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"晨間課程 7:30 在二樓主教室上課，下週六（Next Saturday）將舉辦健康博覽會，現有會員享有優先預約權。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"My morning session starts at **7:30 in the main studio on the second floor**, and I'll be leading **personal training demonstrations**. Next Saturday's health fair will **showcase** our exercise equipment and offer free wellness assessments. **Current membership holders** receive **priority booking** for all workout sessions.","zh":"我的晨間課程於 7 點 30 分在二樓主教室開始，我將親自帶領私人教練示範。下週六的健康博覽會將展示我們的運動器材並提供免費的健康評估。現有的會員可以享有所有健身時段的優先預約權。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"7:30 in the main studio on the second floor","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"7點30分在二樓主教室","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　二樓在英文中除了 second floor，也常被代換為 upstairs 或是 level 2。","trap":""},{"w":"Showcase","pos":"v.","zh":"展示、展示陳列","syn":"display = exhibit = demonstrate","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Current membership holders","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"現有會員","syn":"active members = enrolled clients","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Priority booking","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"優先預約權","syn":"preferential scheduling = advance reservation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：延長營業時間與前台登記","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣佈延長營業時間（extend hours）以應對增加之需求，並引導病患至前台（front desk）登記排程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"The gym will **extend hours** to **accommodate increased demand**. **Register** at the **front desk** for your preferred fitness class schedule.","zh":"健身房將延長營業時間以應對日益增長的需求。請到前台登記您偏好的健身課程時間表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Extend hours","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"延長營業時間","syn":"longer operating hours = open later","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Accommodate increased demand","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"容納/應對增長之需求","syn":"meet growing customer needs = handle larger attendance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Register","pos":"v.","zh":"登記、註冊","syn":"sign up = enroll","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Front desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"前台、服務台","syn":"registration desk = reception counter","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本備忘錄為 Human Resources（人資部門）發布給全體員工之 Elite Fitness Center 企業健康計畫合作 launch 及相關福利。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布與健身中心建立夥伴關係","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布與 Elite 建立夥伴關係（partnership），提供全套企業健康計畫（corporate membership），加入即可享有無限使用福利。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"Dear Team, We're excited to announce our **partnership** with Elite Fitness Center to provide **comprehensive wellness benefits**. —[1]—. Join today and enjoy unlimited use of all our equipment and classes through this **corporate membership**.","zh":"親愛的團隊成員，我們非常高興地宣布我們與 Elite 健身中心建立了合作夥伴關係，為大家提供全面的健康福利。—[1]—。今天加入，即可透過此企業會員方案無限使用其所有的器材和課程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Partnership","pos":"n.","zh":"合作夥伴關係","syn":"collaboration = alliance = strategic agreement","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Comprehensive wellness benefits","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"全面健康福利","syn":"all-inclusive fitness perks = overall health incentives","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corporate membership","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"企業會員資格","syn":"company-sponsored subscription = employer-paid plan","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：計畫涵蓋範圍與每週150分鐘保險折扣要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"計畫包含瑜伽、有氧、重訓及復健理療。強調每週運動必須滿 150 分鐘以維持健康保險折扣資格。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"The wellness program includes **access** to their gym, fitness classes, and **personal training services**. —[2]—. Available options include yoga, aerobics, strength training, and **specialized rehabilitation services**. The program requires participants to complete **150 minutes of activity weekly** to **maintain eligibility** for **health insurance discounts**.","zh":"此健康計畫包括使用他們的健身房、健身課程以及私人教練服務。—[2]—。可選的項目包括瑜伽、有氧運動、重量訓練和專業的康復理療服務。該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，以維持其健康保險折扣的資格。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Access","pos":"n./v.","zh":"使用權、進入","syn":"entry = permission to use","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personal training services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"私人訓練教練服務","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Specialized rehabilitation services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"專業康復理療服務","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"150 minutes of activity weekly","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每週150分鐘運動要求","syn":"two and a half hours each week","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Maintain eligibility","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"維持符合資格","syn":"keep the qualification = remain eligible","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Health insurance discounts","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保費折扣優惠","syn":"premium reductions = insurance rate benefits","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：二樓晨間課與每月評估出席追蹤","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"每週二週四（Tuesday and Thursday）早上 7:30 晨間課程於二樓主教室上課，將進行出席率追蹤（track attendance）與每月健康評估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"My morning session starts at 7:30 in the main studio on the second floor - I'll be there as your **wellness coordinator** **every Tuesday and Thursday**. —[3]—. The fitness center will **track your workout attendance** and provide **monthly wellness assessments** to monitor progress.","zh":"我的晨間課程在 7 點 30 分於二樓主教室開始——每週二和週四我都會在那裡擔任大家的健康協調員。—[3]—。健身中心將會追蹤您的健身出席率，並提供每月的健康評估來監控進度。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Wellness coordinator","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康協調員","syn":"health supervisor = program administrator","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Every Tuesday and Thursday","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"每週二與週四","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為固定的二日制（bi-weekly）排班，也是常考的時間考點。","trap":""},{"w":"Track your workout attendance","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"追蹤健身出席率","syn":"monitor class participation = record attendance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Monthly wellness assessments","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月健康評估","syn":"recurring fitness evaluation = monthly progress checks","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：6月20日博覽會與7月1日福利生效企業代碼","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布 6 月 20 日將舉辦健康博覽會（health fair），福利於 7 月 1 日全面生效（full benefits starting July 1st），員工可向人資（HR）取得專屬企業代碼（corporate code）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"**A health fair on June 20th** will introduce all exercise equipment and available services. —[4]—. Membership registration begins immediately, with **full benefits starting July 1st**. Contact HR for your **corporate membership code** and fitness class schedule.","zh":"6 月 20 日的健康博覽會將會介紹所有的運動器材和可用的服務。—[4]—。會員資格註冊即刻開始，完整福利將於 7 月 1 日全面啟動。請聯繫人資部門取得您的企業會員專屬代碼和健身課程時間表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"A health fair on June 20th","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"6月20日健康博覽會","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Full benefits starting July 1st","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"7月1日福利生效","syn":"effective date July 1st = launching July 1","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corporate membership code","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"企業會員專屬代碼","syn":"company-specific discount code = access code","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"15-1","title":"銀行與個人理財：申請與服務 (Banking & Personal Finance: Applications & Services)","ch":"Chapter 15　財務與預算","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch15-1 ～ Ch15-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch15-1 財務預算場景-銀行與個人理財.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：就醫/銀行貸款審理實戰對白","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解貸款申請狀態與開場詢問","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶致電銀行詢問先前提交的貸款申請處理狀態，考點在於「來電目的（purpose）」之定位。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, First National Bank. How may I **assist** you?","zh":"早上好，第一國家銀行。請問有什麼我可以協助您的嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Hi, I submitted a **loan application** last week, and I was told it would take about **five business days** to process. I'm calling to check whether there's been a decision.","zh":"嗨，我上週提交了一份貸款申請，當時被告知大約需要五個工作天來處理。我打電話來是想確認是否已經有了決定。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Assist","pos":"v.","zh":"協助、幫助","syn":"help = support = serve","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Loan application","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"貸款申請","syn":"funding request = credit request","tip":"注意事項　在多益銀行場景中，loan (貸款) 申請是超級高頻主題，要與 credit card application (信用卡申請) 或 savings account upgrade (儲蓄帳戶升級) 進行區隔。","trap":""},{"w":"Five business days","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"五個工作天","syn":"one week (因為扣除週末兩天，5個工作天即為一週) = 5 working days","tip":"","trap":"工作天 (business days) 僅包含週一至週五，不含國定假日與週末。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對客戶基本資料","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"銀行行員核對客戶姓名等基本資訊，以在系統中調出帳戶資料，屬於行政核對流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Sure, let me **pull up** your account. May I have your name, please?","zh":"好的，讓我調出您的帳戶。請問能給我您的名字嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"David Chen.","zh":"大衛·陳。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Pull up","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"調出 (資料)、拉出 (檔案)","syn":"retrieve = access = search the system","tip":"注意事項　在客服或臨櫃場景中，常用於指在電腦系統中輸入關鍵字以「搜尋並顯示（display）」客戶的帳戶或預約資訊。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：告知批准結果、利率與款項發放","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"告知貸款申請已獲批准（approved），並說明關鍵的「年利率（interest rate）」與「入帳時程（deposit timeline）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Thank you, Mr. Chen. Yes, your application was **approved** yesterday. The **annual interest rate** on your loan is **4.5 percent**, and the funds should be **deposited** into your account within **two business days**.","zh":"謝謝您，陳先生。是的，您的申請昨天已經獲得批准。您的貸款年利率為 4.5%，款項應該會在兩個工作天內存入您的帳戶。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Approved","pos":"adj./v.","zh":"已批准、通過的","syn":"authorized = accepted = granted","tip":"注意事項　approve 的名詞形式為 approval (批准、同意)。","trap":""},{"w":"Annual interest rate","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"年利率","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　annual (年度的) + interest (利息/利潤) + rate (比率)","trap":""},{"w":"Deposited","pos":"v.","zh":"存入 (款項)","syn":"transferred into = credited to","tip":"解題技巧　反義詞　withdraw (提領、取款)。","trap":""},{"w":"Two business days","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"兩個工作天","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　對應時間差考題。「昨天 (yesterday) 批准，加兩個工作天入帳」，代表從批准日起48小時內款項會到位。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：詢問提款手續費與說明收費政策","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認最終手續費細節，考查「自家分行免費，跨行每筆交易收取 3 美元手續費（$3 fee per transaction at other banks）」的費用對比。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's great news. I do have one more question — I'll probably need to **withdraw cash** fairly often. Are there any fees I should know about?","zh":"這真是太棒的消息。我還有一個問題——我可能需要相當頻繁地提領現金。有任何我應該知道的手續費嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Withdrawals from any of our **branch ATMs** are completely free. However, if you use **another bank's ATM**, there's a **3-dollar fee per transaction**. You'll be able to see all the details on your **monthly statement**.","zh":"從我們任何分行的提款機（ATM）提款都是完全免費的。然而，如果您使用其他銀行的提款機，每筆交易將收取 3 美元的手續費。您將能在您的每月對帳單上看到所有細節。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Good to know. Thanks for your help.","zh":"了解。謝謝您的幫忙。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Withdraw cash","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提領現金","syn":"take out money = make a withdrawal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Branch ATMs","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"分行提款機","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　branch (分行/分店) + ATM (Automated Teller Machine 提款機)","trap":""},{"w":"3-dollar fee per transaction","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每筆交易 3 美元費用","syn":"charge of $3 per transfer/activity","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Monthly statement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月對帳單","syn":"monthly account summary = financial statement","tip":"解題技巧　對帳單通常是自動發送（emailed automatically / mailed monthly），供客戶核對所有交易明細。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：銀行客服申請結果通知語音","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：表明行員身分與來電目的","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客服人員自我介紹，並指出此留言的目的為說明「貸款與信用卡申請（loan vs credit card applications）結果」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Hello, Mr. Thompson. This is Jennifer from City Bank regarding your **recent applications**.","zh":"你好，湯普森先生。我是城市銀行的詹妮弗，關於您最近的幾項申請致電給您。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Recent applications","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"最近的申請案","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"多益常在此處設「複數申請陷阱」。主角同時申請了「貸款 (loan)」與「信用卡 (credit card)」，兩者審核進度與所需文件完全不同，不可混淆。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：告知貸款審核時程與核准結果","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明經理將在五個工作天內完成審核（review within 5 business days），並回報貸款已順利獲准。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The bank manager will **review your loan application** within **five business days**, and I'm pleased to **confirm approval** for your requested amount.","zh":"銀行經理將在五個工作天內審核您的貸款申請，我很榮幸能向您確認您所申請的金額已獲批准。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Review","pos":"v./n.","zh":"審查、評估","syn":"evaluate = examine = assess","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Confirm approval","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"確認批准","syn":"authorize = grant acceptance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Requested amount","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"申請金額","syn":"borrowed sum = desired funds","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：說明帳戶升級、手機轉帳設定與首年免手續費優惠","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"詳細介紹帳戶已升級至高級儲蓄 tier，並引導客戶使用「手機應用程式（mobile application）」進行線上轉帳與手續費豁免。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Your **savings account** has been **upgraded** to our **premium tier** with **higher interest rates**. You can **transfer money** between accounts using our **mobile application**, which I'll help you set up. There's a small fee for **withdrawing cash** from other banks' machines, but we're **waiving all fees for your first year**. Please visit our **main branch** to complete the **paperwork** and make your **initial deposit**.","zh":"您的儲蓄帳戶已升級至我們的尊榮等級，可享有更高的利率。您可以使用我們的行動應用程式（手機 App）在帳戶之間進行轉帳，我會協助您進行設定。雖然從其他銀行的提款機提款會收取少許手續費，但在您的第一年內，我們將免除所有手續費。請前往我們的總行完成文書手續，並進行首次存款。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Upgraded","pos":"adj./v.","zh":"升級的","syn":"promoted = advanced","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Premium tier","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"高級會員等級、尊榮級別","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　premium (高質量的/溢價的) + tier (層級/階層)","trap":""},{"w":"Transfer money","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"轉帳、資金轉移","syn":"move funds = remit money","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Mobile application","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"手機應用程式 (App)","syn":"smartphone App = mobile platform","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Waiving all fees","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"免除、減免所有手續費","syn":"exempting all charges = eliminating all costs","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Main branch","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"總行、旗艦分行","syn":"headquarters = main office","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Paperwork","pos":"n.","zh":"文書工作、簽約手續","syn":"documentation = forms","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Initial deposit","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"首次存款、開戶存入金","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　initial (最初的/開始的) + deposit (存款)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：要求額外投資證明與通知聯絡電話","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認信用卡申請仍處於「待審中（pending）」，並要求客戶補充「投資證明（investment statements）」，最後告知分機號碼。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Your **credit card application** requires **additional investment statements** for review. Check your **account balance** online anytime, and **monthly statements** will be emailed automatically. Call me at **extension 2345** to schedule your appointment.","zh":"您的信用卡申請需要額外的投資證明以供審核。您可以隨時在線上查詢您的帳戶餘額，每月的電子對帳單將會自動寄送給您。請撥打分機 2345 聯絡我，以安排您的會面時間。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Investment statements","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"投資證明、證券資產對帳單","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為貸款或信用卡審核所需的財力證明。","trap":""},{"w":"Account balance","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"帳戶餘額","syn":"current funds remaining = available balance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Extension 2345","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"分機 2345","syn":"direct line = phone extension","tip":"解題技巧　在多益聽力中，聽到 extension 代表直撥電話分機，常用於商業聯絡。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：National Trust Bank 服務升級通知信","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"doc","v":[{"k":"t","v":"Subject: Important Updates to Your Banking Services"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布銀行服務提升計畫","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"開門見山表明為了「滿足客戶財務需求（better serve financial needs）」，宣布推出全新優化服務，為文章之核心主旨。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Dear Valued Customer, We're enhancing our banking services to **better serve your financial needs**. —[1]—. The bank manager will **review your loan application** within **five business days** under our new expedited process.","zh":"親愛的尊榮客戶：我們正在提升我們的銀行服務，以更好地滿足您的財務需求。——[1]——。在我們全新啟用的快速流程下，銀行經理將會在五個工作天內審核您的貸款申請。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Valued Customer","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"尊榮客戶、重要客戶","syn":"loyal customer = account holder","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Enhancing","pos":"v.","zh":"提升、增強","syn":"improving = upgrading = boosting","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Expedited process","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"快速/加速流程","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　expedite (加速/促進) + process (流程/程序)。同義代換為 speedy workflow 或 faster procedure。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：介紹全新手機 App 功能與利率調整","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"詳細列出將於 11 月 1 日上線的全新功能，包含即時餘額更新、支票掃描與高利率優惠（interest rate 2.8%）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Starting **November 1st**, you can **transfer money** between accounts using our **mobile application** with **instant confirmation**. —[2]—. Enhanced features include **real-time balance updates**, **deposit check scanning**, and **investment portfolio tracking**. Interest rates on savings accounts will increase to **2.8% annually**.","zh":"從 11 月 1 日開始，您可以使用我們的行動應用程式在帳戶之間進行轉帳，並獲得即時確認。——[2]——。增強的功能包括：即時餘額更新、存款支票掃描以及投資組合追蹤。儲蓄帳戶的年利率將會提高至 2.8%。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Instant confirmation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"即時確認","syn":"immediate status update = instant notification","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Real-time","pos":"adj.","zh":"即時的、同步的","syn":"live = instant","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Deposit check scanning","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"存款支票掃描","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為數位銀行最新功能，客戶不需親自到分行，只需用手機相機掃描支票即可完成存入。","trap":""},{"w":"Investment portfolio tracking","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"投資組合追蹤","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　portfolio (投資組合/代表作) + tracking (追蹤)。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：跨行提款手續費調降與延長服務時間","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"銀行降價行動（fee reduced from $5 to $2），並延長分行的貸款與信用卡專櫃服務時間（extended hours）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"There's a small fee for withdrawing cash from other banks' machines, but we're **reducing it from $5 to $2**. —[3]—. Branch services now include **extended hours** for **loan applications** and **credit card services**. Your **monthly statement** will reflect these changes beginning next month.","zh":"雖然從其他銀行的機器提領現金需要支付小額手續費，但我們正將其從 5 美元調降至 2 美元。——[3]——。分行服務現在更包括延長貸款申請和信用卡櫃台的營業時間。您的每月對帳單將會從下個月開始反映這些變更。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Reducing","pos":"v.","zh":"調降、減少","syn":"lowering = decreasing = dropping","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Extended hours","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"延長營業時間","syn":"longer operating hours = late opening","tip":"解題技巧　看到 extended hours 通常代表該機構在晚上（evenings）或週末（weekends）仍有營業。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：自動符合資格與網路銀行同意條款","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認現有客戶全部自動符合福利（automatically qualify），只需在線上或臨櫃同意條款即可完成。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"All existing account holders **automatically qualify** for our new benefits. —[4]—. Simply **approve the terms** through **online banking** or visit any branch. Investment opportunities with **guaranteed returns** are also available for qualifying customers.","zh":"所有現有的帳戶持有人都將自動符合我們全新福利的資格。——[4]——。您只需透過網路銀行同意條款，或前往任何一家分行辦理即可。我們也為符合資格的客戶提供保證回報的投資機會。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Automatically qualify","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"自動符合資格","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　automatically (自動地) + qualify (符合資格/使合格)","trap":""},{"w":"Approve the terms","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"同意條款、核准協議","syn":"accept the agreement = agree to the policy","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Online banking","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"網路銀行、線上銀行","syn":"digital banking = web-based banking","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Guaranteed returns","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保證回報、無風險收益","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　guaranteed (有保證的/承諾的) + returns (投資報酬/收益)","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"15-2","title":"企業財務管理：預算與報告 (Finance Management: Budget & Reporting)","ch":"Chapter 15　財務與預算","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch15-1 ～ Ch15-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch15-2 財務預算場景-企業財務管理 2.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：預算審查與季度財務討論","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：詢問財務報告進度與會議時程","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理詢問財務報告審核進度，並提醒預算會議將在「明天早上（tomorrow morning）」召開。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Sarah, have you **finished reviewing the financial report**? The **budget meeting** is **tomorrow morning**.","zh":"莎拉，妳完成財務報告的審查了嗎？預算會議明天早上就要召開了。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Almost done. The **accounting department** needs **three more days** to complete the **annual report**, but I have the **quarterly figures** ready. Our **quarterly revenue** increased more than we originally expected.","zh":"快完成了。會計部門還需要三天才能完成年度報告，但我已經把季度數據準備好了。我們的季度收入增長超過了我們原本的預期。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Finished reviewing","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"完成審查","syn":"completed the review = done with examination","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Budget meeting","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預算會議","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　在多益企業場景中，此會議通常需要各部門經理共同參與，審查並核准明年的費用估算。","trap":""},{"w":"Three more days","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"再三天、額外 72 小時","syn":"requires additional 72 hours","tip":"","trap":"時間錯置：預算會議是「明天早上 (tomorrow morning)」，而年度報告完成則是「三天後 (in three days)」，兩者時間跨度不同，容易出現在聽力細節題中。"},{"w":"Quarterly revenue","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"季度收入","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　quarterly (季度的，每3個月) + revenue (收入/營收，代換為 income 或 earnings)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：分析支出增加與要求核對發票","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明支出不減反增 12%（expenses increased by 12%）的任務挑戰，並要求在會前審查費用報告並核對發票。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's excellent news! What about expenses? Did costs decrease as we estimated?","zh":"那真是太棒的消息了！那支出呢？成本有像我們估計的那樣降低嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Unfortunately, **expenses increased by 12%**. I need to **check several invoices** for accuracy. Please review these **expense reports** before the budget meeting tomorrow.","zh":"遺憾的是，支出增加了 12%。我需要核對幾張發票的準確性。請在明天預算會議前先審查這些費用報告。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Expenses increased by 12%","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"支出增加了12%","syn":"costs grew/rose by 12 percent","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Check several invoices","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"核對、檢查幾張發票","syn":"verify bill accuracy = examine invoices","tip":"注意事項　發票 (invoice) 在多益中常與 receipt (收據) 混淆。發票是付款前的請款單，收據是付款後的憑證。","trap":""},{"w":"Expense reports","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"費用報告、報銷單","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指員工或部門提交的實際花費明細，在會前需要主管核准（approve）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：今晚審查報告與確認付款狀態","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"男士承諾今晚審查（look at them tonight），並確認上個月的發票付款已於昨天由會計部確認處理完畢。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I'll look at them tonight. Has the payment for last month's invoice been **processed**?","zh":"我今晚會看。上個月發票的付款已經處理了嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, accounting confirmed it yesterday. The **profit margin** still looks healthy despite the cost increase. I'll have the complete **financial review** ready for tomorrow's presentation.","zh":"是的，會計部門昨天已經確認了。儘管成本增加了，但利潤率看起來仍然很健康。我會為明天的簡報準備好完整的財務審查報告。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Processed","pos":"v./adj.","zh":"已處理的","syn":"handled = settled = completed","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Profit margin","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"利潤率","syn":"margin of gain = profit percentage","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Financial review","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"財務審查","syn":"financial analysis = budget assessment","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：CFO 財務時程延期與業績更新報告","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：財務長表明身分與說明報告延遲原因","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"財務長（CFO）說明年度報告因為「發票處理延遲（invoice processing delays）」而需要再延三天（needs three more days），並分享季度營收大漲之好消息。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Good morning, everyone. This is the **CFO** with an important update about our financial reporting schedule. The accounting department needs **three more days** to complete the **annual report** due to unexpected **invoice processing delays**. However, I'm pleased to announce our **quarterly revenue** increased more than we originally expected - **up 18%** from last quarter.","zh":"大家早安。我是財務長，有一則關於我們財務報告時程的重要更新。由於非預期的發票處理延遲，會計部門需要額外三天來完成年度報告。然而，我非常高興能宣布，我們的季度營收增長超過了我們原先的預期——比上一季增長了 18%。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"CFO","pos":"n.","zh":"財務長 (Chief Financial Officer)","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　在多益聽力中，聽到 CFO 說話代表本篇獨白為高層財務廣播，主旨通常圍繞在「業績報告」或「預算政策變更」。","trap":""},{"w":"Invoice processing delays","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"發票處理延遲","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為年度報告延誤的「原因（reason）」，屬於聽力因果題的常考熱點。","trap":""},{"w":"Up 18% from last quarter","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"比上季成長 18%","syn":"18 percent growth quarter-on-quarter","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：要求會前審查費用報告並要求主管預算審批","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"要求各部門經理在明天的預算會議前審查費用報告，以核准明年的「成本估算（cost estimates）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Please review these **expense reports** before the **budget meeting** tomorrow, as we need approval for next year's **cost estimates**.","zh":"請在明天的預算會議前審查這些費用報告，因為我們需要對明年的成本估算進行審批。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Cost estimates","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"成本估算、預算評估","syn":"budget projections = expenditure forecasts","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：說明預算與付款時程提交要求","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"各部門主管必須在「週五（Friday）」前提交包含預算提案與付款時程之完整資料。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The financial report shows decreased expenses in marketing but increased costs in operations. All department heads must submit their **budget proposals** with **payment schedules** by **Friday**.","zh":"財務報告顯示，行銷部門的支出有所減少，但營運部門的成本增加了。所有部門主管必須在週五前提交他們的預算提案與付款時程表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Department heads","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"部門主管","syn":"department managers = divisional supervisors","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Budget proposals","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"預算提案、預算計劃書","syn":"financial plans = allocation proposals","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Payment schedules","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"付款時程表","syn":"payment timelines = disbursement plans","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：強勁利潤率與正向增長展望","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"總結指出利潤率依然強勁，年報呈現正向成長趨勢，要求各部門在提交資料中同時列出收入與支出預估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Our **profit margins** remain strong, and the **annual review** indicates **positive growth trends**. Remember to include both **revenue projections** and **expense estimates** in your submissions.","zh":"我們的利潤率依保持強勁，且年度審查呈現正向的成長趨勢。請記住，在您提交的材料中，必須同時包含營收預測與支出估算。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Positive growth trends","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"正向成長趨勢","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　positive (正向的/積極的) + growth (成長) + trends (趨勢/走向)","trap":""},{"w":"Revenue projections","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"營收預測、收入預估","syn":"income forecasts = sales projections","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：CFO 季度財務審查與預算規劃備忘錄","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"doc","v":[{"k":"t","v":"MEMORANDUM"},{"k":"l","v":"To: All Department Managers"},{"k":"l","v":"From: Jennifer Liu, Chief Financial Officer"},{"k":"l","v":"Date: September 15"},{"k":"l","v":"Subject: Q3 Financial Review and Budget Planning"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：分享第三季業績與收入遠超預估","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布第三季強勁的營收表現：實際收入達到 420 萬美元，遠超原先估計的 380 萬美元（$4.2 million actual vs $3.8 million estimate）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Dear Team, I'm writing to share our third-quarter results and outline the upcoming budget process. I'll begin by reviewing our revenue performance. —[1]—. Our **quarterly revenue** increased more than we originally expected, reaching **$4.2 million versus our estimate of $3.8 million**.","zh":"親愛的團隊夥伴們：我寫信是要與大家分享我們第三季的業績，並概述即將進行的預算流程。我將首先審查我們的營收表現。——[1]——。我們的季度收入增長超過了我們原先的預期，達到了 420 萬美元，而我們原先的預估值為 380 萬美元。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"$4.2 million versus our estimate of $3.8 million","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"420萬美元對比原先估算之380萬美元","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧（數據對比）　多益閱讀必考「實際 vs 預估」的數據細節。實際值為 420 萬美元，估算值為 380 萬美元，實際比估計多出 40 萬美元。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：年報因處理發票而延期三天，分析支出變動","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"年報需要再三天完成，並指出當前發票顯示行政支出減少、生產成本增加，利潤仍高於預測 15%（15% above projections）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The accounting department needs **three more days** to complete the **annual report**, which will provide comprehensive cost analysis. —[2]—. Current invoices show expenses decreased in administrative areas but increased in production. Overall profit remains **15% above projections**.","zh":"會計部門還需要三天來完成年度報告，該報告將會提供全面的成本分析。——[2]——。目前的發票顯示，行政領域的支出有所減少，但生產成本增加了。整體利潤仍高於預測的 15%。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"15% above projections","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"高於預估 15%","syn":"surpassed projections by 15 percent = 15% more than forecast","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：預算會議時間、部門資料提交與共享雲端範本","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"要求主管在明天上午 10 點的預算會議前審查報告，並至共享雲端（shared drive）下載範本準備明年的時程預算。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Please review these **expense reports** before the **budget meeting** tomorrow at **10 AM**. —[3]—. Each department must provide detailed **payment schedules** and **quarterly estimates** for the next fiscal year. The financial report template is available on our **shared drive**.","zh":"請在明天上午 10 點的預算會議前審查這些費用報告。——[3]——。每個部門必須為下一個會計年度提供詳細的付款時程表和季度估算。財務報告範本可以在我們的共享雲端硬碟上取得。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Budget meeting tomorrow at 10 AM","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"明天上午 10 點預算會議","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為「立即性任務」的時間點，要與年報的三天、以及最終提交截止日期進行時間區隔。","trap":""},{"w":"Shared drive","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"共享雲端、共同磁碟","syn":"common server = cloud drive = shared repository","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：預算提案九月底截止日期與情境分析要求","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"規定最終預算提案必須在「9 月 30 日前（by September 30th）」提交，且必須包含增加與減少的多重情境分析。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Annual planning requires careful review of all revenue streams and costs. —[4]—. Submit your final budget proposals by **September 30th**, including both increase and decrease scenarios for various market conditions.","zh":"年度規劃需要對所有收入來源和成本進行仔細審查。——[4]——。請在 9 月 30 日前提交您的最終預算提案，包括針對不同市場狀況的支出增加與減少的情境分析。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"September 30th","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"九月三十日","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧（截止日期）　預算提交的最終期限（deadline / cutoff date）為 9 月 30 日。","trap":""},{"w":"Increase and decrease scenarios","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"增長與衰退之情境分析","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　scenario (情境/方案/腳本)。此要求是為了年度預防性財務管理。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"15-3","title":"付款與資金流：帳單與交易 (Payment & Cash Flow: Billing & Transactions)","ch":"Chapter 15　財務與預算","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch15-1 ～ Ch15-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch15-3 付款與資金流：帳單與交易.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：帳單疑慮與預付折扣討論","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：客戶對帳單金額高於報價提出疑問","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶詢問帳單問題：總金額高於原本的報價（total seems higher than original price quoted）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Excuse me, I'd like to **inquire about this bill**. The total seems **higher than the original price quoted**.","zh":"不好意思，我想詢問一下這張帳單。總金額似乎比當初報價的還要高。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Let me check your receipt. I see there's a **charge for expedited service** and **tax was added**. The payment for last month's services is **due by the fifteenth**.","zh":"讓我幫您看一下收據。我看到裡面有一筆加急服務的收費，並且加上了稅金。上個月服務的付款截止日是十五號。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Inquire about this bill","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"詢問這張帳單","syn":"ask about the invoice = question the billing statement","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Higher than the original price quoted","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"高於原先報價","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"金額混淆：多益極常烤「原價（original quote）不含稅與服務費」與「最終總額（final total）含稅」的時間/金額混淆，本題就是因為加急費（expedited service）與稅金（tax）才變貴的。"},{"w":"Due by the fifteenth","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"十五號前到期/截止","syn":"must be paid no later than the 15th","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：詢問折扣優惠方案","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶因額外費用感到驚訝，主動詢問是否有折扣（discount）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I wasn't aware of the additional charges. Is there any **discount** available? I've been a customer for three years.","zh":"我並不知道有這些額外的費用。請問有任何折扣可以使用嗎？我已經是三年的老客戶了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Discount","pos":"n.","zh":"折扣、優惠","syn":"price reduction = special offer = markdown","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：說明預付折扣與免手續費條件","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供兩大優惠行動：預付享九折（10% discount for orders paid in advance），或付現/支票免交易手續費（waive transaction fee）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"We can offer a **ten percent discount** for **orders paid in advance**. Also, if you pay by check or cash today, I can **waive the transaction fee**.","zh":"如果是預付訂單，我們可以提供百分之十的折扣。此外，如果您今天用支票或現金付款，我可以幫您免除交易手續費。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Orders paid in advance","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預付訂單","syn":"prepaid orders = prepayments","tip":"解題技巧（優惠條件）　只有預付（paid in advance）才能享有九折！一般常規付款（regular payment）是沒有九折的。","trap":""},{"w":"Waive the transaction fee","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"免除交易手續費","syn":"eliminate the service charge = free of transaction fee","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：確認退款時程與銷售撤銷手續","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認退款處理時間為 7 到 10 天內（within seven to ten days），要求帶收據辦理銷售撤銷。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"What if I need a **refund** later? I might cancel part of my purchase.","zh":"如果我之後需要退款怎麼辦？我可能會取消部分購買。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Your refund will be **processed within seven to ten days**. Just bring your **receipt** and we'll handle the **sale reversal**. The due date for payment remains the same regardless.","zh":"您的退款將會在七到十天內處理完成。您只需帶上收據，我們就會為您辦理銷售撤銷手續。不過，無論如何付款到期日都保持不變。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Refund","pos":"n./v.","zh":"退款","syn":"reimbursement = repayment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Processed within seven to ten days","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"在 7 到 10 天內處理完成","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間誤判：退款到帳需要 7-10 天，而付款截止是在 15 號前，題目常將兩個時間混淆設陷。"},{"w":"Receipt","pos":"n.","zh":"收據、發票","syn":"proof of purchase = transaction record","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Sale reversal","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"銷售撤銷、退貨退款程序","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　sale (銷售) + reversal (反轉/逆轉)。代換為 transaction cancellation。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：店內付款政策與折扣變更廣播","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布付款政策變更與生效時間","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布全新付款政策，明確指出變更將自「下週一（next Monday）」起生效。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Attention customers, this is an important announcement about our **new payment policies**. Starting **next Monday**, we're updating our billing system to serve you better.","zh":"各位顧客請注意，這是一則關於我們全新付款政策的重要公告。自下週一開始，我們將升級我們的計費系統，以更好地為您服務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Starting next Monday","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自下週一開始","syn":"effective next Monday = commencing next week","tip":"解題技巧　在多益廣播中，新政策的「生效日期（effective date）」是必抓的關鍵考點。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：統一每月付款截止日與收據總額說明","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"規定所有帳單付款到期日皆為「15 號（due by the fifteenth）」，並提醒收據上的總額已包含所有稅金。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The payment for last month's services is **due by the fifteenth**, and all future bills will have the same monthly due date. Please note that prices shown **include all charges and tax**, so your **receipt** will match the total displayed.","zh":"上個月服務的付款截至日期為十五號，未來所有帳單都將採用相同的每月到期日。請注意，所顯示的價格已包含所有費用與稅金，因此您的收據金額將會與顯示的總額一致。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Due by the fifteenth","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"在十五號前截止","syn":"deadline is the 15th = must settle before the 15th","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Include all charges and tax","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"包含所有費用與稅金","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"金額混淆：新系統下「所見即所得」，總額已含稅（tax included），不會再有額外隱藏費用（no surprise charges）。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：說明預付折扣與免手續費條件，提醒保留收據","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"行動方案：任何付款方式預付皆可享九折（10% discount for orders paid in advance），免除大部分手續費，但保留信用卡 2% 手續費。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"We can offer a **ten percent discount** for **orders paid in advance**, whether by cash, check, or card. For any purchase requiring a **refund**, your refund will be **processed within seven to ten days**. Transaction fees for credit cards **remain at 2%**, but we're **eliminating fees** for other payment methods.","zh":"不論是使用現金、支票還是信用卡，預付訂單我們皆可提供百分之十的折扣。對於任何需要退款的購買，您的退款將會在七到十天內處理。信用卡的交易手續費仍保持 2%，但我們正取消其他付款方式的手續費。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Ten percent discount","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"九折、10% 折扣","syn":"10% price reduction","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Eliminating fees","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"取消、消除費用","syn":"removing charges = waiving fees","tip":"","trap":"費用項目保留：雖然取消了其他付款手續費，但信用卡 2% 手續費仍然保留（credit card 2% remains），此為細節是非題的地雷。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：收據保留提醒與客務櫃台諮詢","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認售後服務：要求顧客必須「保留所有收據（keep all receipts）」以供未來保固或調整，若有疑問可至客服櫃台。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Remember to **keep all receipts** for warranty claims and potential **sale adjustments**. Visit our **customer service desk** for questions about your bill or payment options.","zh":"請記住保留所有收據，以供保固申請和潛在的銷售調整之用。若對您的帳單或付款方式有任何疑問，請前往我們的客戶服務櫃台。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Keep all receipts","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"保留所有收據","syn":"retain proof of purchase = preserve transaction documents","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Sale adjustments","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"銷售調整、退換貨/價格調整","syn":"price adjustments = return and exchange process","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Customer service desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"客戶服務櫃台","syn":"information counter = help desk","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：Citywide Utilities 帳單系統升級與付款須知","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"doc","v":[{"k":"t","v":"CITYWIDE UTILITIES"},{"k":"l","v":"Date: June 1"},{"k":"l","v":"Subject: Important Billing Update"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：通知實施全新帳單與付款規定","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"通知帳戶持有人全新的付款與帳管程序「即刻生效（effective immediately）」，並規定上月帳款於 15 號截止。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Dear Valued Customer, We're writing to inform you about changes to our payment and billing procedures **effective immediately**. —[1]—. The payment for last month's services is **due by the fifteenth**, establishing a consistent due date for all accounts.","zh":"親愛的尊榮客戶：我們寫信是要通知您，我們的付款和計費程序有所變更，且即刻生效。——[1]——。上個月服務的付款截止日期為十五號，這將為所有帳戶建立一個一致的到期日。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Effective immediately","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"即刻生效","syn":"taking effect right now = active from today","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Consistent due date","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"一致、統一的到期日","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　consistent (一致的/始終如一的) + due date (到期日/截止日)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：預付款享九折優惠，總額含稅說明","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明為了幫助管理成本，預付款（prepayment）可享 10% 折扣，收據上的總價格已包含所有收費與稅金。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"To help manage costs, we can offer a **ten percent discount** for **orders paid in advance**. —[2]—. This applies to customers who pay their bill before receiving service, whether paying by cash, check, or electronic transfer. The total price **includes all charges and applicable tax**, clearly shown on your **receipt**.","zh":"為了協助管理成本，我們針對預付訂單提供百分之十的折扣。——[2]——。這適用於在接受服務前即付清帳單的客戶，不論是使用現金、支票還是電子轉帳付款。總價格已包含所有費用與適用稅金，並會清楚地顯示在您的收據上。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Pay their bill before receiving service","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"在接受服務前付款","syn":"paid in advance = prepayment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Electronic transfer","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電子轉帳","syn":"digital payment = online wire transfer","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：多付款項之退款時程與逾期滯納金罰則","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出多付或取消之退款行動：7-10 天內退還。並規定未於 15 號前付款者，每月將加收 1.5% 滯納金（late charge 1.5% monthly）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"If you overpay or cancel services, your refund will be **processed within seven to ten days**. —[3]—. Please retain all transaction documents and receipts for your records. Bills not paid by the due date will incur a **late charge of 1.5% monthly**.","zh":"如果您多付了款項或取消服務，您的退款將會在七到十天內處理。——[3]——。請保留所有交易文件和收據以作記錄。未在到期日之前付清的帳單，每月將會產生 1.5% 的滯納金。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Overpay","pos":"v.","zh":"多付款項","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　over- (超過) + pay (付款)","trap":""},{"w":"Incur a late charge of 1.5% monthly","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"產生每月 1.5% 的滯納金","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　incur (招致/產生費用) + late charge (滯納金/逾期罰款)。多益代換為 overdue penalty。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：推出預付套餐與聯絡計費部門","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認新功能：推出預付套餐（prepaid service packages）提供額外省錢，有問題可洽詢計費部門（billing department）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"New payment options include automatic deduction and online purchase through our website. —[4]—. The **sale of prepaid service packages** offers additional savings beyond the standard discount. Contact our **billing department** for questions about your account or payment arrangements.","zh":"新的付款方式包括自動扣款以及透過我們網站進行線上購買。——[4]——。預付服務套餐的銷售更提供了標準折扣之外的額外優惠。若對您的帳戶或付款安排有任何疑問，請聯絡我們的計費部門。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Automatic deduction","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動扣款","syn":"auto-pay = automatic debit","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prepaid service packages","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預付服務套餐","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指預先購買多次或整套服務，通常比單次購買更加便宜（additional savings）。","trap":""},{"w":"Billing department","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"計費部門、帳務組","syn":"accounts department = financial services team","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"15-4","title":"財務專業服務：諮詢與提案 (Financial Professional Services: Consulting & Proposals)","ch":"Chapter 15　財務與預算","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch15-1 ～ Ch15-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch15-4 財務專業服務-諮詢與提案.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：投資提案與合約簽署會議","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解客戶財務狀況與投資選項","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"財務顧問在今天的會議中，向客戶 Mr. Chen 提出「三種不同的投資選擇（three different investment options）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, Mr. Chen. The **financial consultant** will present **three different investment options** during today's meeting.","zh":"早上好，陳先生。財務顧問將在今天的會議上提出三種不同的投資選擇。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Financial consultant","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"財務顧問","syn":"financial advisor = wealth specialist = financial expert","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Three different investment options","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"三種不同的投資選擇","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　investment (投資) + options (選項/選擇，代換為 choices 或 proposals)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：合約簽署確認與提案前置要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認合約（contract / service agreement）是否已由客戶簽署，因為這是進行下一步提案的「前提（prerequisite）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Excellent. Did the client **sign the service agreement** yet? We need that **contract** before we can proceed with the **proposal**.","zh":"太好了。客戶簽署服務協議了嗎？在我們進行提案之前，我們需要那份合約。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Sign the service agreement","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"簽署服務協議","syn":"execute the contract = authorize the service terms","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Contract","pos":"n.","zh":"合約、協議","syn":"agreement = deal = legal document","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Proceed with the proposal","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"繼續進行提案","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　proceed (繼續/進行) + proposal (提案/計劃書，代換為 plan 或 suggestion)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：歸檔文件與四月稅務截止期限提醒","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"回報今早已收到簽署文件，並提醒所有稅務文件必須在「四月截止日期（April deadline）」前提交，目前進度在計劃內。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, I received the **signed documents** this morning. All **tax documents** must be submitted **before the April deadline**, so we're on track. I've already **filed the necessary records**.","zh":"是的，我今天早上收到了簽署的文件。所有稅務文件必須在四月截止日期前提交，所以我們目前進度在計劃中。我已經歸檔了必要的記錄。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Tax documents","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"稅務文件","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指申報所得稅（tax compliance）所需之表單。","trap":""},{"w":"Before the April deadline","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"在四月截止日之前","syn":"no later than April = prior to the April cutoff","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"On track","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"在計劃中、符合預期進度","syn":"on schedule = following the plan","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Filed the necessary records","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"歸檔必要的記錄","syn":"organized paperwork = stored documentation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：安排下週會面與簡報材料準備","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認後續安排：已排定「下週二下午（next Tuesday afternoon）」與顧問開會，並交代在「週一（Monday）」前準備好所有簡報檔案。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Perfect. We've **scheduled a meeting with the advisor** for **next Tuesday afternoon** to review everything. Can you prepare the **presentation materials**?","zh":"太完美了。我們已經安排在下週二下午與顧問會面，以審查所有事情。妳能準備一下簡報材料嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Of course. I'll have all **files ready by Monday**. Should I also submit the initial proposal to the client before the deadline?","zh":"當然可以。我會在週一前準備好所有檔案。我是否也應該在截止日期前，將初步提案提交給客戶？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, please. Make sure to include our **standard service terms** in the **contract documentation**.","zh":"是的，麻煩妳了。請務必在合約文件中，包含我們的標準服務條款。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Scheduled a meeting with the advisor","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"安排與顧問會面","syn":"arranged a session with the specialist","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Next Tuesday afternoon","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"下週二下午","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間混淆：與顧問的定案審查會議是「下週二下午」，而稅務文件提交截止則在「四月（April）」，切勿張冠李戴。"},{"w":"Presentation materials","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"簡報材料、會議檔案","syn":"briefing files = demonstration records","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Standard service terms","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"標準服務條款","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　standard (標準的/常規的) + service (服務) + terms (條款/條件)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：Premier Financial 諮詢會面前通報","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：表明顧問身分與來電目的","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"財務長/理財顧問 David Park 致電提醒客戶「明天下午 2 點（tomorrow at 2 PM）」將召開投資簡報會議。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Hello, this is David Park from Premier Financial Services calling about your **upcoming consultation**.","zh":"您好，我是尊榮財務服務的大衛·帕克，關於您即將進行的諮詢致電給您。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Upcoming consultation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"即將進行的諮詢","syn":"approaching advisory session = forthcoming meeting","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：告知簡報內容與攜帶文件要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"顧問將提出三種投資選擇，並要求客戶親自攜帶所有「相關文件與記錄（relevant documents and records）」供現場審查。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The **financial consultant** will present **three different investment options** when we meet **tomorrow at 2 PM**. Please bring all **relevant documents and records** for review.","zh":"當我們明天下午 2 點會面時，財務顧問將會提出三種不同的投資選擇。請攜帶所有相關的文件和記錄以供審查。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Tomorrow at 2 PM","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"明天下午 2 點","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為初次「簡報會議（Presentation meeting）」的時間。","trap":""},{"w":"Relevant documents and records","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"相關文件與記錄","syn":"associated paperwork and financial files","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：提醒稅務截止日期與定案會議安排","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"稅務提交僅剩兩週（just two weeks away），並已排定「下週二下午（next Tuesday afternoon）」與顧問開會，以完成合約。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"All **tax documents** must be submitted **before the April deadline**, which is **just two weeks away**. We've scheduled a meeting with the advisor for **next Tuesday afternoon** to **finalize your service agreement**.","zh":"所有稅務文件必須在四月截止日期前提交，這距離現在只有兩週的時間。我們已經安排在下週二下午與顧問會面，以定案您的服務協議。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Just two weeks away","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"僅剩兩週、十四天內","syn":"within 14 days = fortnight later","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Finalize your service agreement","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"定案您的服務協議","syn":"complete the service contract = approve the final agreement","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：說明服務範圍與多元提交管道","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提案包含全面規劃與持續支援，合約需簽名才能開始，並說明可透過「客戶入口網站（client portal）」或親自攜帶（bring them）提交。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Our proposal includes comprehensive **financial planning** and **ongoing support**. The **contract requires your signature** before we can begin managing your accounts. Please file any **additional paperwork** with our office by **this Friday's deadline**. You can submit documents through our **secure client portal** or bring them to tomorrow's presentation. Contact me if you need to **reschedule** this important meeting.","zh":"我們的提案包含了全面的財務規劃與持續的支援。在我們開始管理您的帳戶之前，合約需要您的親筆簽名。請在本週五的截止日期前，將任何額外的文書資料歸檔至我們的辦公室。您可以透過我們的安全客戶入口網站提交文件，或者直接帶到明天的簡報會議上。如果您需要重新安排這場重要的會議，請與我聯絡。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Financial planning","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"財務規劃","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　financial (財務的) + planning (規劃)","trap":""},{"w":"Ongoing support","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"持續支援","syn":"continuous assistance = unlimited client support","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Contract requires your signature","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合約需要您的簽名","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　在合規流程中，「簽名（signature）」是服務正式啟動的絕對前置條件。","trap":""},{"w":"Secure client portal","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"安全客戶入口網站/傳輸端口","syn":"client secure webpage = online document portal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Reschedule","pos":"v.","zh":"重新安排時間、改期","syn":"rearrange the session = change meeting time","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：Excellent Financial 季度審查與投資提案電郵","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"doc","v":[{"k":"l","v":"To: Jennifer Williams (jwilliams@techcorp.com)"},{"k":"l","v":"From: Robert Lee (rlee@excellentfinancial.com)"},{"k":"l","v":"Date: March 15"},{"k":"l","v":"Subject: Quarterly Financial Review Proposal"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：感謝客戶選擇並預告投資簡報","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"寫信感謝客戶選擇 Excellent Financial 作為「企業顧問（corporate advisor）」，並預告顧問將提出三種量身打造的投資選擇。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Dear Ms. Williams, Thank you for selecting Excellent Financial as your **corporate advisor**. —[1]—. The **financial consultant** will present **three different investment options** tailored to your company's growth objectives.","zh":"親愛的威廉士女士：感謝您選擇 Excellent Financial 作為您公司的顧問。——[1]——。財務顧問將會提出三種專為貴公司增長目標量身打造的投資選擇。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Corporate advisor","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"企業顧問","syn":"company specialist/advisor = business consultant","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Growth objectives","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"增長目標","syn":"expansion goals = development targets","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：明確服務範圍與四月合規截止日期","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"服務協議概述諮詢業務範圍（consulting engagement），並重申所有稅務文件必須在四月截止日前提交以確保合規（ensure compliance）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Our **service agreement** outlines the scope of our **consulting engagement**. —[2]—. All **tax documents** must be submitted **before the April deadline** to **ensure compliance**. Our team will **file all necessary records** and maintain complete **documentation** throughout our contract period.","zh":"我們的服務協議概述了我們諮詢業務的範圍。——[2]——。所有稅務文件必須在四月截止日期前提交，以確保符合法規。在我們的合約期間內，我們的團隊將歸檔所有必要的記錄並保持完整的文檔。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Consulting engagement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"諮詢業務、顧問合約","syn":"advisory contract = consulting services","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Ensure compliance","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"確保合規、遵循法規","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　ensure (確保) + compliance (遵守/遵循法規)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：安排在客戶辦公室會面與審查準備","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"行動方案：排定「下週二下午」在「客戶的辦公室（at your offices）」開會簡報，並要求客戶準備好所有財務記錄。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"We've scheduled a meeting with the advisor for **next Tuesday afternoon** at **your offices**. —[3]—. The presentation will cover **quarterly projections**, and our consultant will **review all documents** you've provided. Please have your **financial records** available for this meeting.","zh":"我們已經安排在下週二下午於您的辦公室與顧問會面。——[3]——。簡報內容將會涵蓋季度預測，而我們的顧問將會審查您所提供的所有文件。請在本次會議中準備好您的財務記錄。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"At your offices","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"於您的辦公室","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"開會的地點是在客戶 Jennifer Williams 的辦公室 (your offices)，絕對不是顧問 Robert Lee 所在的 Excellent Financial 辦公室！"},{"w":"Quarterly projections","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"季度預測","syn":"three-month forecasts = quarterly estimates","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Financial records","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"財務記錄","syn":"fiscal files = financial books = accounting records","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：承諾無限客戶支援與簽約截止日期警告","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"合約提供每月審查與無限客戶支援（unlimited client support），並強調簽約截止日為 3 月 31 日（deadline for signing March 31st）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The proposal includes monthly reviews and **unlimited client support**. —[4]—. Submit any questions before our scheduled meeting so we can address them in the presentation. The service contract is attached for your review, with the **deadline for signing** set for **March 31st**.","zh":"本提案包含了每月審查以及無限的客戶支援。——[4]——。請在我們排定的會議前提交任何問題，以便我們在簡報中進行解答。服務合約已附在信後供您審閱，簽約截止日期定為 3 月 31 日。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Unlimited client support","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"無限制、無限次的客戶支援","syn":"continuous client assistance = around-the-clock support","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Deadline for signing","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"簽約截止日期","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　3 月 31 日為「簽署合約」的最後期限，而「四月 (April)」則是稅務申報文件提交的截止期限。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"16-1","title":"產品創新與市場競爭：開發與推出 (Product Innovation & Market Competition: Development & Launch)","ch":"Chapter 16　企業發展","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch16-1 ～ Ch16-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch16-1 企業發展場景-產品創新與市場競爭.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：新產品開發進度與市場研究 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：詢問開發進度與市場研究背景","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理詢問新產品開發進度，對話說明在推出前已進行市場研究，並揭示消費者對品質的擔憂。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"How's the **new product development** going? The **development team** will test the new product design next month, right?","zh":"新產品開發進展如何？開發團隊下個月會測試新產品設計，對吧？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, but we need more **customer feedback** first. We conducted **market research** before launching the **product line**, and the **survey results** show some concerns about **quality**.","zh":"是的，但我們首先需要更多客戶回饋。我們在推出產品線之前進行了市場研究，調查結果顯示大眾對品質有些擔憂。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"New product development","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新產品開發","syn":"innovation project = prototype creation","tip":"解題技巧　聽力中聽到 development 常用於代表產品從概念到測試的初期研發階段。","trap":""},{"w":"Development team","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"開發團隊","syn":"design team = R&D department","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Customer feedback","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"客戶回饋","syn":"client response = user input = customer comments","tip":"關鍵考點　多益閱讀常考「客戶回饋是改進品質的核心動力」（feedback helps improve quality），而非競爭分析。","trap":""},{"w":"Market research","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"市場研究","syn":"market study = market investigation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Product line","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"產品線","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指公司生產的一組相關產品。","trap":""},{"w":"Survey results","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"調查結果","syn":"poll findings = questionnaire outcomes","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Quality","pos":"n.","zh":"品質","syn":"excellence = standards","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：確認原型改進與市場策略","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認設計團隊改進原型的方向，並說明此產品在市場中的競爭優勢與定位。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"What improvements are being made to the **prototype**?","zh":"原型有哪些改進？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"The design team is working on **innovation features** to stay ahead of the **competition**. Customer feedback helped us improve the quality of our services, and we're applying those lessons to this product.","zh":"設計團隊正在研發創新功能，以保持領先競爭對手。客戶回饋幫助我們改善了服務品質，我們正將這些經驗應用到這個產品上。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Prototype","pos":"n.","zh":"原型、樣品機","syn":"preliminary model = first sample batch","tip":"","trap":"原型代表尚未進入全面量產（full production）的產品。"},{"w":"Innovation features","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"創新功能","syn":"creative features = unique functions","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Competition","pos":"n.","zh":"競爭、競爭對手","syn":"rivals = competitors","tip":"解題技巧　高頻句型　stay ahead of the competition（保持領先競爭對手）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：測試與推出時程規劃","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明產品測試順利後的上市時程，以及上市的品質標準門檻。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good. When can we launch if the **test phase** goes well?","zh":"很好。如果測試階段進行順利，我們什麼時候可以推出？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"If everything meets our **quality standards**, we should be ready for a **full market launch** in three months.","zh":"如果一切都符合我們的品質標準，我們應該在三個月內準備好全面市場推出。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Test phase","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"測試階段","syn":"testing stage = evaluation phase","tip":"解題技巧　時程地雷　注意「測試階段」與「研究階段（research phase）」的時間差。此處預計在下個月測試，三個月後全面推出。","trap":""},{"w":"Quality standards","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"品質標準","syn":"quality specifications = benchmark requirements","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Full market launch","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"全面市場推出","syn":"full production release = mass roll-out","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：預測市場潛力與反應","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認研究數據顯示即使面臨競爭，消費者仍對此產品抱持濃厚興趣。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"The research indicates strong **customer interest** despite the **competition**.","zh":"研究顯示，儘管存在競爭，客戶興趣依然濃厚。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Customer interest","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"客戶興趣、購買意願","syn":"consumer demand = client appeal","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：新產品創新項目與測試公告 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布創新專案背景與研發時間","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理宣布最新研發項目的進展，指出該原型融合了長達半年的密集研究。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Good afternoon, everyone. I'm excited to share updates on our latest **innovation project**. The **development team** will test the new product design next month after **six months of intensive research**.","zh":"大家下午好。我很興奮能與大家分享我們最新創新專案的更新。經過六個月的密集研究，開發團隊將在下個月測試新產品設計。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Innovation project","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"創新專案","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Six months of intensive research","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"六個月的密集研究","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間混淆：研發階段花費了 6 months，而測試將在 next month（下個月）進行。考題常將兩者時間錯配。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：市場研究與參與者規模","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明在推出前進行的市場研究，並特別提及問卷調查高達 500 名參與者。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Customer feedback helped us improve the quality of our services, and we've incorporated those insights into this **prototype**. We conducted **market research** before launching the **product line** to understand competition and customer needs. The survey included **500 participants** and revealed strong demand for our **innovative features**.","zh":"客戶回饋幫助我們改善了服務品質，我們已將這些見解融入這個原型中。我們在推出產品線之前進行了市場研究，以了解競爭和客戶需求。該調查包括 500 名參與者，顯示出對我們創新功能的強勁需求。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"500 participants","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"500名參與者","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"數據誤記：Part 4 獨白的調查參與者是 500 人；而 Part 7 閱讀理解的調查人數則是 1,000 人。請務必依據題目指向的文章進行數據比對，不可搞混。"},{"w":"Innovative features","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"創新功能","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：內外部雙重測試機制","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"闡明測試階段將同時包含內部員工與特定精選客戶，而非單一方面，以確保公正客觀。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Our design improvements focus on quality and user experience. Testing will involve both **internal teams** and **selected customers** to ensure we meet **market expectations**. If the **prototype** passes all **quality checks**, we'll proceed with **full production**.","zh":"我們的設計改進專注於品質和使用者體驗。測試將涉及內部團隊和選定的客戶，以確保我們滿足市場預期。如果原型通過所有品質檢查，我們將繼續進行全面生產。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Internal teams","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"內部團隊","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Selected customers","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"選定客戶","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"對象不清：測試參與者為「內外部雙重對象」（both internal and selected customers），多益選項若寫「僅限員工」或「隨機街頭路人」皆為錯誤選項。"},{"w":"Market expectations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"市場預期","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Quality checks","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"品質檢查","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Full production","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"全面量產","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：推出行銷策略以區隔競爭者","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認測試通過後的下一步為實施定向行銷，使產品與現有競爭對手產生明確區隔。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"The **launch strategy** includes **targeted marketing** to **differentiate** us from **competition**. Thank you for your continued dedication to product development.","zh":"推出策略包括定向行銷，以使我們與競爭對手區別開來。感謝您對新產品開發的持續奉獻。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Launch strategy","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"推出/上市策略","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Targeted marketing","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"定向/精準行銷","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Differentiate","pos":"v.","zh":"區別、使具有差異化","syn":"distinguish = make unique","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：內部備忘錄與市場推出時程 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布原型研發成功並啟動上市流程","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"高階主管向全體團隊宣布原型已成功開發，並為下個月的新產品測試定調。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"Team, Following successful **prototype completion**, I'm outlining our path to **market launch**. —[1]—. The **development team** will test the new product design next month, marking a **critical milestone** in our **innovation journey**.","zh":"團隊同仁，隨著原型成功完成，我正概述我們的市場推出之路。—[1]—。開發團隊將在下個月測試新產品設計，這標誌著我們創新旅程中的一個關鍵里程碑。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Prototype completion","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"原型完成","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Market launch","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"市場推出/產品上市","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Critical milestone","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"關鍵里程碑","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Innovation journey","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"創新旅程","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：1000名客戶調查與品質改進","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明過去一年客戶回饋如何改善服務，並指出本次調查高達1000人，大幅提升代表性。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"Customer feedback helped us improve the quality of our services over the past year. —[2]—. This valuable input has shaped our current product features and will continue guiding future improvements. The **research department's survey** of **1,000 customers** revealed **preferences** that directly influenced our **design decisions**.","zh":"過去一年中，客戶回饋幫助我們改善了服務品質。—[2]—。這項寶貴的投入塑造了我們目前的產品功能，並將繼續指引未來的改進。研究部門對 1,000 名客戶的調查揭示了直接影響我們設計決定的偏好。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Research department's survey","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"研究部門的調查","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"1,000 customers","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"1,000名客戶","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　高頻考點　此處調查規模為 1,000 人，用以與前一課 Part 4 的 500 人進行區隔，是閱讀測驗對照題的熱門陷阱。","trap":""},{"w":"Preferences","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"偏好、喜好","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Design decisions","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"設計決定","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：分析30%的市場缺口定位","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明在產品線推出前進行的競爭分析，找出兼具品質與高性價比的 30% 市場缺口。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"We conducted **market research** before launching the **product line** to analyze **competition** and identify opportunities. —[3]—. Our findings show a **30% gap in the market** for products combining **quality with affordability**. This positions us perfectly against current competition.","zh":"我們在推出產品線之前進行了市場研究，以分析競爭並尋找機會。—[3]—。我們的調查結果顯示，市場上有 30% 的缺口，需要結合品質與負擔得起之價格的產品。這使我們在面對當前競爭時處於完美的有利地位。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"30% gap in the market","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"30%的市場缺口","syn":"unfilled market demand = unexplored market segment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Quality with affordability","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"品質與可負擔性/高性價比","syn":"affordability ＝ reasonable pricing = value for money。","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：訂立嚴格測試規程並暫定六月上市","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布將進行嚴格的測試規程以滿足品質標準，並透露目標上市時間為六月。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sender","t":"**Testing protocols** will be **rigorous** to ensure we meet our **quality standards**. —[4]—. The **launch timeline** depends on test results, but we're targeting **June** for **initial release**. Innovation remains our key **differentiator**, and this product exemplifies our commitment to **customer-driven development**.","zh":"測試規程將非常嚴格，以確保我們符合品質標準。—[4]—。推出時程取決於測試結果，但我們的目標是在六月進行首次發布。創新仍然是我們的關鍵差異化因素，而這款產品體現了我們對客戶導向開發的承諾。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Testing protocols","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"測試規程/測試協議","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　解題插題技巧　—[4]— 位置是談論測試規程最佳位置。因為後文提到 documentation and quality tracking（測試文件記錄與品質追蹤）。","trap":""},{"w":"Rigorous","pos":"adj.","zh":"嚴格的、嚴密的","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Launch timeline","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"推出時程表","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"June","pos":"n.","zh":"六月","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　時程指引　本對話寫於春季，目標在 June 進行首次發布。","trap":""},{"w":"Initial release","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"首次發布/首次上市","syn":"first roll-out = primary introduction","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Differentiator","pos":"n.","zh":"差異化特徵、區隔因素","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Customer-driven development","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"客戶導向開發","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"16-2","title":"策略聯盟與資源整合：合作與共贏 (Strategic Alliance & Resource Integration: Partnership & Win-Win)","ch":"Chapter 16　企業發展","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch16-1 ～ Ch16-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch16-2 策略聯盟與資源整合：合作與共贏.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：TechCorp 合作提案評估與合約條款 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：發現合作機會與評估價值","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理詢問合作提案審查狀況，指出 TechCorp 與己方簽署策略聯盟合約的價值。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Have you reviewed the **partnership proposal** from TechCorp? Both companies signed a **partnership agreement** to share **technology resources**.","zh":"你審查過 TechCorp 的合作提案了嗎？兩家公司簽署了合作協議，共同分享技術資源。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, it's an excellent **collaboration opportunity**. The **joint venture** would strengthen our **network** and **reduce costs**.","zh":"是的，這是一個絕佳的合作機會。這家合資企業將會強化我們的網絡並降低成本。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Partnership proposal","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合作/夥伴關係提案","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Partnership agreement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合作協議","syn":"collaboration contract = cooperation deal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Technology resources","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"技術資源","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Collaboration opportunity","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合作機會","syn":"cooperation chance = alliance opportunity","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Joint venture","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合資企業/共同投資","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　特徵考點　代表雙方共同出資、共享所有權（shared ownership）的緊密合作關係。","trap":""},{"w":"Network","pos":"n.","zh":"網絡/系統網","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Reduce costs","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"降低成本","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：董事會對收購與談判期限的審查","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明談判開始日期為下週一，且指出併購等條款需要取得董事會的正式核准。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"When do **negotiations** begin?","zh":"談判什麼時候開始？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Next Monday. The **merger** will create new opportunities for business growth, according to the **stakeholder analysis**. We need **board approval** for the **acquisition terms**.","zh":"下週一。根據利益相關者分析，這次合併將為業務成長創造新機會。我們需要董事會批准收購條款。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Negotiations","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"談判、協商","syn":"discussions = talks = bargaining","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Merger","pos":"n.","zh":"合併、併購","syn":"consolidation = combination = union","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Stakeholder analysis","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"利益相關者分析","syn":"participant assessment = party interests review","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Board approval","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"董事會批准","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Acquisition terms","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"收購條款","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：與供應商談判以降低材料成本","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"為降低材料成本而積極與數家供應商談判，利用策略聯盟優勢取得更佳談判籌碼。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"I agree. We're negotiating with several **suppliers** to reduce **material costs**, and this **alliance** could give us better **leverage**. The contract includes **resource sharing** and **cooperation** on **three major projects**.","zh":"我同意。我們正在與幾家供應商談判以降低材料成本，而這個聯盟能給我們更好的槓桿效應（談判籌碼）。合約包括資源共享以及在三個重大專案上的合作。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Suppliers","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"供應商","syn":"vendors = providers","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Material costs","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"材料成本","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Alliance","pos":"n.","zh":"聯盟","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Leverage","pos":"n.","zh":"槓桿效應/優勢籌碼","syn":"negotiation edge = advantage","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Resource sharing","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"資源共享","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Cooperation","pos":"n.","zh":"合作","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Three major projects","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"三個重大專案","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"數量記憶：合約中明確寫定是 3 個 重大專案，不是 4 個。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：策略聯盟將使雙方顯著受益","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認本次策略聯盟將能最大化整合資源，實現兩家企業的共贏。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Perfect. This **strategic alliance** will benefit both companies significantly.","zh":"太完美了。這個策略聯盟將使兩家公司顯著受益。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Strategic alliance","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"策略聯盟","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：聯盟簽署與合併採購力公告 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布簽署技術資源共享夥伴協議","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"高階主管向全體成員宣布一項重大企業戰略規劃：與合作方簽署合約。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Good morning, everyone. I'm here to announce a significant development in our **strategic planning**. Both companies signed a **partnership agreement** to share **technology resources**, marking the beginning of an exciting **collaboration**. This **joint venture** represents months of careful **negotiation** with key **stakeholders**.","zh":"大家早上好。我今天來是要宣布我們策略規劃中的一項重大進展。兩家公司簽署了共享技術資源的合作協議，標誌著令人興奮之合作的開始。這家合資企業代表了與關鍵利益相關者數月謹慎談判的成果。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Strategic planning","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"策略規劃","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Stakeholders","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"利益相關者/權益關係人","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　包含股東、董事會及合作夥伴。聽力中常設「談判對象不清」地雷，分清供應商 (suppliers)、合作夥伴 (partners) 與利益相關者 (stakeholders)。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：運用合併採購力與供應商議價","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"營運優化與成本控制中，利用策略聯盟取得更強大的議價優勢。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"The **merger** will create new opportunities for business growth across all divisions. We're negotiating with several **suppliers** to reduce **material costs** by leveraging our **combined purchasing power**.","zh":"這次合併將為所有部門的業務成長創造新機會。我們正在與幾家供應商談判，透過運用我們合併後的採購力來降低材料成本。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Combined purchasing power","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合併採購力","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　核心考點　此為策略聯盟與整合的最核心效益之一（consolidated purchasing agreements）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：定義合約保障條款與收購焦點","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"合約細節涵蓋技術資源共享、網路擴張及研究專案，並確保在互惠的原則下保護雙方權益。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"The **alliance** includes **resource sharing**, **network expansion**, and **cooperation** on **research projects**. Our **acquisition strategy** focuses on companies that **complement** our existing **capabilities**. The **contract terms** ensure **mutual benefit** while protecting both parties' interests.","zh":"聯盟包括資源共享、網絡擴張以及在研究專案上的合作。我們的收購策略專注於與我們現有能力互補的公司。合約條款在保護雙方利益的同時，確保了互惠互利。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Network expansion","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"網絡擴張","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Research projects","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"研究專案/研發項目","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Acquisition strategy","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"收購策略","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Complement","pos":"v.","zh":"補充、使互補/完善","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Capabilities","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"能力、資源實力","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Mutual benefit","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"互惠互利/雙贏","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：召開利益相關者執行細節會議","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認聯盟已確實強化市場地位，並宣布於下週召開利益相關者大會。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"This **partnership** strengthens our **market position** through **strategic resource integration**. **Stakeholder meetings** will begin next week to discuss **implementation details**.","zh":"夥伴關係透過策略資源整合強化了我們的市場地位。利益相關者會議將於下週開始，討論具體的實施細節。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Strategic resource integration","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"策略資源整合","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Stakeholder meetings","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"利益相關者會議","syn":"shareholder conference = general assembly","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Implementation details","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"實施/執行細節","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：兩大企業策略聯盟官方新聞稿 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：發布歷史性策略聯盟公告","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"GlobalTech 與 Innovation Corp 正式宣布簽署共享協議，此合併在業界被譽為歷史性的里程碑。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Release","t":"FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE","zh":"即時發布"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Transform","pos":"v.","zh":"改造、使徹底改變","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Technology sector","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"科技領域/科技界","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Regulatory approval","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"監管批准","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　解題插題技巧　—[1]— 是談論策略聯盟評價的最佳位置。若選項為 \"This represents the largest resource integration in technology history\" （此為科技史上最大規模的資源整合），應插入於此。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：兩年內營收增長40%的預測","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"預估在完成戰略重組後兩年內，將能實現大跨步的業務營收增長。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Release","t":"The **merger** will create new opportunities for business growth, with **projected revenues** increasing by **40%** **within two years**. —[2]—. This **joint venture** combines GlobalTech's **manufacturing expertise** with Innovation Corp's **research capabilities**. The **acquisition** of smaller **suppliers** strengthens our **resource base** significantly.","zh":"合併將為業務成長創造新機會，預計營收將在兩年內增加 40%。—[2]—。這家合資企業結合了環球科技的製造專長與創新公司的研究能力。對較小供應商的收購顯著強化了我們的資源基礎。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Projected revenues","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預估營收/預測收入","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"40%","pos":"n.","zh":"百分之四十","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"數據混亂：預期效益是「2年內營收成長40%」！不可與其他成本降低數據混淆。"},{"w":"Within two years","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"兩年之內","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Manufacturing expertise","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"製造專長","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Research capabilities","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"研究能力/研發實力","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Resource base","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"資源基礎","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：與跨15國150家供應商建立統一採購","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"與供應商談判以整合資源，使供應商網絡擴展至 15 國共 150 家規模。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Release","t":"We're negotiating with several **suppliers** to reduce **material costs** through **consolidated purchasing agreements**. —[3]—. The **alliance** enables better **negotiation leverage** and ensures **stable resource availability**. Our **expanded network** now includes **150 suppliers** across **fifteen countries**.","zh":"我們正在與幾家供應商談判，以透過統一採購協議降低材料成本。—[3]—。該聯盟實現了更好的談判槓桿，並確保了穩定的資源供應。我們擴展後的網絡現在包括跨越 15 個國家的 150 家供應商。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Consolidated purchasing agreements","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"統一採購協議","syn":"bulk buying contracts = unified supply chain agreements","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Stable resource availability","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"穩定的資源供應","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"150 suppliers","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"150家供應商","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Fifteen countries","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"15個國家","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　高頻考點　記住「15 國、150 供應商」的規模，此為資源整合的具體指標。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：於月底前完成合約並交付審查","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"重申合約內容包含技術轉移與資源優化，並指出預計於月底完成最終合約。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Release","t":"**Stakeholder value** remains our primary focus throughout this **integration**. —[4]—. The **cooperation agreement** includes provisions for **technology transfer**, **resource optimization**, and **market expansion**. **Contract finalization** is expected by **month-end**, pending **regulatory approval**.","zh":"在整個整合過程中，利益相關者的價值仍然是我們的首要關注點。—[4]—。合作協議包括技術轉移、資源優化和市場擴展的條款。合約預計在月底前完成，目前正在等待監管部門的批准。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Technology transfer","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"技術轉移","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Resource optimization","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"資源優化","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Contract finalization","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合約定案/最終簽署","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Month-end","pos":"n.","zh":"月底","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　時間線索　合約定案在月底，但談判（negotiations）在下週一開始。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"16-3","title":"營運優化與技術升級：效率與創新 (Operations Optimization & Technology Upgrade: Efficiency & Innovation)","ch":"Chapter 16　企業發展","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch16-1 ～ Ch16-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch16-3 企業發展場景-營運優化與技術升級.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：自動化專案報告與系統週末安裝 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：分析現狀與識別營運效率挑戰","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理詢問新自動化專案進展，說明此技術升級的預估生產力成效。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Have you seen the report on our new **automation project**? The new **software system** will **increase productivity** by **twenty percent**.","zh":"你看過我們新自動化專案的報告了嗎？新軟體系統將提高百分之二十的生產力。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, it's impressive. The **technology upgrade** should improve our **overall efficiency**.","zh":"是的，令人印象深刻。技術升級應該能改善我們的整體效率。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Automation project","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動化專案","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Software system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"軟體系統","syn":"platform = application = program","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Increase productivity","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提高生產力","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Twenty percent","pos":"n.","zh":"百分之二十","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"百分比記憶：新軟體帶來的生產力提升明確預計為 20%，不可記錯。"},{"w":"Technology upgrade","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"技術升級","syn":"modernization = process improvement","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Overall efficiency","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"整體效率","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：規劃維護排程與實施時程","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認系統上線實施的具體時間（下週），並協調先進行例行設備維護，再安裝新系統。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"When will the **implementation** begin?","zh":"實施什麼時候開始？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Next week. **Regular equipment maintenance** helps maintain **operational efficiency**, so we're scheduling that first.","zh":"下週。定期設備維護有助於維持營運效率，所以我們安排先進行維護。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Implementation","pos":"n.","zh":"實施、執行上線","syn":"deployment = integration rollout","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Regular equipment maintenance","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"定期設備維護","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間順序：根據講義，營運流程的正確執行順序為：「先進行設備維護 (maintenance)，接著才在週末安裝系統 (installation)，最後進行員工培訓 (training)」。順序不可顛倒。"},{"w":"Operational efficiency","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"營運效率","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：利用週末安裝以最小化營運干擾","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"安排在週末（weekend）安裝新軟體，以達到將公司營運中斷干擾降到最低的目標。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Then we'll **install** the new system during the **weekend** to **minimize disruption** to operations.","zh":"然後我們將在週末安裝新系統，以將對營運的干擾降到最低。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Install","pos":"v.","zh":"安裝","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Weekend","pos":"n.","zh":"週末","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　關鍵時間點　安裝新系統的黃金時間是 weekend。","trap":""},{"w":"Minimize disruption","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"將干擾降至最低","syn":"ensure minimal interruption = prevent operations halt","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引進專家進行三日員工培訓","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引進外部專家監督實施，並對員工提供為期三天的實踐練習培訓。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"What about employee training on the new process?","zh":"那員工在新流程上的培訓呢？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"All staff will receive training on the upgraded **technology platform**. The solution includes **three days of hands-on practice** to ensure **smooth performance**. We're bringing in **specialists** to oversee the maintenance and implementation phases.","zh":"所有員工都將接受升級技術平台的培訓。該解決方案包括三天的實踐練習，以確保運作順暢。我們正在引進專家來監督維護和實施階段。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Technology platform","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"技術平台","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Three days of hands-on practice","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"三天的實踐練習","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　培訓計畫包含 three days 的操作演練（hands-on practice）。","trap":""},{"w":"Smooth performance","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"順暢運行/良好表現","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Specialists","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"專家","syn":"expert consultants = technical advisors","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：提升營運效率與維護排程倡議 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布大升級，預估提升二成效率","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"營運長向團隊宣布啟動重大自動化升級計畫，此系統將提昇 20% 生產力。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Good morning, team. I'm here to discuss our **operational efficiency initiative**. The new **software system** will **increase productivity** by **twenty percent** according to our **projections**. This **technology upgrade** represents a major investment in **automation** and **process improvement**.","zh":"團隊同仁早上好。我今天來是要討論我們的營運效率倡議。根據我們的預測，新軟體系統將提高百分之二十的生產力。這次技術升級代表了在自動化和流程改善方面的一筆重大投資。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Operational efficiency initiative","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"營運效率倡議/計畫","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Projections","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"預測、估算","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Automation","pos":"n.","zh":"自動化","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Process improvement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"流程改善/流程優化","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：每月服務檢查與為期六週的分階段實施","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布新方案包含即刻開始的每月定期維護，且整個轉換過渡期為期六週。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Regular equipment maintenance helps maintain operational efficiency, which is why we've scheduled **monthly service checks** starting immediately. All staff will receive training on the upgraded **technology platform** beginning Monday. The **implementation timeline** spans **six weeks**, with different departments transitioning to the new system in **phases**.","zh":"定期設備維護有助於維持營運效率，這就是為什麼我們安排了立即開始的每月服務檢查。所有員工將從週一開始接受升級技術平台的培訓。實施時程跨越六週，不同的部門將分階段過渡到新系統。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Monthly service checks","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月服務/維護檢查","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Implementation timeline","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"實施時程/上線進度","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Six weeks","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"六週","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"實施期程：整個上線實施的過渡時程為 six weeks，多益常故意寫成「六個月（six months）」來誤導沒聽清楚的考生。"},{"w":"Phases","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"階段/期程","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：引進自動化功能與系統培訓內容","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"新系統將重點解決上季審查中發現的瓶頸，培訓內容將涵蓋導航、維護與排除故障。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Our **solution** addresses current **performance gaps** identified in last quarter's **operations review**. The **software** includes **advanced automation features** that will **streamline** daily processes. Training sessions will cover **system navigation**, **maintenance procedures**, and **troubleshooting**.","zh":"我們的解決方案解決了上季營運審查中識別出的當前績效缺口。該軟體包括先進的自動化功能，將簡化日常流程。培訓課程將涵蓋系統導航、維護程序和故障排除。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Performance gaps","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"績效缺口/表現不足之處","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Operations review","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"營運審查/營運評估","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Advanced automation features","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"先進的自動化功能","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Streamline","pos":"v.","zh":"簡化、使高效","syn":"simplify = make more efficient","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"System navigation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"系統導航/系統介面操作","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Maintenance procedures","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"維護程序","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Troubleshooting","pos":"n.","zh":"故障排除","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　核心要點　培訓的三大核心內容即為：navigation, maintenance, troubleshooting。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：微調過渡並預告最終成效","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提醒團隊在優化升級的過渡期間，需做好臨時調整的準備。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Please prepare for **temporary adjustments** as we **optimize** our **operations** through this **upgrade**.","zh":"當我們透過這次升級優化我們的營運時，請做好臨時調整的準備。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Temporary adjustments","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"臨時調整","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Optimize","pos":"v.","zh":"優化、使完善","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：營運長致經理之升級倡議備忘錄 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布歐洲試點測試成功，即將引進新系統","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"營運長Thomas Park寫信宣布重大營運改善計畫：依據歐洲成功的試點，新系統將提升 20% 生產力。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Memo","t":"To: All Department Managers","zh":"收件者：所有部門經理"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Operational improvement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"營運改善","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Pilot testing","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"試點測試/先期測試","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　解題關鍵　本系統已在「歐洲營運（European operations）」中完成了試點測試。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：與TechServ外包商合作，確保每季維護","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"為落實設備維護以維持效率，公司已與外部承包商 TechServ Solutions 簽約提供支援。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Memo","t":"Our **technology upgrade** includes **full automation** of **inventory management** and customer service processes. —[2]—. Regular equipment maintenance helps maintain operational efficiency, so we've contracted with **TechServ Solutions** for **ongoing support**. The **implementation schedule** accommodates each department's unique requirements.","zh":"我們的技術升級包括庫庫存管理和客戶服務流程的全面自動化。—[2]—。定期設備維護有助於維持營運效率，因此我們已與 TechServ Solutions 簽約以提供持續的支援。實施進度表適應了每個部門的獨特需求。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Full automation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"全面自動化","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Inventory management","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"庫存管理","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"TechServ Solutions","pos":"n.","zh":"泰克服解決方案公司","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"支援來源：TechServ 是一家「外部承包商 (external contractor)」，多益若寫成「內部 IT 團隊（internal team）」則為常見的角色混淆。"},{"w":"Ongoing support","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"持續支援","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Implementation schedule","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"實施/執行進度表","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：提供實際案例實踐練習確保成功採用","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"為確保順利採用（successful adoption），培訓將專注於實際應用與真實營運案例練習。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Memo","t":"All staff will receive training on the upgraded **technology platform** to ensure **successful adoption**. —[3]—. Sessions will focus on **practical application**, with **hands-on exercises** using real **operation scenarios**. **Performance metrics** will be monitored throughout the **transition** to measure **efficiency gains**.","zh":"所有員工都將接受升級技術平台的培訓，以確保成功採用。—[3]—。培訓課程將專注於實際應用，並使用真實的營運場景進行實踐練習。整個過渡期內都將監控績效指標，以衡量效率增益。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Successful adoption","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"成功採用/成功導入","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Practical application","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"實際應用","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Hands-on exercises","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"實踐練習/動手演練","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Operation scenarios","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"營運場景/實際工作情境","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Performance metrics","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"績效指標","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Transition","pos":"n.","zh":"過渡期、轉換期","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Efficiency gains","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"效率增益","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：預計八個月內回收技術投資成本","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認新解決方案預期在 8 個月內透過節省成本實現回收，將投資與維護費納入總投資包。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Memo","t":"The **solution** we've selected addresses multiple **operational challenges** identified in our recent assessment. —[4]—. **Initial implementation costs** will be **offset** by **projected efficiency savings** within **eight months**. **Maintenance contracts** and **training resources** are included in the **total investment package**.","zh":"我們選擇的解決方案解決了我們最近評估中識別出的多個營運挑戰。—[4]—。初始實施成本將在八個月內被預估的效率節省所抵消。維護合約和培訓資源都已包含在總投資方案中。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Operational challenges","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"營運挑戰","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Initial implementation costs","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"初始實施成本","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Offset","pos":"v.","zh":"抵消、彌補","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Projected efficiency savings","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預期效率節省","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Eight months","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"八個月","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　成效指標　投資回收期預計為 eight months。","trap":""},{"w":"Maintenance contracts","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"維護合約","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Training resources","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"培訓資源","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Total investment package","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"總投資方案","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　解題插題技巧　—[4]— 是放總結陳述的最佳位置。若選項為 \"This integrated approach ensures minimal disruption while maximizing long-term benefit\" （這種整合方法在最大化長期利益的同時，確保了干擾最小化），應插入於此。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"16-4","title":"策略擴張與資本投資：成長與建設 (Strategic Expansion & Capital Investment: Growth & Construction)","ch":"Chapter 16　企業發展","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch16-1 ～ Ch16-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch16-4 企業發展場景-策張與資本投資略擴.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：總部配送設施與500萬預算 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布總部策略擴張與新配送設施計畫","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"員工討論總部傳來的重大新聞：董事會已核准新建一座大型配送設施。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Did you hear the news from headquarters? The **board approved** plans to build a new **distribution facility**.","zh":"你聽到總部的消息了嗎？董事會批准了建設新配送設施的計畫。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, it's part of our **growth strategy**. The location will be near the airport for better **warehouse access**.","zh":"是的，這是我們成長策略的一部分。地點將會靠近機場，以便有更好的倉庫進出通道。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Board approved","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"董事會批准","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Distribution facility","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"配送設施/物流中心","syn":"logistics hub = shipping center","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Growth strategy","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"成長/發展策略","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Warehouse access","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"倉庫進出通道/倉庫進出權限","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　多益高頻考點　地點選在機場附近（near the airport）的原因是「為了更好的倉庫進出通道」。此因果關係常考。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：確認500萬投資預算與明年分店目標","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"詢問本專案的資金規模，並透露除了配送設施外，明年還計畫開設三家分公司。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"What about the **investment budget**?","zh":"那投資預算呢？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"The **construction project** requires **$5 million**. Our **expansion strategy** includes opening **three branches** next year, so we need significant **capital**.","zh":"建設專案需要 500 萬美元。我們的擴張策略包括明年開設三家分公司，所以我們需要龐大的資金。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Investment budget","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"投資預算","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Construction project","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"建設專案","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"$5 million","pos":"n.","zh":"500萬美元","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"金額混淆：Part 3 對話提及的建設預算是 500 萬美元 ($5M)；而 Part 4 獨白為 1,000 萬美元 ($10M)；Part 7 閱讀理解則是總投資 2,500 萬美元 ($25M)。金額必須看清文章對照。"},{"w":"Expansion strategy","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"擴張策略","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Three branches","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"三家分公司/三家分店","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"數量記憶：計畫開設的分店數量為 3 家，不是 4 家。"},{"w":"Capital","pos":"n.","zh":"資本、資金","syn":"funding = expenditure = financial resources","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：工廠翻新以倍增產能","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明為了因應策略擴張，現有工廠將進行翻新，且翻新完工後產能將直接翻倍。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's ambitious. How will this affect our current factory operations?","zh":"這真是野心勃勃。這會如何影響我們目前的工廠營運？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"The **factory renovation project** will **double our production capacity**. Once the new facility is complete, we can handle increased **distribution demands**.","zh":"工廠翻新專案將使我們的產能翻倍。一旦新設施完工，我們就能處理增加的配送需求。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Factory renovation project","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"工廠翻新專案","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Double our production capacity","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"使我們的產能翻倍","syn":"increase capacity by 100% = twice the manufacturing volume","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Distribution demands","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"配送需求/物流需求","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：預估在所有市場取得強勁成長","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認這套積極的設施與翻新投資，將為公司在所有新市場帶來極佳的成長。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"The plan shows strong potential for **growth** in all markets.","zh":"該計劃顯示出在所有市場都有強勁的成長潛力。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Growth","pos":"n.","zh":"成長、擴張","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：資本投資與18個月完工進度公告 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：對投資人簡報工業區配送設施計畫","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"高階主管向投資人發表簡報，宣布在工業區建設新物流設施，預算為 1000 萬美元。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Good afternoon, investors. I'm pleased to present our **capital investment update**. The board approved plans to build a new **distribution facility** in the **industrial district**. This expansion represents a **$10 million investment** in our infrastructure.","zh":"投資人下午好。我很榮幸能向大家報告我們的資本投資更新。董事會批准了在工業區建設新配送設施的計劃。這次擴張代表了我們在基礎設施上的 1,000 萬美元投資。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Capital investment update","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"資本投資更新/簡報","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Industrial district","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"工業區","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"$10 million investment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"1,000萬美元的投資","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　財務焦點　Part 4 獨白的投資預算為 10 million（1,000 萬美元）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：明年開設三家區域分店計畫","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"重申明年將於不同區域開設三家新分店，此為策略成長的關鍵一步。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Our **expansion strategy** includes opening **three branches** next year across different regions. The **factory renovation project** will **double our production capacity** by **December**.","zh":"我們的擴張策略包括明年在不同地區開設三家分公司。工廠翻新專案將在 12 月前使我們的產能翻倍。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"December","pos":"n.","zh":"十二月","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　關鍵時間點　產能翻倍的預定目標期限為 December（十二月）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：開工與 18 個月完工期時程管理","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明主要工程將於下個月開工，並預期在 18 個月（一年半）內完工上線。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Each new location will feature **state-of-the-art warehouse technology** to improve **distribution efficiency**. **Construction** on the main facility begins **next month**, with **completion** expected within **eighteen months**.","zh":"每個新地點都將配備最先進的倉庫技術，以提高配送效率。主要設施的建設將於下個月開始，預計在 18 個月內完工。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"State-of-the-art warehouse technology","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"最先進的倉庫技術","syn":"modern logistics systems = cutting-edge storage technology","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Distribution efficiency","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"配送/物流效率","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Construction","pos":"n.","zh":"建設、施工","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Next month","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"下個月","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　開工時間　建設工程預計在 next month 開始。","trap":""},{"w":"Completion","pos":"n.","zh":"完工、竣工","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Eighteen months","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"18個月","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間錯配：開工時間是下個月，但「完工期限」是 18 個月內 (within 18 months)！不可與開工時間或明年開分店混淆。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：總部將全面監督工程以捕獲市場機會","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認總部（headquarters）將全面監督工程，以在新市場中建立最優勢的競爭地位。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Spkr","t":"Our **headquarters** will oversee all project phases to ensure **strategic alignment**. This growth plan positions us to **capture** **emerging market opportunities**. The investment includes upgrading existing branches and establishing new **distribution networks**. Thank you for your continued support of our expansion strategy.","zh":"我們的總部將監督所有專案階段，以確保策略一致。這一成長計劃使我們能夠捕捉新興市場的機會。該投資包括升級現有分公司和建立新的配送網絡。感謝您對我們擴張策略的持續支持。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Headquarters","pos":"n.","zh":"總部","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Strategic alignment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"策略一致/策略契合","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Capture","pos":"v.","zh":"捕獲、佔領 (市場)","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Emerging market opportunities","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新興市場機會","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Distribution networks","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"配送網絡/物流網絡","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：執行長致股東之策略擴張與 2500 萬投資備忘錄 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：向股東發布歷年最大之資本投資改善","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"執行長Michael Chang向全體股東報告重大戰略計劃：董事會核准新建配送設施。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Memo","t":"To: All Shareholders","zh":"收件者：所有股東"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Capital investment program","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"資本投資計畫","syn":"capital allocation blueprint = financial expansion program","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Board approved","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"董事會批准的","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：明年在大都市開設三家區域分公司","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"擴張方案包括明年在主要大都市開設三家新分店，總投資金額預估高達 2500 萬美元。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Memo","t":"Our **expansion strategy** includes opening **three branches** next year in key **metropolitan areas**. —[2]—. Each location has been carefully selected based on market analysis and **growth potential**. The investment totals **$25 million** across all projects, including **headquarters renovations**.","zh":"我們的擴張策略包括明年在關鍵大都市地區開設三家分公司。—[2]—。每個地點都是根據市場分析和成長潛力精心挑選的。所有專案的投資總額達 2,500 萬美元，其中包括總部的翻新。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Metropolitan areas","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"大都市地區","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Growth potential","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"成長潛力","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"$25 million","pos":"n.","zh":"2,500萬美元","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　財務焦點　Part 7 閱讀理解中，包含配送設施、分店與總部翻新的「總投資預算」高達 25 million（2,500 萬美元）。","trap":""},{"w":"Headquarters renovations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"總部翻新","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　解題插題技巧　—[2]— 是放人才資本或總部翻新細節的最佳位置。若選項為 \"This investment in our human capital and facilities will lay the foundation for long-term growth\" （這項在我們人力資本與設施上的投資，將為長期成長奠定基礎），應插入於此。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：翻新現有工廠以克服產能限制","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"採取翻新現有工廠的行動，使製造產能翻倍，以解決當前的產能限制問題。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Memo","t":"The **factory renovation project** will **double our production capacity**, addressing current **limitations**. —[3]—. This increased capacity will support our **expanded distribution network** and new branch operations. **Construction timelines** have been coordinated to **minimize disruption** to ongoing operations.","zh":"工廠翻新專案將使我們的產能翻倍，解決目前的限制。—[3]—。增加的產能將支持我們擴展的配送網絡和新分公司的營運。建設時程已經協調好，以盡量減少對正在進行之營運的干擾。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Limitations","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"限制、不足之處","syn":"capacity constraints = bottlenecks","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Expanded distribution network","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"擴展後的配送網絡","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Construction timelines","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"建設/施工時程","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：兩年內實現營收成長30%與運輸成本調降","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認財務成效預測：工程完工後，兩年內營收預估增長 30%，並透過配送點整合降低運輸成本。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Memo","t":"**Strategic planning** indicates **30% revenue growth** **within two years**. —[4]—. The new warehouse facilities will reduce **shipping costs** by **consolidating** **distribution points**. Our **project management team** will provide **quarterly updates** on expansion progress.","zh":"策略規劃顯示兩年內將實現 30% 的營收成長。—[4]—。新的倉庫設施將透過整合配送點來降低運輸成本。我們的專案管理團隊將提供關於擴張進度的季度更新。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"30% revenue growth","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"30%的營收成長","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"成長預測混淆：翻新工廠使「產能翻倍 (capacity doubled)」；而預期成效是「2年內營收成長30% (30% revenue growth)」！兩者比例不同，是高頻的對照干擾點。"},{"w":"Shipping costs","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"運輸成本、運費","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Consolidating","pos":"v.","zh":"整合、合併","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Distribution points","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"配送點/分銷點","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Project management team","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"專案管理團隊","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Quarterly updates","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每季更新/季度報告","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""}]}]}];